:"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"The alternator generates and regulates power for the device. A strange corrosion seeps through it, preventing it from working.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ENERGY2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.energy2.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH23_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH23_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH23","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_MM_PCAT","name":"AMBROSIAL CURSE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Writhing, Roiling Batter. Some caution is advised.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CCAKEEVIL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.ccakeevil.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_MM_PCAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_MM","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":199200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_MM_PCAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CP_HONEY","name":"AMBROSIAL WONDER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Thick, Sweet Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKEBLOB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cakeblob.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CP_HONEY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CB","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":62200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CP_HONEY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BIO","name":"AMINO CHAMBER","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Crafted Technology Component","description":"A specialist biological catalysation device. This unit takes advantage of naturally occurring enzymes in order to facilitate increased energy yields and faster processing in a wide range of advanced technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BIO.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.bio.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BIO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BIO_DESC","secondary":"Catalyst","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":2,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BIO","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BANNER_AMINO","name":"AMINO HUB BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in support of community, adventure and discovery. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BANNER.AMINO.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.banner.amino.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_AMINO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_AMINO_DESC","s