 vehicle, compatible with the Colossus large Exocraft. Recalibrate Exocraft visuals from the Colossus Geobay.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.TRUCKCAB03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.truckcab03.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRUCK_CAB03_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRUCK_CAB_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRUCK_CAB03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S_SAIL2","name":"ASYMMETRICAL SAILS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"These asymmetrical sails replicate the design of the ancient maritime trade vessels of the Gek, and make for a striking nautical-themed home decoration.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.S_SAIL_2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.s_sail_2.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_S_SAIL2_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_S_SAIL2_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S_SAIL2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HDRIVEBOOST4","name":"ATLANTID DRIVE","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships","categoryKey":"AllShips","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Hyperdrive Upgrade: Purple Systems","description":"Sideloads a resonant memory packet into your warp computer, allowing the ship to pass through the dissonant space surrounding purple stellar bodies. User is advised to access Hyperdrive systems via the Galactic Map.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/TECHNOLOGY.PURPLEDRIVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/technology.purpledrive.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"HYP_ACCESS4_NAME","descriptionKey":"RGB_WARP_4_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/HDRIVEBOOST4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER10B","name":"ATLANTID POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster depicts the ethereal substance that spills from the bodies of corrupted Sentinels as they fall.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER10B.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster10b.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER10B_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER10B_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER10B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_ROBO_CORE","name":"ATLANTID REACTOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Salvaged Autophage Component","description":"The central reactor unit and primary fuel source for a primitive automaton. Plans for this unit were extracted from an autophage left at an abandoned junker's camp.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.S10.ROBOTCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.s10.robotcore.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_S10_ROBO_CORE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_S10_ROBO_CORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":16000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_ROBO_CORE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROBOT2","name":"ATLANTIDEUM","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Disharmonic Metal","description":"This ethereal substance spills from the bodies of corrupted Sentinels as they fall, a shower of prismatic grains seeking out their next host. It evades all attempts to contain it, as if it had a will of its own, a strong desire for its own freedom. It possesses a crystalline beauty that cannot be reconciled with the corruption from whence it flows.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.ROBOT.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.robot.2.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROBOT2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ROBOT2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":138,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/ROBOT2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_PART_B","name":"ATLANTIDEUM CHAMBER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Voltaic Component","description":"A compact box of circuitry and ethereal crystals, painstakingly wired by hand. One of three core components, this forms the core of a traditional Autophage Voltaic Staff.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/STAFFPARTB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/staffpartb.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_PART_B_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_PART_B_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":646,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_PART_B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ODD_LEG_M1","name":"ATLANTIDIAN CRAB","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Legendary Fish","description":"\"Shell and claw of perfect crystal, eyestalks aglow with purple rage; a being displaced from another reality and cast here as crab.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.CRAB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.crab.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_LEG_M1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_LEG_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":100000,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ODD_LEG_M1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S_POSTER17","name":"ATLAS CAKE POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster depicts a delightfully moist cream cake, emblazoned with the symbol of the Atlas.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.S_POSTER17.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.s_poster17.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_S_POSTER17_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_S_POSTER17_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S_POSTER17","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BOBBLE_ATLAS","name":"ATLAS FIGURINE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Interior Adornment","description":"A synthetic polymer adornment for your starship's cockpit, fashioned in the likeness of an Atlas Interface. Install to an Inventory Slot to decorate your ship's interior.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BOBBLEATLAS.DDS","previ