op this fused pillar of bone and circuitry. Beware its gaze... Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S18.STAFF.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s18.staff.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPED_STAFF_18_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPED_STAFF_18_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_STAFF_18","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BANNER02","name":"BEACHHEAD EXPEDITION BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in commemoration of the 'Beachhead' Expedition, and your success in tracking the renegade historical echo. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.BANNER02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.banner02.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_02_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_02_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BANNER02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_DECAL02","name":"BEACHHEAD EXPEDITION DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal commemorates the collective effort of the Travellers in mapping the Histiographical Flux and tracking the renegade echo during the Beachhead Expedition.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.DECAL02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.decal02.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_02_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_02_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_DECAL02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DRONE_PART_P","name":"BEADS OF GLASS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Drone Component","description":"A handful of glassy orbs, once owned by Specialist Polo. Their pearlescent surface does not reflect the world around them, offering instead a mirror to different reality. A valuable and exotic component, this would be of great use to Iteration: Tethys in repairing the shattered Drone.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DRONEPARTPOLO.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.dronepartpolo.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_DRONE_PART_POLO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_DRONE_PART_POLO_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DRONE_PART_P","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_DUSTPLANT1","name":"BEWITCHING CACTUS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"Elegant feathery filaments run around this desert plant, increasing the surface area for moisture absorption. They also look very fetching. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DUSTPLANT01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.dustplant01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DUSTPLANT_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DUSTPLANT_1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_DUSTPLANT1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DUST_EPIC_M1","name":"BEWITCHING CANDLEFISH","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Rare Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DUST_EPIC_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BIG.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.big.3.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_EPIC_M1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_EPIC_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":20000,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DUST_EPIC_M1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER19C","name":"BIG RIG POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster by an unknown artist playfully references the oversized frames of Corvette starships.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S19.POSTERC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s19.posterc.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER19C_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER19C_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER19C","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TOX_COM_S1","name":"BILEWORM","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT4.FISH.WORM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product4.fish.worm.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":1000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TOX_COM_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PROC_BIO","name":"Bio Sample (procedural)","kind":"Procedural item","category":"Bio Sample","categoryKey":"Bio Sample","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Biological Sample","description":"Biological Sample","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TREASUREPROD.WEIRDSEEDS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/treasureprod.weirdseeds.webp","colour":"#1fb80a","source":"PROCEDURALPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ITEMGEN_FORMAT_BIO","descriptionKey":"BIO_SUB","secondary":"Procedural","tags":["Generated name and value"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/procedural-item/PROC_BIO","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH5","name":"BIO-INPUT SENSOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"An advanced control unit, designed to allow device/flesh interaction. Damage prevents it functioning correctly. Interfacing while it is in this state is not advised.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MAINTTECH.TECH5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mainttech.tech5.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GC