d from its years of drifting in the water when it became entangled in a fishing lure. Of little use to anyone.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.CORAL.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.coral.1.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_CORAL1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Trade good"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TRASH_4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DEEP_COM_XL","name":"BLEACHED OCTOPUS","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DEEP_COM_XL_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT2.FISH.OCTOPUS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product2.fish.octopus.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_COM_XL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_COM_XL_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DEEP_COM_XL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BANNER06","name":"BLIGHTED EXPEDITION BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in commemoration of the 'Blighted' Expedition, the glorious retrieval of ill-gotten lucre, and the discovery of a pirate secret. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.BANNER06.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.banner06.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_06_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_06_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BANNER06","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_DECAL06","name":"BLIGHTED EXPEDITION DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal commemorates completion of the Blighted expedition, the glorious retrieval of ill-gotten lucre, and the discovery of a pirate secret.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.DECAL06.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.decal06.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_06_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_06_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_DECAL06","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_LUSH_LEG_XL","name":"BLIND TITANCORE","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Legendary Fish","description":"\"The old man of the sea; scarred, blinded, still swimming on...\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.XL.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.xl.1.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_LEG_XL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_LEG_XL_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":200000,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_LUSH_LEG_XL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TOX_COM_M1","name":"BLISTERING EEL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT4.FISH.EEL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product4.fish.eel.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_M1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":2000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TOX_COM_M1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_TOXPLANT01","name":"BLISTERING MUSHROOM","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This swollen protuberance grows rapidly from a fine network of underground spores. Greatly improves nearby soil quality. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TOXPLANT01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.toxplant01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_TOXPLANT_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_TOXPLANT_1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_TOXPLANT01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_SUBZPLANT5","name":"BLIZZARD'S ARCH PLANT","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A dimorphic plant with fleshy, hair-covered foliage, tending to accumulate a covering of snow, and more delicate secondary leaves to attract pollinating wildlife. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.SUBZPLANT5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.subzplant5.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_SUBZPLANT_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_SUBZPLANT_5_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_SUBZPLANT5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DEEP_RARE_M1","name":"BLOATED EEL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.MEDIUM.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.medium.2.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_M1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DEEP_RARE_M1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ILLEGAL_PROD1","name":"BLOOD SALT","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Smuggled Goods","description":"Jars of murky, foul-smelling crystals. Produced in viscous evaporation traps, these organic salts are used in the manufacture of illegal pheromones. Purchase is illegal at nearly all galactic trade terminals. Regular supply is only available within outlaw systems. Selling banned goods into commercially-regulated space may be highly profitable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SMUGGLING1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.smuggling1.webp","colour":"#383838","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ILLEGAL_PROD1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ILLEGAL_PROD1_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":2000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ILLEGAL_PROD1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BAIT_MEAT_4","name":"BLOODY ORGAN","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Carnivore Bait","description":"A specialist bait for carnivores. Use the Analysis Visor to discover the bait preferences of specific creatures. Created in a Nutrient Processor from Mordite and assorted creature flesh. Feeding using the correct bait will allow creatures to be ridden or harvested. It will also calm predators. Chose bait type from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BAIT.ORGAN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.bait.organ.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BAIT_MEAT_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"BAIT_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BAIT_MEAT_4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WEAPSLOT_DMG2","name":"BLOWN TRANSISTOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Multi-Tool Component","description":"Multi-Tool subsystem critically damaged. Slot cannot be used until damage is repaired. Use to begin repair process. Repairing will free slot up for general use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/FARMPROD.4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/farmprod.4.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WEAPSLOT_DMG2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WEAPSLOT_DMG_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/WEAPSLOT_DMG2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREIGHT_BLUE","name":"BLUE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Freighter Customisation Option","description":"Unlocks this colour for freighter customisation. A self-replicating cloud of highly pigmatised nano-robots swarm the capital ship, changing its external appearance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FREIGHTPAINT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.freightpaint.webp","colour":"#1e93d0","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PAINT_BLUE_U","descriptionKey":"UI_PAINT_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREIGHT_BLUE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FIREWORK01","name":"BLUE FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"A luxury firework, rich in magnesium and indium. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.FIREWORK01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.firework01.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FIREWORK_PROD_BLUE_NAME","descriptionKey":"FIREWORK_PROD_BLUE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":50,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FIREWORK01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_SHIP1","name":"BLUE FLIGHT DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a starship launching into the great beyond.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.DECALSHIP1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.decalship1.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_SHIP1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_SHIP1_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_SHIP1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JETS_BLUE","name":"BLUE JETPACK TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Jetpack Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Indium injection nozzles add a dazzling blue flair to the Jetpack's output. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.JETS.BLUE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.jets.blue.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_BLUE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_BLUE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/JETS_BLUE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FIREWORK11","name":"BLUE RIBBON FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"This exotic firework, sparkling with indium and antimony elements, bursts into a cluster of wildly spiralling ribbons. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/IC