"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Supreme Boltcaster Upgrade","description":"A supremely powerful upgrade for the Boltcaster. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential upgrades include: damage output, reload times, clip size and firing rate.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.S.PROJECTIILE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.s.projectiile.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_BOLT4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_BOLT4_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_BOLT4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_BOLTBOUNCE","name":"BOLTCASTER RICOCHET MODULE","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Boltcaster Upgrade","description":"Creates an antimatter field around the shots of the Boltcaster, causing them to be repelled by non-damaged surfaces. Enables ricochet, causing projectiles to bounce if they hit a target they do not damage.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PROJECTILE1MOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.projectile1mod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_BOLTBOUNCE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_BOLTBOUNCE_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_BOLTBOUNCE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BOLT_SM","name":"BOLTCASTER SM","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Boltcaster Companion Unit","description":"Boltcaster shots deliver added physical damage upon impact. Grants additional kinetic energy to the user's ionised plasma distribution systems. Operates automatically once constructed within user's Multi-Tool inventory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PROJECTILE1MOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.projectile1mod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BOLT_SM_NAME","descriptionKey":"BOLTDMG1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade"],"baseValue":1,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/BOLT_SM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_STEW_FOSS","name":"BONE BROTH","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BONE.SOUP.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.bone.soup.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_FOSSIL_STEW_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":172000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_STEW_FOSS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_BONESOUP","name":"BONE BROTH DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a steaming, savoury bowl of bone broth.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICON