ST","name":"CACTUS FLESH","kind":"Resource","category":"Flora","categoryKey":"Flora","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Harvested Agricultural Substance","description":"Succulent, edible cactus flesh from the Echinocactus plant. As well as being juicy on the tongue, the flesh has many industrial uses. The Echinocactus thrives only on desert planets, but can be farmed in all environments with the aid of a Hydroponics Tray..","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.PLANT.DUSTY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.plant.dusty.webp","colour":"#239626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PLANTSUB_BARREN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PLANTSUB_BARREN_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":28,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/PLANT_DUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_JAM_DUST","name":"CACTUS JELLY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.JAM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.jam.webp","colour":"#db2400","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_JAM_DUST_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":2400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_JAM_DUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_P_DUSTFARM","name":"CACTUS NECTAR","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An edible plant, harvested from planetary flora. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.PLANT.DUSTFARM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.plant.dustfarm.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DUST_FARM_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_P_DUSTFARM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"RED2","name":"CADMIUM","kind":"Resource","category":"Stellar","categoryKey":"Stellar","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Refined Stellar Metal: Red","description":"A chromatic metal, generated by fusion in the heart of a star. Such stellar material ends up forming deposits in the crust of local planets. Cadmium is found on planets orbiting red stars, and can be placed in a Refiner to create purified Chromatic Metal for use in the manufacture of advanced technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.RED.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.red.2.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_RED2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_RED2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":83,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/RED2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HDRIVEBOOST1","name":"CADMIUM DRIVE","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"VeryRare","subtitle":"Hyperdrive Upgrade: Red Systems","description":"Upgrades the hyperdrive's core bounding magnets, preventing rapid disassembly when attempti