, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATSTEW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatstew.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BALL_STEW_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":6400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_STEW_BALL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_BUG","name":"CHEWY BISCUIT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_BUG_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":56000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_BUG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_ORGAN","name":"CHEWY ORGAN PIE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATPIE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatpie.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PIE_ORGAN_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":40000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_ORGAN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_V_ROBOT","name":"CHEWY WIRES","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"This odd collection of wires pulses with a faint, almost organic energy. It seems to remember the whole from which it was parted... Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate 'edible' products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BAIT.WORMS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.bait.worms.webp","colour":"#e57002","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_ROBOT_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_ROBOT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_V_ROBOT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_JELLYCHILD","name":"CHILD OF AQUARIUS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Precious Spawn","description":"An impossibly delicate jellyfish. Its tentacles are as fine as strands of hair, its entire being glassy, dancing on the edge of what is possible. A gift from the sea, almost too precious to keep...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT2.FISH.JELLY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product2.fish.jelly.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_JELLYCHI