.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STELLAR2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STELLAR2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Cooking ingredient","Easy to refine"],"baseValue":88,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/STELLAR2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIP_RAINBOW","name":"CHROMATIC STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. Precisely calibrated multi-chromatic injectors alter the Pulse Engine's output, turning the exhaust trail into a vibrant display of colour. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SHIPTRAIL.RAINBOW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.shiptrail.rainbow.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_RAINBOW_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_RAINBOW_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":2100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SHIP_RAINBOW","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"T_SHIP_RAINBOW","name":"CHROMATIC STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships","categoryKey":"AllShips","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. Precisely calibrated multi-chromatic injectors alter the Pulse Engine's output, turning the exhaust trail into a vibrant display of colour. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SHIPTRAIL.RAINBOW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.shiptrail.rainbow.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_RAINBOW_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_RAINBOW_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":[],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/T_SHIP_RAINBOW","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HACCESS2","name":"CHROMATIC WARP SHIELDING","kind":"Technology","category":"Freighter","categoryKey":"Freighter","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Hyperdrive Upgrade: Green Systems","description":"Upgrades the hyperdrive's shield integrity, preventing reality glitches when attempting to reach rare-class green stellar bodies. User is advised to access Hyperdrive systems via the Galactic Map.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/TECHNOLOGY.FREIGHTERTAU.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/technology.freightertau.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"RGB_WARP_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"RGB_WARP_2_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/F_HACCESS2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_BUTTER","name":"CHURNED BUTTER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BUTTER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.butter.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BUTTER_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REF