"rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"%NAME%'s Genetic Material","description":"A living, fertile egg, %READY%%EXTRA% %MODIFIED% Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential to be %SIZE% and %TRAIT%.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CREATUREEGG.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.creatureegg.webp","colour":"#311a49","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PET_EGG_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PET_EGG_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":0,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EGG9","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S23_PRISMS_EGG","name":"COMPANION EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Viable Genetic Material","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! A playful being wriggles and fidgets inside. The creature dreams of soaring aloft, with a Traveller companion to carry on planetary adventures.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CREATUREEGG.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.creatureegg.webp","colour":"#311a49","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PET_EGG_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_S23_PRISMS_EGG_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":0,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S23_PRISMS_EGG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_INFEST3","name":"COMPOUND BULB","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This vegetative structure is high in antioxidants, though a thick layer of scales makes it impractical for farming. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.INFESTEDPLANT03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.infestedplant03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_INFESTEDPLANT_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_INFESTEDPLANT_3_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_INFEST3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECH9","name":"COMPRESSED INDIUM SCRAPS","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of broken down starship, created by a Starship Outfitting Terminal at a Space Station. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ENERGY3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.energy3.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_9_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":3100000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECH9","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HULK_CANISTER","name":"COMPRESSED PLASMA","kind":"Product","category":"Space Salvage","categoryKey":"SpaceSalvage","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Rare Salvage Material","description":"Full of heavy metals and precious synthetics, this is a valuable piece of industrial salvage. Harvested from the decaying remains of a collapsing space hulk. This has been processed at a deep-space outpost, and can be sold on the open market.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.HULK.CANISTER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.hulk.canister.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HULK_CANISTER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HULK_UNCOMMON_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":49000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/HULK_CANISTER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_PART_C","name":"CONCENTRIC TRANSDUCER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Voltaic Component","description":"An electrified arrangement of mechanical wheels. Transforms stored energy into beams or propulsion, according to the specifications of weapons and laser attachments. One of three core components, this forms the head of a traditional Autophage Voltaic Staff.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/STAFFPARTC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/staffpartc.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_PART_C_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_PART_C_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_PART_C","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN30","name":"CONCEPTUAL VATEZH BEAM","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This A-class weapon comes equipped with a range of pre-installed technologies and upgrades. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.GUN30.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.gun30.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_30_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_GENERIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN30","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FUEL2","name":"CONDENSED CARBON","kind":"Resource","category":"Fuel","categoryKey":"Fuel","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Refined Organic Element","description":"Advanced material, processed from regular carbon in a Refiner. The increased molecule density offers a substantially improved energy-per-gram ratio. Occasionally found in crystalline form. Harvesting large crystals may require a Advanced Mining Laser.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.FUEL.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.fuel.2.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FUEL_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FUEL_2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Cooking ingredient","Easy to refine"],"baseValue":24,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/FUEL2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ASTEROID_CRYST","name":"CONDENSED STELLAR ICE","kind":"Product","category":"Space Salvage","categoryKey":"SpaceSalvage","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Valuable Comet Fragment","description":"A valuable vacuum condensate harvested from the remains of a shattered comet. This has been processed at a deep-space outpost, and can be sold on the open market.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.VOIDCRYSTAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.voidcrystal.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ASTEROID_CRYSTAL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ASTEROID_CRYSTAL_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":13000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ASTEROID_CRYST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPSCAN_COMBAT","name":"CONFLICT SCANNER","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"Normal","subtitle":"Long-range Sensor Technology","description":"An upgrade to the starship's galactic-scale sensors. This device allows the user to access conflict data in the galaxy map, without having to put themselves in harm's way.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.SHIPSCAN_COMBAT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.shipscan_combat.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"SHIPSCAN_COMBAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"SHIPSCAN_COMBAT_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SHIPSCAN_COMBAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BIOSHIP_COMP1","name":"CONSCIOUSNESS BRIDGE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Reactivated Neural Ladder","description":"A biomechanical construct, created to the design of an anonymous host. This device appears to offer an interface between an individual entity and a greater shared consciousness. It appears derived from, but not attuned to, Korvax technology.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/PRODUCT.BIOCOMP1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/product.biocomp1.webp","colour":"#311a49","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_COMP1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_COMP1_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":1616,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BIOSHIP_COMP1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_EGG_11","name":"CONSTRUCT 'EGG'","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Robotic Spawn Capsule","description":"A metal 'egg' capsule, ready to deploy! A low hum resonates from deep within the capsule, its dissonant frequency turning the air around it a faint purple. Scans indicate the being within is programmed to be free-spirited and defiant.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.HOVERBOTPET.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.hoverbotpet.webp","colour":"#4d2987","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_11_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_11_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_EGG_11","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_BUI_HEAD","name":"CONSTRUCT 'SKULL'","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive buildable base ornament. This is a detailed replica of an Autophage facial cage. The unit is inoperable and contains no trace of Autophage entity inhabitation...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.BUILDERHEAD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.builderhead.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_BUI_HEAD_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_BUI_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BLD_BUI_HEAD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BUI_ARMOUR_1","name":"CONSTRUCT ARMOUR","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Appearance Modification","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override, granted by the Autophage to those who seek to build their own shell. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.ARMOUR.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.armour.1.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TIP_ARMOUR_BUI_1_U","descriptionKey":"UI_BUILDER_CUSTOM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1515,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BUI_ARMOUR_1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_PART3","name":"CONSTRUCT CHEST","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Autophage Appearance Modification","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. The principal metallic carapace for a primitive automaton. Plans for a unit of this design were extracted from an autophage left at an abandoned junker's camp. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.CONSTRUCTTORSO.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.constructtorso.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_CONSTRUCT_TORSO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SPEC_CONSTRUCT_TORSO_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":505,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_PART3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_BUI_HAND","name":"CONSTRUCT DIGITS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive buildable base ornament. A partially assembled robotic hand, as seen on mechanical lifeforms across the galaxy. The unit is severly damaged and appears to contain no trace of Autophage entity inhabitation...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.BUILDERHAND.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.builderhand.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_BUI_HAND_NAME","descri