ty":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster depicts a possible schematic for the mysterious Construct unearthed during the Singularity expedition.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER10C.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster10c.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER10C_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER10C_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER10C","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_ROBO_BODY","name":"CONSTRUCT SHELL","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Salvaged Autophage Component","description":"The principal metallic carapace for a primitive automaton. Plans for this unit were extracted from an autophage left at an abandoned junker's camp.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.S10.ROBOTBODY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.s10.robotbody.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_S10_ROBO_BODY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_S10_ROBO_BODY_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":17000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_ROBO_BODY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S9_MYSTERY_ITEM","name":"CONSTRUCTION HISTORY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Classified Dossier","description":"This report records the history of a planetary facility forming part of the Utopia Project. Several sections are curiously absent. DS 2368 :: Facility founded. Plasma deep drill rig operational. DS 2384 :: Return growth steady at 1%. DS 2400 :: Overseers querying growth rate. DS 2416 :: Orbital exp. approved. Station trade booming. DS 2432 :: [Redacted] hazard encountered. DS 2448 :: [Redacted] DS 2464 :: Utopia Project launched. DS 2464 :: Facility restored. Plasma deep drill rig operational. Trade routes re-opened. DS 2480 :: [Redacted] DS 2496 :: Facility restored. Plasma deep drill rig operational. Trade routes re-opened. DS 2512 :: [Redacted] The last two entries are repeated over and over, across hundreds of pages.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TREASUREPROD.STRANGEBOOK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/treasureprod.strangebook.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPED_S9_MYSTERY_ITEM_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPED_S9_MYSTERY_ITEM_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S9_MYSTERY_ITEM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPSLOT_DMG5","name":"CONTAINMENT FAILURE","kind":"Technology","category":"Ship","categoryKey":"Ship","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Starship Component","description":"Starship subsystem severely damaged. Slot cannot be used for storage or technology until damage is repaired. Use to begin repair process. Core starship functionality is not affected. Repairing this damage will free slot up for general inventory use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/SPACEGUNK.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/spacegunk.2.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPSLOT_DMG5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPSLOT_DMG_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SHIPSLOT_DMG5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXP_CURIO2","name":"CONVERGENCE CUBE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade commodity","description":"Device used by the Korvax for the storage of historical and cultural information.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.KORVAXCUBE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.korvaxcube.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"NEWPROD3_NAME","descriptionKey":"NEWPROD3_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":13063,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXP_CURIO2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_HOT","name":"COOLANT NETWORK","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Hazard Protection Unit","description":"User is guarded from extreme heat damage on scorched worlds. Provides relief from intense atmospheric and solar heat through a threaded dermal distribution network of liquid frenium. Device is charged by mineral extracts found in hot environments. Operates automatically once constructed within user's exosuit inventory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PROTECTHEAT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.protectheat.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_HOT_NAME","descriptionKey":"HOT1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_HOT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_FRIG2","name":"COOLING SYSTEM","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"A pump and heat exchange system designed to keep the device from overheating. It has itself overheated, and is no longer functional.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONT