category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An animal byproduct, this nutritious morsel can be easily farmed without harm to the animal that produces it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.EGG.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.egg.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_GENERIC_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_VEG_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_V_EGG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BAIT_BASIC","name":"CREATURE PELLETS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Compressed Nutrients","description":"Basic creature bait. Can be placed directly or accessed via the Quick Menu (). This bait will attract creatures and cause them to yield Faecium. Once a creature has been fed, they may be tamed or farmed for their produce. Dropping bait may calm angry creatures.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BAIT.PELLETS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.bait.pellets.webp","colour":"#007953","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BAIT_BASIC_NAME","descriptionKey":"BAIT_BASIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":20,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":20,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BAIT_BASIC","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HYPERDRIVE_ROBO","name":"CRIMSON CORE","kind":"Technology","category":"Robot Ship","categoryKey":"RobotShip","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Interstellar Atlas Propulsion","description":"A raw optic organ, red and unblinking. Suspended above the ship's engines, it gazes down tunnels in spacetime, allowing FTL travel between star systems. Direct the core's attention to remote destinations via the Galactic Map.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/ROBOTSHIP.HYPERDRIVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/robotship.hyperdrive.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HYPERDRIVE_ROBO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HYPERDRIVE_ROBO_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/HYPERDRIVE_ROBO","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREI_TRAIL_RED","name":"CRIMSON FREIGHTER TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Freighter Engine Flare Override","description":"An exclusive Freighter Engine Flare Modifier. A harmonic generation device converts the output of the freighter engines to A T L A S frequencies, radiating a painfully crimson trail. Transform the appearance of your freighter at the Upgrade Control Terminal on the bridge.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FREIGHTJETS.RED.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.freightjets.red.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_RED_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_RED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREI_TRAIL_RED","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_CARAMEL","name":"CRUNCHY CARAMEL","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. 