e","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Significant Starship Weapon Upgrade","description":"A significant upgrade for the Cyclotron Ballista. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: damage output, fire rate and overheat times.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.B.RAILGUN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.b.railgun.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPBLOB2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPBLOB2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":140,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SHIPBLOB2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SHIPBLOB3","name":"CYCLOTRON MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Powerful Starship Weapon Upgrade","description":"An extremely powerful upgrade for the Cyclotron Ballista. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: damage output, fire rate and overheat times.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.A.RAILGUN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.a.railgun.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPBLOB3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPBLOB3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SHIPBLOB3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SHIPBLOB4","name":"CYCLOTRON MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Supreme Starship Weapon Upgrade","description":"A supremely powerful upgrade for the Cyclotron Ballista. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: damage output, fire rate and overheat times.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.S.RAILGUN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.s.railgun.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPBLOB4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPBLOB4_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SHIPBLOB4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WATERPLANT","name":"CYTO-PHOSPHATE","kind":"Resource","category":"Earth","categoryKey":"Earth","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Organic Compound","description":"A blue-green organic compound produced during the metabolic cycle of deep-sea plantlife. Rich in soluble energy, cyto-phosphates are crucial in many submarine technologies. The Mining Laser will harvest cyto-phosphate compounds from underwater flora.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.WATER.PLANT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.water.plant.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WATERPLANT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WATERPLANT_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":201,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/WATERPLANT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET10","name":"D. GENTALIUM EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! A set of cartilage pincers nip softly at the inside of the egg. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for a dutiful nature, happiest when assigned useful tasks.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.PET10.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.pet10.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_10_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_10_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET10","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_ENGINE","name":"DAEDALUS ENGINE","kind":"Technology","category":"Mech","categoryKey":"Mech","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Minotaur Power Unit","description":"A compact reactor unit, this engine is the heart of the Minotaur. It is mounted on a gyroscope to prevent fuel incidents during rapid movement. Powered by conventional carbon-base fuels.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.ENGINE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.engine.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MECH_ENGINE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MECH_ENGINE_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MECH_ENGINE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UP_MCENG2","name":"Daedalus Engine","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Protection","categoryKey":"Protection","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"B-Class %NAME% Upgrade","description":"UP_MCENG2_DESC","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_MCENG","descriptionKey":"UP_MCENG2_DESC","secondary":"T_MCENG","tags":["2 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/as