ial","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MESSAGE_JUICE4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPOOK_JUICE","name":"ELIXIR OF GLASS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Otherworldly Concoction","description":"A slight membrane has begun to form over this viscous purple liquid. Beneath its glassy surface it swirls slowly, forming syrupy currents of its own accord. The elixir will maintain your local boundary integrity and prevent the intrusion of the horrors beyond. Consume the elixir with or inject it directly into the Anomaly Suppressor from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SPOOKJUICE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.spookjuice.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPOOK_JUICE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SPOOK_JUICE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPOOK_JUICE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PORTAL_JUICE","name":"ELIXIR OF QUICKSILVER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Otherworldly Concoction","description":"The liquid's silvered surface forms a perfect mirror, your own face reflected back as you examine it. But the more you stare, the less perfect the mirror becomes. The face in the image moves. It blinks. It - Consume the elixir with to reveal the location of nearby portals.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.PORTALJUICE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.portaljuice.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PORTAL_JUICE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PORTAL_JUICE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/PORTAL_JUICE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BOSS_JUICE","name":"ELIXIR OF WATER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Otherworldly Concoction","description":"The water in this vessel seems to stretch on forever, plunging down to dizzying depths, far beyond what the container could possibly hold. Consume the elixir with . Beware what lurks in the deep water...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BOSSJUICE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.bossjuice.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BOSS_JUICE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BOSS_JUICE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BOSS_JUICE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_HOTPLANT08","name":"EMBER FROND","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"The huge leathery leaves of the ember frond are both fire- and water-proof. Traces of the leaves have been found at the foot of ancient monoliths across a range of planetary biomes, suggesting they were once used for some ritualistic purpose. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.HOTPLANT08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.hotplant08.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_8_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_8_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_HOTPLANT08","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BANNER04","name":"EMERGENCE EXPEDITION BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in commemoration of the Emergence expedition. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.BANNER04.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.banner04.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_04_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_04_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BANNER04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_DECAL04","name":"EMERGENCE EXPEDITION DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal commemorates completion of the Emergence expedition.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.DECAL04.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.decal04.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_04_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_04_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_DECAL04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ABAND_LOCATOR","name":"EMERGENCY SIGNAL SCANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Coordinate Data","description":"A single-use receiver that scans for distress signals on freighter frequencies. Derelict or abandoned freighters often contain high-value salvage. Select the Receiver and use Tune Signal () to begin the location process.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.LOCATOR.ABAND.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.locator.aband.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ABAND_LOCATOR_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ABAND_LOCATOR_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ABAND_LOCATOR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ABAND_LOCATOR_X","name":"EMERGENCY SIGNAL SCANNER (ACTIVE)","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Coordinate Data","description":"A single-use receiver that scans for distress signals on freighter frequencies. Derelict or abandoned freighters often contain high-value salvage. Select the Receiver and use Tune Signal () to begin the location process.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.LOCATOR.ABAND.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.locator.aband.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ABAND_LOCATOR_X_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ABAND_LOCATOR_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ABAND_LOCATOR_X","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_QUICKWARP","name":"EMERGENCY WARP UNIT","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Hyperdrive Augmentation","description":"A significant upgrade to the Hyperdrive that allows an instantaneous warp even while conventional systems are blocked by starship combat. Access to the emergency warp system is via the Quick Menu. WARNING: Fast scramble systems mean the user is unable to plot a destination. Uncalculated lightspeed events will damage the unit and require frequent repairs.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.HYPERDRIVEMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.hyperdrivemod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_QUICKWARP_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_QUICKWARP_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_QUICKWARP","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"GREEN2","name":"EMERIL","kind":"Resource","category":"Stellar","categoryKey":"Stellar","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Refined Stellar Metal: Green","description":"A chromatic metal, generated by fusion in the heart of a star. Emeril is found on planets orbiting green stars, and can be placed in a Refiner to create purified Chromatic Metal for use in the manufacture of advanced technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.GREEN.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.green.2.webp","colour":"#36611c","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_GREEN2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_GREEN2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":114,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/GREEN2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HDRIVEBOOST2","name":"EMERIL DRIVE","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"VeryRare","subtitle":"Hyperdrive Upgrade: Green Systems","description":"Upgrades the hyperdrive's shield integrity, preventing reality glitches when attempting to reach rare-class green stellar bodies. User is advised to access Hyperdrive systems via the Galactic Map.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/TECHNOLOGY.EMERILDRIVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/technology.emerildrive.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"HYP_ACCESS2_NAME","descriptionKey":"RGB_WARP_2_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/HDRIVEBOOST2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREI_TRAIL_GRE","name":"EMERIL FREIGHTER TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Freighter Engine Flare Override","description":"An exclusive Freighter Engine Flare Modifier. The extreme heat of the freighter's engines excites this filter of Emeril salts, tinting the exhaust with a vivid green hue. Transform the appearance of your freighter at the Upgrade Control Terminal on the bridge.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FREIGHTJETS.GREEN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.freightjets.green.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_GRE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_GRE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREI_TRAIL_GRE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIP_GREEN","name":"EMERIL STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. Emeril injection nozzles add a rich green flair to the Pulse Engine's output. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SHIPTRAIL.GREEN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.shiptrail.green.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_GREEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_GREEN_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SHIP_GREEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"T_SHIP_GREEN","name":"EMERIL STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships","categoryKey":"AllShips","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. Emeril injection nozzles add a rich green flair to the Pulse Engine's output. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SHIPTRAIL.GREEN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.shiptrail.green.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_GREEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_GREEN_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":[],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/T_SHIP_GREEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TOX_LEG_S1","name":"EMERIL SUNSTAR","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Legendary Fish","description":"\"Its perfect crystalline form glistens with a emerald light that changes the soul of all those whose eyes fall upon it.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT4.FISH.STARFISH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product4.fish.starfish.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_LEG_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_LEG_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TOX_LEG_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_GAS_COM_M2","name":"ENCRUSTED WORM","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_GAS_COM_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT4.FISH.WORM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product4.fish.worm.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_GAS_COM_M2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_GAS_COM_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":2000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_GAS_COM_M2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MP_REP_PART2","name":"ENCRYPTED COMMUNICATOR CONTROL UNIT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Component","description":"An advanced nanocomputer, performing processing tasks related to ship-to-ship communications, quantum transportation, and coordinate tracing. This part could be in working order, but will require decryption before it can be installed in a new ship. A paired decryption terminal can be located via Exosuit analysis.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALVAGE.RARE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.salvage.rare.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MP_REP_PART2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MP_REP_PART2B","name":"ENCRYPTED COMMUNICATOR CONTROL UNIT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Component","description":"An advanced nanocomputer, performing processing tasks related to ship-to-ship communications, quantum transportation, and coordinate tracing. This part could be in working order, but will require decryption before it can be installed in a new ship. A paired decryption terminal can be located via Exosuit analysis.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALVAGE.RARE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.salvage.rare.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MP_REP_PART2B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MP_REP_PART1","name":"ENCRYPTED NAVIGATION COMPUTER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Component","description":"An advanced nanocomputer, performing processing tasks related to starship navigation, flight stabilisation, and external sensors. This part could be in working order, but will require decryption before it can be installed in a new ship. A paired decryption terminal can be located via Exosuit analysis.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALVAGE.RARE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.salvage.rare.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART1_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MP_REP_PART1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MP_REP_PART1B","name":"ENCRYPTED NAVIGATION COMPUTER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Component","description":"An advanced nanocomputer, performing processing tasks related to starship navigation, flight stabilisation, and external sensors. This part could be in working order, but will require decryption before it can be installed in a new ship. A paired decryption terminal can be located via Exosuit analysis.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALVAGE.RARE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.salvage.rare.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART1_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MP_REP_PART1B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MP_REP_PART3","name":"ENCRYPTED USER AUTHENTICATOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Component","description":"An advanced nanocomputer, performing processing tasks related to starship-to-Exosuit synchronisation and security. This part could be in working order, but will require decryption before it can be installed in a new ship. A paired decryption terminal can be located via Exosuit analysis.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALVAGE.RARE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.salvage.rare.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MP_REP_PART3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MP_REP_PART3B","name":"ENCRYPTED USER AUTHENTICATOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Component","description":"An advanced nanocomputer, performing processing tasks related to starship-to-Exosuit synchronisation and security. This part could be in working order, but will require decryption before it can be installed in a new ship. A paired decryption terminal can be located via Exosuit analysis.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALVAGE.RARE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.salvage.rare.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MP_REPAIR_PART3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MP_REP_PART3B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP17","name":"END OF THE KUMIOK","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. Specialised in dogfighting, this craft boasts superior mobility and advanced firepower, and is fitted with an upgraded Positron Ejector. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP17.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship17.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_17_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_17_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP17","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_PETCUST3","name":"ENERGY COIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Companion Accessory","description":"An exclusive Companion Appearance Enhancement. This dual-purpose laser responds to the biological vitals of its wearer, providing an adaptive level of warmth and light, as well as soft pulses to soothe anxiety. Earn the trust of wild animals to adopt companions. Interact with companions to customise their appearance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.PETCUSTOM3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.petcustom3.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_PET_CUSTOM_03_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SPEC_PET_CUSTOM_03_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_PETCUST3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ATLAS_SEED_2","name":"ENGLOBED SHADE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Unique valuable curiosity","description":"This Atlas Shell holds the remains of a parasitic space-borne lifeform, most likely of extra-dimensional origins.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.2.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ATLAS_SEED_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"ATLAS_SEED_2_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ATLAS_SEED_2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_COMPONENT1","name":"ENORMOUS METAL COG","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Industrial)","description":"Several huge cogs. Sturdy, well-made metal gears. While not advanced technology themselves, they're a vital component in countless pieces of high-tech machinery all over the galaxy.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component1.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMP_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMP_1_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_COMPONENT1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_MILK","name":"ENRICHED BISCUIT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_MILK_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":56000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_MILK","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"REACTION2","name":"ENRICHED CARBON","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Enhanced Gas Product","description":"A refined product, taking ordinary carbon and boosting it with radioactive energy. Crafted from Radon and Condensed Carbon.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/REACTION.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/reaction.2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_REACTION_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_REACTION_2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/REACTION2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_RADPLANT03","name":"ENTWINING TREE","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This beautiful statement tree thrives in the heat of intense gamma radiation. To ensure survival in non-native environments, a chunk of high-energy material has been embedded in the trunk. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.RADPLANT03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.radplant03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_RADPLANT_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_RADPLANT_3_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_RADPLANT03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_PROT","name":"ENVIRONMENT CONTROL UNIT","kind":"Technology","category":"Mech","categoryKey":"Mech","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Exocraft Hazard Protection Unit","description":"This powerful environmental neutralising system is plugged directly into the pilot as they enter the cockpit. The system is powered via the Minotaur's main engine and requires no additional input. Some minor pain may be noticed around the insertion site. Renders the Minotaur pilot impervious to all environmental hazards.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PROTECTGENERIC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.protectgeneric.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXOHAZ_ALL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXOHAZ_ALL_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MECH_PROT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BAIT_VEG_2","name":"ENZYME FLUID","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Herbivore Bait","description":"A specialist bait for herbivores. Use the Analysis Visor to discover the bait preferences of specific creatures. Created in a Nutrient Processor from Faecium and harvestable plants. Can be further processed in the Nutrient Processor to create new bait types. Feeding using the correct bait will allow creatures to be ridden or harvested. Chose bait type from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BAIT.FLUID.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.bait.fluid.webp","colour":"#007953","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BAIT_VEG_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"BAIT_VEG_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BAIT_VEG_2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP01","name":"EOKAI'S PRIME INQUIRER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, pre-fitted with an upgraded Hyperdrive for efficient galactic exploration. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.SHIP01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.ship01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_01_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_01_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ODD_RARE_S2","name":"ERASED CLAM","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.CLAM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.clam.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_S2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ODD_RARE_S2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CK_CACTUS","name":"ESOPHAGEAL SURPRISE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Cake Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CUPCAKE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.cupcake.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CK_CACTUS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CK","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":57800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CK_CACTUS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_FLOWER3","name":"ETERNAL EYE FLOWERS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A hardy floral patch, genetically modified to thrive in all biomes, soil types, and weather conditions. These ligulate blossoms remain open day and night, absorbing light from both local and distant stars.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FLOWER03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.flower03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_FLOWER_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_FLOWER_3_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_FLOWER3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER20B","name":"ETERNAL SERPENTS POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. Time is an eternal serpent, forever turning in upon itself, forever shedding and regrowing and reforming...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S20.POSTERB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s20.posterb.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER20B_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER20B_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER20B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_GAS_EPIC_S1","name":"EVAPORATING SNAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Rare Fish","description":"UI_FISH_GAS_EPIC_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.SNAIL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.snail.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_GAS_EPIC_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_GAS_EPIC_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":10000,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_GAS_EPIC_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER20C","name":"EVENT HORIZON POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster depicts the intense heat and strange gravitational anomalies that warp space around a black hole.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S20.POSTERC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s20.posterc.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER20C_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER20C_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER20C","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CK_JHOT","name":"EVER-BOILING CAKE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Cake Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cake.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CK_JHOT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CK","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":64300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CK_JHOT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_JAM_HOT","name":"EVER-BURNING JAM","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.JAM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.jam.webp","colour":"#db2400","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_JAM_HOT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":3400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_JAM_HOT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_TREE03","name":"EVERGREEN TREE","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A hardy evergreen tree, able to survive in a wide-range of climates. Waxy leaves with a silvery underside provide excellent light harvesting abilities, as well as year-round interest and colour.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TREE03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.tree03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_TREE_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_TREE_3_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_TREE03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXO_PLOUGH","name":"EXCAVATION BLADE","kind":"Technology","category":"Colossus","categoryKey":"Colossus","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Exocraft Demolition Attachment","description":"A obstacle demolition attachment for a terrestrial vehicle, compatible with the Colossus large Exocraft. The Excavation Blade allows the Colossus to collect a small number of resources from minerals and vegetation upon collision, and reduces grime and scratches to the Exocraft's paintwork.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.PLOUGH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.plough.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRUCK_PLOUGH_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRUCK_PLOUGH_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/EXO_PLOUGH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PROC_EXH","name":"Exhibit Fossil (procedural)","kind":"Procedural item","category":"Exhibit Fossil","categoryKey":"Exhibit Fossil","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Fossil Sample","description":"Fossil Sample","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TREASUREPROD.FOSSIL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/treasureprod.fossil.webp","colour":"#1fb80a","source":"PROCEDURALPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ITEMGEN_FORMAT_FOSSIL","descriptionKey":"FOSSIL_SUB","secondary":"Procedural","tags":["Generated name and value"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/procedural-item/PROC_EXH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FISH_SKIFF","name":"EXO-SKIFF","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Deployable Fishing Platform","description":"A deployable static platform, allowing the user to comfortably survey the seas in any weather. As well as providing a steady and easily accessible fishing spot, the Exo-Skiff also features abundant Cold Storage, granting additional space to store your catch. Summon the Exo-Skiff to any suitable body of water using the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/TECH.FISHSKIFF.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/tech.fishskiff.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_SKIFF_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_SKIFF_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/FISH_SKIFF","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BANNER05","name":"EXOBIOLOGY EXPEDITION BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in commemoration of the 'Exobiology' Expedition, and your explorations into the diverse wildlife inhabiting the universe. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.BANNER05.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.banner05.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_05_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_05_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BANNER05","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_DECAL05","name":"EXOBIOLOGY EXPEDITION DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal commemorates completion of the Exobiology expedition, and celebrates the peaceful co-existence of Travellers with the countless species of wildlife inhabiting the universe.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.DECAL05.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.decal05.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_05_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_05_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_DECAL05","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_EXOBOOST1","name":"EXOCRAFT BOOST MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Exocraft Boost Upgrade","description":"A moderate upgrade for the Exocraft Boosters. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: boost tank capacity and/or boost power.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.C.VEHICLEBOOST.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.c.vehicleboost.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_EXOBOOST1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_EXOBOOST1_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":60,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_EXOBOOST1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_EXOBOOST2","name":"EXOCRAFT BOOST MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Significant Exocraft Boost Upgrade","description":"A significant upgrade for the Exocraft Boosters. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: boost tank capacity and/or boost power.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.B.VEHICLEBOOST.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.b.vehicleboost.webp","colour":"#1a2733","sourc