ommon","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATPIE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatpie.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PIE_FISH_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":40000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_FISH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FISHLASER","name":"FISHING RIG","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"VeryRare","subtitle":"Deployable Angling Device","description":"A versatile piece of angling equipment, enabling the user to fish in a variety of water conditions. Access the fishing rig by pressing and cast your line into a body of water with . With a fish hooked, press and hold to haul in your catch.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.FISHLASER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.fishlaser.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISHLASER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISHLASER_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/FISHLASER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_XL1","name":"FISHY SLAB","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A huge slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.TUNA.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.tuna.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_XL_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_XL_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":39000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_XL1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_FIREPIT","name":"FLAMING BARREL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Inefficient Heat Source","description":"A low-tech heating device, ideal for generating light and heat without access to high-energy power sources. User is advised to keep arms and legs outside of the barrel at all times.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FIREPIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.firepit.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_FIREPIT_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_FIREPIT_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BLD_FIREPIT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_SWAMP1","name":"FLARECAP TOADSTOOL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This species of fungus is notable for its dense capillary network and bioluminescent qualities. A circulating chain of chemical reactions produces the toadstool's nocturnal glow. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SWAMPPLANT01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.swampplant01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_SWAMPPLANT_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_SWAMPPLANT_1_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_SWAMP1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HOT_RARE_M1","name":"FLASHFIRE EEL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT3.FISH.EEL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product3.fish.eel.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_M1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_HOT_RARE_M1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRUCK_BODY02","name":"FLATBED CHASSIS MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Exocraft Customisation Option","description":"A custom body module for a terrestrial vehicle, compatible with the Colossus large Exocraft. The Flatbed Module allows the Colossus to haul heavy stacks of industrial waste across long distances. An electromagnetic containment field minimises cargo loss while navigating uneven terrain. A tipping lever allows the flatbed to dump its contents, for ease of processing. Recalibrate Exocraft visuals from the Colossus Geobay.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.TRUCKBODY02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.truckbody02.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRUCK_BODY02_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRUCK_BODY02_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRUCK_BODY02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_GRASS3","name":"FLATBLADE GRASS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A tough ornamental grass, suitable for growing in all biomes, soil types, and weather conditions. The wide, flat blades secrete a fragrant, unpleasant-tasting sap to deter predators.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.GRASS03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.grass03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_GRASS_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_GRASS_3_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_GRASS3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_STEW_O_VEG","name":"FLAVOURSOME ORGANS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATSTEW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatstew.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_STEW_O_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":18800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_STEW_O_VEG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_S_VEG","name":"FLAVOURSOME SAUCE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A consumable liquid, created in the Nutrient Processor. Prized across the galaxy for its pleasing mouth-feel and authentically natural flavours. Can be ingested as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SAUCE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.sauce.webp","colour":"#007953","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_S_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_DRINK_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":7200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_S_VEG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_CAPE08","name":"FLEET COMMANDER'S CAPE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Cape","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Master, commander, voyager of the stars. Don your cloak and prepare to take the helm. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.CAPE08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.cape08.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FLEETCAPE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FLEETCAPE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_CAPE08","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_FIREWORK04","name":"FLESH LAUNCHER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"A luxury firework. These organic pyrotechnics rocket into the sky and explode in a splatter of slime, plasma and wormlets. Ignite to create disgusting displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.WORMFIREWORK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.wormfirework.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_WORMFIREWORK_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_WORMFIREWORK_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":50,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_FIREWORK04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_FIREPACK04","name":"FLESH LAUNCHER PACK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Pyrotechnics Multi-Pack","description":"A pack of luxury fireworks. These organic pyrotechnics rocket into the sky and explode in a splatter of slime, mucus, and wormlets. Ignite to create disgusting displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.FIREWORKPACK04.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.fireworkpack04.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PACK_EXPD_04_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PACK_EXPD_04_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":250,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_FIREPACK04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WORMCORE","name":"FLESH ROPE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Intestinal Fragment","description":"The coiled remains of a Hungering Tendril's digestive tract. Though its meaty walls still convulse, there is surely no way for a fresh tendril to regrow from these meagre scraps... Such specialist offal is rarely traded on the Galactic Exchange and is thus highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/WORMCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/wormcore.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WORMCORE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WORMCORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":16016,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/WORMCORE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_EEL","name":"FLESHY CYLINDER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SQUID.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.squid.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_EEL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_LARGE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":33100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_EEL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_S22_PART3","name":"FLICKERING HOLO-BANK","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Neural Component","description":"A critically damaged component housed within what appears to be the processing centre of a fallen swarmer. Partial functionality could be restored by repairing the component.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component4.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINT_S22_PART_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINT_S22_PART_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_S22_PART3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_SHIPDRIFT","name":"FLIGHT ASSIST OVERRIDE","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"VeryRare","subtitle":"Advanced Starship Pilot Module","description":"This grey-market electronics module disables critical safety and pilot-assistance modules usually baked into the starship's fly-by-wire control system. Despite its dubious legal status and its implication in a series of high-speed asteroid impacts, this module remains popular with smugglers, mercenaries, and others who think of themselves as advanced pilots. Specifically tuned to increase the ability of the starship to drift during spaceflight.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PULSEDRIVEMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.pulsedrivemod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_SHIPDRIFT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_SHIPDRIFT_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_SHIPDRIFT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"CV_FIT1","name":"flight control systems","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Combat","categoryKey":"Combat","rarity":"Normal","subtitle":"UP_CRUI_SUB","description":"UT_CR_FIGHT_DESC","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","