ient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.JAM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.jam.webp","colour":"#db2400","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_JAM_CAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":9000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_JAM_CAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRUCK_BODY03","name":"FURNACE CHASSIS MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Exocraft Customisation Option","description":"A custom body module for a terrestrial vehicle, compatible with the Colossus large Exocraft. The Furnace Module enables immediate disposal of industrial waste. Note: resource extraction is less efficient than at a Waste Processing Plant. Recalibrate Exocraft visuals from the Colossus Geobay.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.TRUCKBODY03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.truckbody03.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRUCK_BODY03_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRUCK_BODY03_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRUCK_BODY03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_BURNER","name":"FURNACE TANK","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Fuel Incineration Device","description":"High-temperature burn unit, designed to consume a wide range of biological material. Insert materials to initiate burn. When active, drives an internal turbine to generate power.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MAINTTECH.FUEL1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mainttech.fuel1.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BURNER_TECH_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BURNER_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_BURNER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"COMPOUND4","name":"FUSION ACCELERANT","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Manufactured Gas Product","description":"An advanced fuel source, made from a perfect blend of high potential energy organic materials. Crafted from Organic Catalyst and Nitrogen Salt.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FUSIONACCELERANT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.fusionaccelerant.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_COMPOUND_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_COMPOUND_4_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Trade good"],"baseValue":1500000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/COMPOUND4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_ENERGY5","name":"FUSION CORE","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Energy Source)","description":"A slightly glowing bundle of fusion cores. Power source, engine, high-capacity heater. A fusion core is the ultimate in deep-space power generation. Highly valued by mining economies looking to make their asteroid colonies more self-sufficient.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ENERGY5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.energy5.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ENERGY_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ENERGY_5_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_ENERGY5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"VEHICLE_ENGINE","name":"FUSION ENGINE","kind":"Technology","category":"Exocraft","categoryKey":"Exocraft","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Exocraft Power System","description":"A compact fusion core common to all Exocraft. Requires fuel to function.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.ENGINE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.engine.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"VEHICLEENGINE_NAME","descriptionKey":"VEHICLEENGINE_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/VEHICLE_ENGINE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UP_EXENG1","name":"Fusion Engine","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Protection","categoryKey":"Protection","rarity":"Normal","subtitle":"C-Class %NAME% Upgrade","description":"UP_EXENG1_DESC","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_EXENG","descriptionKey":"UP_EXENG1_DESC","secondary":"T_EXENG","tags":["2 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/upgrade-module/UP_EXENG1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UP_EXENG2","name":"Fusion Engine","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Protection","categoryKey":"Protection","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"B-Class %NAME% Upgrade","description":"UP_EXENG2_DESC","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177