ELATINOUS FIBRES","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Biometallic Strands","description":"Though apparently inorganic, the molecular makeup of these fibres has been drastically changed by exposure to both cosmic radiation and novel viral proteins. Harvested from a deep-space biohazard site.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.SLIMEPOST.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/substances/substance.slimepost.1.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SLIMEPOST1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SLIMEPOST1_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":235,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/SLIMEPOST1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_STEW_BEET","name":"GELATINOUS GOOP","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATSTEW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatstew.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BEETLE_STEW_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":6400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_STEW_BEET","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_W_CASE","name":"GELATINOUS MEMBRANE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.SAUSAGE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.sausage.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_W_CASE_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":8000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_W_CASE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CK_BUGJAM","name":"GELATINOUS SPONGE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Cake Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cake.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CK_BUGJAM_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CK","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":68100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CK_BUGJAM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_ROCK03","name":"GEM-ENCRUSTED ROCK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"Once a discarded byproduct of deep-level crystal mining, the aesthetic value of the rocks is now better appreciated. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.