s. Use to trigger node growth and begin the grafting process. Each node is genetically unique, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: damage output, and overheat tolerance.","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"AP_SHIPLAS","descriptionKey":"BIO_PROD_LAS4_DESC","secondary":"A_SHIPLAS","tags":["3 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/upgrade-module/UA_SLASR4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_P_RADWILD","name":"GRAHBERRY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An edible plant, harvested from planetary flora. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.PLANT.RADWILD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.plant.radwild.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PLANT_RAD_WILD_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_P_RADWILD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ILLEGAL_PROD5","name":"GRAHGRAH","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Smuggled Goods","description":"A canister of the now-banned Vy'keen battle gas, traditionally inhaled on the eve of battle. Purchase is illegal at nearly all galactic trade terminals. Regular supply is only available within outlaw systems. Selling banned goods into commercially-regulated space may be highly profitable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SMUGGLING5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.smuggling5.webp","colour":"#383838","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ILLEGAL_PROD5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ILLEGAL_PROD5_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":58000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ILLEGAL_PROD5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_JAM_RAD","name":"GRAHJ'AM","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.JAM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.jam.webp","colour":"#db2400","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_JAM_RAD_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":3400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_JAM_RAD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ALLOY6","name":"GRANTINE","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Alloy Metal","description":"Soft workable alloy favoured by artisans throughout the known galaxy. Crafted from Ionised Cobalt and Dioxite. A popular trading good, with many galactic shipping paths devoted to its sale and transport.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.METALLIC.6.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.metallic.6.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ALLOY_SIMPLE_6_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ALLOY_SIMPLE_6_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":25000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ALLOY6","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TELEPORT_ALIEN","name":"GRASPING TENDRILS","kind":"Technology","category":"Alien Ship","categoryKey":"AlienShip","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Sentient Vessel Node","description":"Filaments of sinew and neuron warp and weave across the ship, their complex geometry darting between the visible world and some unfathomable dimension beyond. These tendrils reach across time and space, searching out a long-distance link between the vessel and their target's Exosuit inventory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/BIOTECH.SCALES.MOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/biotech.scales.mod.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TELEPORT_ALIEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TELEPORT_ALIEN_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/TELEPORT_ALIEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"GRAVBALL","name":"GRAVITINO BALL","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Trade commodity","description":"A supersymmetric particle cluster created by divergent super-gravitational forces. A micro-rift is created as they form, and extraction of the orb prompts a localised reality weakening. Sentinel forces will respond to stablise any such anomaly. Can be sold at a Galactic Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.GRAVBALL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.gravball.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"NEWPROD13_NAME","descriptionKey":"NEWPROD13_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":42130,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/GRAVBALL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"GRAVITYGUN","name":"GRAVITINO COIL","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Industrial Waste Manipulation Device","description":"This remarkable technology transforms the Multi-Tool into a powerful kinetic manipulator, capable of attracting and repelling industrial waste via a localised magnetic field. Access the Gravitino Coil by pressing , and attract industrial waste with . Magnetised objects can be launched from the Coil with , or gently released with .","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.GRAVITYGUN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.gravitygun.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_GRAVGUN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_GRAVGUN_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/GRAVITYGUN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER21B","name":"GRAVITINO COIL POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. Is your home planet overburdened with industrial waste? Troubled by crates and barrels exploding in the night? Looking to earn rewards for responsible disposal? Purchase a Gravitino Coil today!","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S21.POSTERB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s21.posterb.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER21B_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER21B_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER21B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP38","name":"GRAVITY NEMESIS RE5","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This versatile shuttle comes with a range of upgraded technologies pre-installed. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP38.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship38.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_38_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_38_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP38","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DUST_COM_XL","name":"GREATER ROCKTOOTH","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DUST_COM_XL_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BIG.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.big.1.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_COM_XL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_COM_XL_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DUST_COM_XL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREIGHT_GREEN","name":"GREEN","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Freighter Customisation Option","description":"Unlocks this colour for freighter customisation. A self-replicating cloud of highly pigmatised nano-robots swarm the capital ship, changing its external appearance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FREIGHTPAINT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.freightpaint.webp","colour":"#96b659","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PAINT_GREEN_U","descriptionKey":"UI_PAINT_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREIGHT_GREEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FIREWORK03","name":"GREEN FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"A luxury firework, rich in magnesium and emeril. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.FIREWORK03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.firework03.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FIREWORK_PROD_GREEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"FIREWORK_PROD_GREEN_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":50,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FIREWORK03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JETS_GREEN","name":"GREEN JETPACK TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Jetpack Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Emeril injection nozzles add a rich green flair to the Jetpack's output. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.JETS.GREEN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.jets.green.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_GREEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_GREEN_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/JETS_GREEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FIREWORK09","name":"GREEN TITAN FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"This exotic firework, tinted with emeril salts, is inspired by the undulating form of the titanic sandworm. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FIREWORK09.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.firework09.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_TITAN_G_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_TITAN_G_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":60,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FIREWORK09","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TOX_COM_L1","name":"GREEN-RING OCTOPUS","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT4.FISH.OCTOPUS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product4.fish.octopus.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TOX_COM_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TOX_COM_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ALL_COM_L1","name":"GREENSCALE BLOATER","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT4.FISH.XL.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product4.fish.xl.1.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ALL_COM_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_MED2","name":"GRILLED FILLET","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A piece of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SALMON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.salmon.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_MED_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_MED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":33100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_MED2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_OCTOPUS","name":"GRILLED TENTACLE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.OCTOPUS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.octopus.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_OCTOPUS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_LARGE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":33100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_OCTOPUS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"VEHICLE_GRIP2","name":"GRIP BOOST SUSPENSION","kind":"Technology","category":"Exocraft","categoryKey":"Exocraft","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Exocraft Handling Modification","description":"Overhauls Exocraft handling values through a combination of software tweaks, pressure adjustments and the insertion of microgravity wells into key suspension components. Specifically tuned to increase the ability of the Exocraft to turn sharply.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.TRACTION.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.traction.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"VEHICLE_GRIP2_NAME","descriptionKey":"VEHICLE_GRIP2_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/VEHICLE_GRIP2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_DRILL","name":"GRISTLE PIE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATPIE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatpie.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_DRILL_PIE_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":62000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_DRILL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_BALL","name":"GRITTY MEAT PIE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATPIE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatpie.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_DIGGER_PIE_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":62000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_BALL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BAIT_MEAT_2","name":"GROUND MEAT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Carnivore Bait","description":"A specialist bait for carnivores. Use the Analysis Visor to discover the bait preferences of specific creatures. Created in a Nutrient Processor from Mordite and assorted creature flesh. Feeding using the correct bait will allow creatures to be ridden or harvested. It will also calm predators. Chose bait type from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BAIT.MEAT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.bait.meat.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BAIT_MEAT_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"BAIT_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BAIT_MEAT_2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BIOSHIP_STEM4","name":"GROWING SINGULARITY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Fragile Breath","description":"A slow knitting together of flesh, neurons and antimatter. The way this mind experiences the universe is beyond any imagining. It requires careful attendance while it matures.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/PRODUCT.STEM4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/product.stem4.webp","colour":"#1e2328","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_STEM4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_STEM4_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1616,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BIOSHIP_STEM4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_EGG_14","name":"GRUB COCOON","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Vile Larval Sac","description":"A writhing cocoon, the spawning sac of a grub of the vile brood. Scans indicate the being within has anomalous genetic material, an unstable binding of several independent strands.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.BUGFIEND.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.bugfiend.webp","colour":"#4d2987","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_14_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_14_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_EGG_14","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FISH_BOB1","name":"GRUB FLOAT","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Customised Fishing Equipment","description":"An exclusive Fishing Rig Customisation, altering the appearance of the float. Transform the appearance of your fishing equipment from the fishing rig's bait management page.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.S17.FISHINGFLOATGRUB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.s17.fishingfloatgrub.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FLOAT_GRUB_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FLOAT_CUSTOM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FISH_BOB1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET25","name":"H. COLDVAUM EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The creature inside wriggles and flexes its fluffy toes, yearning to feel soil between them. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for a protective disposition, brimming with affection for its Traveller companion.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.PET25.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.pet25.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_25_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_25_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET25","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET12","name":"H. OAKARBOE EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The beast within wriggles and fidgets, yearning to unfurl its long neck. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for a loyal nature, longing to find a master to place at the centre of its universe.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.PET12.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.pet12.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_12_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_12_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET12","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET11","name":"H. SKIPWHAE EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The stocky creature within snuffles curiously at the inside of the shell. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for a whimsical nature, with a proclivity towards joyful play.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.PET11.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.pet11.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_11_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_11_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET11","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EMOTE03","name":"HA!","kind":"Product","category":"Emote","categoryKey":"Emote","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Gesture","description":"An exclusive gesture. This can be selected from the Quick Menu to share moments of amusement with other explorers.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EMOTE03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.emote03.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"EMOTE_HA_U","descriptionKey":"EMOTE_HA_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EMOTE03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP24","name":"HABIKA BF3","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. The Habiki BF3 is a hauler specialised in economic take-off, with Efficient Thrusters and a Launch Auto-Charger minimising launch fuel consumption. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP24.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship24.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_24_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_24_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP24","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"CHART_SPACEBASE","name":"HABITABLE ASTEROID CHART","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Anomalous Cartographic Data","description":"A map to a location in deep space. A large, habitable asteroid has been marked. Select the map and use Plot Route () to pin the location in your navigation systems. New maps can be gained by exchanging deep-space resources with an Outpost Quartermaster.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.STARMAP.BASEPLATFORM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.starmap.baseplatform.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_CHART_SPACEBASE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CHART_SPACEBASE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":30000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/CHART_SPACEBASE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WALKER_PROD_3","name":"HACKED BRAIN","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Anomalous Material","description":"Shifting nanite clusters sewn together with a pugneum filament, this circuit is painfully hot to the touch. The purple light that leaks from within its wiring has softened, as if it has become less hostile. Previously embedded within a Sentinel Walker, this semi-organic computer has been altered by Iteration: Tethys. Its new-found freedom from the Atlas has been noted by the universe.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.WALKERBRAIN3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.walkerbrain3.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WALKER_PROD_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WALKER_PROD_3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":35000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/WALKER_PROD_3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP08B","name":"HADACH'S DISCOVERY KH3","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, pre-fitted with an upgraded Infra-Knife for efficient destruction of hostile ships. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.SHIP08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.ship08.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_08B_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_08_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP08B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FISHCORE","name":"HADAL CORE","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Horrific Sample","description":"A highly-pressurised fleshy orb. One can feel it push back when touched, a flash of bioluminescence stirring in the inky black core of this mysterious object.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISHCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.fishcore.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISHCORE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISHCORE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":97500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FISHCORE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREI_TRAIL_TUR","name":"HADAL FREIGHTER TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Freighter Engine Flare Override","description":"An exclusive Freighter Engine Flare Modifier. Organically altering the hue of freighter exhaust, this engine modification utilises the bioluminescence of abyssal sea creatures to generate its striking turquoise colouration. Transform the appearance of your freighter at the Upgrade Control Terminal on the bridge.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FREIGHTJETS.TURQUOISE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.freightjets.turquoise.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_TUR_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_TUR_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREI_TRAIL_TUR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP65","name":"HALCYON DANCE VQ6","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class fighter benefits from damage and manoeuvrability bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP65.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship65.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_65_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_FIGHTER_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP65","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_DECAL03","name":"HAND OF APPROVAL DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a universal hand gesture signifying approval.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_OKHAND_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_OKHAND_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_DECAL03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN11","name":"HAND-MADE LIGHT CAPACITOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This A-class weapon comes equipped with a range of pre-installed technologies and upgrades. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.GUN11.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.gun11.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_11_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_GENERIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN11","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECH2","name":"HANDFUL OF COGS","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of broken down starship, created by a Starship Outfitting Terminal at a Space Station. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.TECH2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.tech2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":10000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECH2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECHMT2","name":"HANDFUL OF COGS","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Multi-Tool Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of recycled Multi-Tool technology, created by a Multi-Tool Decommissioning Terminal aboard the Space Anomaly. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component1.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_MT_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":230000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECHMT2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SET_MOOD_NEG","name":"Happiness","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SETTLEMENT/NEGATIVEHAPPINESS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/settlement/negativehappiness.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SETTLEMENT_STAT_HAPPINESS","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/SET_MOOD_NEG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SET_MOOD_POS","name":"Happiness","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SETTLEMENT/POSITIVEHAPPINESS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/settlement/positivehappiness.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SETTLEMENT_STAT_HAPPINESS","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/SET_MOOD_POS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN20","name":"HARBINGER OF THE STARS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This alien weapon comes with a devastating close-range Scatter Blaster and Paralysis Mortar installed. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.GUN20.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.gun20.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_20_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_20_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN20","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BIOSHIP_GROWTH3","name":"HARDENED SHELL","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Living Starship Organ","description":"Translucent, reflective, iridescent, impossibly strong. This shell swiftly reconfigures itself upon damage, knitting itself back together stronger than ever before. The newly formed bonds create a memory in glass, reflecting back the light absorbed at the moment of damage. It awaits its host.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/BIOTECH.SCALES.MOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/biotech.scales.mod.webp","colour":"#1e2328","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_GROWTH3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_GROWTH3_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1616,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BIOSHIP_GROWTH3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_SENT_HEAD","name":"HARDFRAME BODY","kind":"Technology","category":"Mech","categoryKey":"Mech","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Minotaur Core Replacement","description":"A collection of salvaged components from a Sentinel Hardframe, reconditioned to fit the Minotaur Heavy Exocraft Hybrid. Will function as a semi-autonomous artificial pilot plugin. Installation allows the Minotaur to traverse planets itself and engage in combat or mining activities to support its primary operator. The AI pilot will always cede control to the primary operator when they enter the cockpit.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.MECH.SENT.HEAD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.mech.sent.head.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_HEAD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MECH_SENT_HEAD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_PROD","name":"HARDFRAME ENGINE","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Anomalous Material","description":"This complex mechanical unit was once the central combustion chamber at the heart of a Sentinel Hardframe unit. Though now cool to the touch, it still glows with a sinister red heat...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MECHCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.mechcore.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MECH_PROD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MECH_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":28000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MECH_PROD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_SENT_L_ARM","name":"HARDFRAME LEFT ARM","kind":"Technology","category":"Mech","categoryKey":"Mech","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Minotaur Limb Replacement","description":"A collection of salvaged components from a Sentinel Hardframe, reconditioned to fit the Minotaur Heavy Exocraft Hybrid. When installed alongside a Minotaur Laser, it transforms the mining laser into a powerful combat upgrade with the ability to deal heavy damaged to stunned entities.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.MECH.SENT.LARM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.mech.sent.larm.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_L_ARM_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_L_ARM_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MECH_SENT_L_ARM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_SENT_LEGS","name":"HARDFRAME LEGS","kind":"Technology","category":"Mech","categoryKey":"Mech","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Minotaur Limb Replacement","description":"A collection of salvaged components from a Sentinel Hardframe, reconditioned to fit the Minotaur Heavy Exocraft Hybrid. Installation will significantly improve the Minotaur's engine and mobility systems.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.MECH.SENT.LEGS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.mech.sent.legs.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_LEGS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_LEGS_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MECH_SENT_LEGS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_SENT_R_ARM","name":"HARDFRAME RIGHT ARM","kind":"Technology","category":"Mech","categoryKey":"Mech","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Minotaur Limb Replacement","description":"A collection of salvaged components from a Sentinel Hardframe, reconditioned to fit the Minotaur Heavy Exocraft Hybrid. This limb override also functions as its own dedicated combat system. It deploys high-velocity stun projectiles and serves as an excellent support weapon to the Minotaur's primary cannon. Use to cycle available weapon modes.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.MECH.SENT.RARM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.mech.sent.rarm.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_R_ARM_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MECH_SENT_R_ARM_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MECH_SENT_R_ARM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_COLDPLANT1","name":"HARDY SHRUB","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This tough conifer pumps its sap with anti-freezing enzymes, allowing it to survive unimaginably low temperatures. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.COLDPLANT01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.coldplant01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_COLDPLANT_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_COLDPLANT_1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_COLDPLANT1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPBRAIN_CLEAN","name":"HARMONIC BRAIN","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Harnessed Sentience","description":"The central processing unit of a Sentinel interceptor ship. The circuitry appears stable, pulsing with a regular electrical heartbeat. It no longer reacts angrily to my presence. Status: DOCILE Install this unit in a disabled Sentinel ship to unlock its vestigial cockpit and enable manual piloting.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SENTINELSHIPBRAIN.CLEANED.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.sentinelshipbrain.cleaned.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIP_BRAIN_CLEAN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIP_BRAIN_CLEAN_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480016,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SHIPBRAIN_CLEAN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CM_CHOC","name":"HAUNTED CHOCOLATE DREAMS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Wailing Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CUPCAKEEVIL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.cupcakeevil.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CM_CHOC_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CM","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":148000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CM_CHOC","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_S15","name":"HAUNTED FILLET","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A piece of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.OCTOPUS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.octopus.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_S15_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_MED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":39000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_S15","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_FIEND","name":"HAUNTED PIE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.TARTEVIL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.tartevil.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PIE_FIEND_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":52000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_FIEND","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_FIEND","name":"HAUNTED WAFER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_FIEND_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":80000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_FIEND","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_HEAD2","name":"HAVOC COIL","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Head","description":"This ornate centerpiece forms the head of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFHEAD.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffhead.2.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_HEAD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_CORE2","name":"HAVOC CORE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Core","description":"This tightly-package electronic unit forms the core of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFCORE.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffcore.2.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":646,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_CORE2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_POLE2","name":"HAVOC LANCE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Backbone","description":"This long pole forms the backbone of a traditional Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFPOLE.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffpole.2.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":333,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_POLE2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"POWERGLOVE","name":"HAZ-MAT GAUNTLET","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exosuit Augmentation","description":"Upgrades the metallic shielding of the Exosuit's gloves. An advanced blend of reinforced metal and catalytic shielding allows the user to safely handle hazardous substances, as well as perform the necessary feats of strength required to harvest certain farmable flora.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE1/TECH.POWERGLOVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update1/tech.powerglove.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"POWERGLOVE_NAME","descriptionKey":"POWERGLOVE_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMulti