 hard-working freighter crews who keep the universe fuelled and fed.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER08C.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster08c.webp","colour":"#2c8c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER8C_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER8C_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER08C","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"VAULT_BOOTS","name":"HEIRLOOM BOOTS","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Boots","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. A lavish set of exosuit armour, inspired by the traditional designs of Balaron textile merchants. Ornate detailing and plush, padded fabrics elevate the attractiveness and status of the wearer. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S21.VAULTBOOTS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s21.vaultboots.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPED_VAULT_BOOTS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPED_VAULT_SET_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/VAULT_BOOTS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"VAULT_ARMOUR","name":"HEIRLOOM BREASTPLATE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Armour","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. A lavish set of exosuit armour, inspired by the traditional designs of Balaron textile merchants. Ornate detailing and plush, padded fabrics elevate the attr