conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATSTEW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatstew.webp","colour":"#db2400","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_STEW_M_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":18800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_STEW_M_VEG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_HERB","name":"HERBAL CRUNCHIE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_HERB_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":60000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_HERB","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"CARBON_SEAL","name":"HERMETIC SEAL","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Crafted Technology Component","description":"A high-performance carbon seal, able to withstand both the harsh interstellar environment and the rigours of intensive, high-energy industrial use. User is advised to regularly check seal integrity after installation.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMMODITY5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.commodity5.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"CARBON_SEAL_NAME","descriptionKey":"CARBON_SEAL_DESC","secondary":"Catalyst","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":2,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/CARBON_SEAL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EMOTE09","name":"HEROIC POSE","kind":"Product","category":"Emote","categoryKey":"Emote","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Gesture","description":"An exclusive gesture. This can be selected from the Quick Menu. Strike a dramatic pose in front of abandoned structures, towering mineral formations, and colossal predatory lifeforms.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EMOTE09.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.emote09.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"EMOTE_HEROIC_U","descriptionKey":"EMOTE_HEROIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EMOTE09","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ALLOY3","name":"HEROX","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Alloy Metal","description":"Combined neutral alloy with uses that range from pharmacology all the way to heavy industry. Crafted from Ionised Cobalt and Ammonia. Forms the backbone of galactic alloy trading.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.METALLIC.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.metallic.3.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ALLOY_SIMPLE_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ALLOY_SIMPLE_3_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":25000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ALLOY3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HEXCORE","name":"HEX CORE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Contained Reality Glitch","description":"This strange energy orb constantly vibrates, emitting a low-frequency drone. Slight variations in the pattern repeat over and over, almost as if it is attempting to relay a message.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.HEXCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.hexcore.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HEX_CORE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HEX_CORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/HEXCORE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_P_GLITCH","name":"HEXABERRY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An edible plant, harvested from planetary flora. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.PLANT.GLITCHWILD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.plant.glitchwild.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PLANT_GLITCH_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_P_GLITCH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPECIAL_POOP","name":"HEXITE","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unrefined Organic Element","description":"An odourless, mineral-rich substance with a hexagonal crystalline structure, harvested from the faecal matter of a creature.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.HEXCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.hexcore.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HEXITE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HEXITE_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":654,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/SPECIAL_POOP","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ODD_COM_S2","name":"HEXSCALE MINNOW","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ODD_COM_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.SMALL.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.small.3.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_COM_S2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_COM_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":1000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ODD_COM_S2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"VEHICLE_GRIP3","name":"HI-SLIDE SUSPENSION","kind":"Technology","category":"Exocraft","categoryKey":"Exocraft","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Exocraft Handling Modification","description":"Overhauls Exocraft handling values through a combination of software tweaks, pressure adjustments and the insertion of microgravity wells into key suspension components. Specifically tuned to increase the ability of the Exocraft to slide.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.TRACTION.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.traction.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"VEHICLE_GRIP3_NAME","descriptionKey":"VEHICLE_GRIP3_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/VEHICLE_GRIP3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_VEG","name":"HIGH-FIBRE PIE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATPIE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatpie.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PIE_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":40000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_VEG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREI_TRAIL_GRAV","name":"HIGH-GRAVITY FREIGHTER TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Freighter Engine Flare Override","description":"An exclusive Freighter Engine Flare Modifier. High-energy exhaust gases rapid condense as they exit the freighter's colossal engines, collapsing into micro-singularities. Transform the appearance of your freighter at the Upgrade Control Terminal on the bridge.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FREIGHTJETS.GRAVITY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.freightjets.gravity.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_01_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FREI_TRAIL_01_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREI_TRAIL_GRAV","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SUB_BINOCS","name":"HIGH-POWER SONAR","kind":"Technology","category":"Submarine","categoryKey":"Submarine","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Submarine Analysis Device","description":"A high-detail sonar device, capable of upgrading the scanner technology aboard a Nautilon-class submarine to Analysis Visor levels, pinning to the HUD all information typically revealed by the Analysis Visor. Press to activate the High-Power Sonar.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.SUBSCAN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.subscan.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SUB_BINOCS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SUB_BINOCS_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SUB_BINOCS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SENT_LASER","name":"HIJACKED LASER","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Repurposed High-Energy Beam","description":"This Multi-Tool is made with material and methods known to no conventional manufacturer, its core a unfathomable array of impossible optics and glassy foam. Nonetheless, there is a layer of recogniseable technology. It shows signs of having been tampered with by an unknown craftsman, who has repurposed its scanner array into a high-powered mining laser. Powered by Carbon-based Elements. Fire the beam with .","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.LASERSENTINEL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.lasersentinel.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SENT_LASER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SENT_LASER_NAME_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SENT_LASER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MYSTERY_TRACKER","name":"HISTORIOGRAPHICAL DOSIMETER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Personal Reality Flux Monitor","description":"Nada has detected a new pattern emerging in the stories of the Gek, Korvax, and Vy'keen. The dosimeter measures exposure to historiographical flux around key artifact sites. Recordings of unusual historical shifts will enable Nada to trace the signal. Assist Nada and Polo in their research by using this device to transmit historial data from alien artifact sites.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.MYSTERYTRACKER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.mysterytracker.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MYSTERY_TRACKER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MYSTERY_TRACKER_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MYSTERY_TRACKER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP10","name":"HIWAMIHA OF DESTINY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, pre-fitted with an upgraded Positron Ejector for efficient destruction of hostile ships. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.SHIP10.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.ship10.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_10_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_10_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP10","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP21","name":"HIWAMIHA OF DESTINY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This smuggler's craft is shielded by superheated ablative armour, and equipped with scan deflector technology to disguise contraband cargo from system authorities. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP21.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship21.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_21_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_21_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP21","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EMOTE11","name":"HOLOGRAM: BLOB","kind":"Product","category":"Emote","categoryKey":"Emote","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Gesture","description":"An exclusive gesture. This can be selected from the Quick Menu to generate a handheld hologram of an adorable miniature blob creature.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EMOTE11.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.emote11.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_BLOB_U","descriptionKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_BLOB_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EMOTE11","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EMOTE12","name":"HOLOGRAM: FRIGATE","kind":"Product","category":"Emote","categoryKey":"Emote","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Gesture","description":"An exclusive gesture. This can be selected from the Quick Menu to generate a handheld hologram of a sleek and powerful frigate.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EMOTE12.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.emote12.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_FRIGATE_U","descriptionKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_FRIGATE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EMOTE12","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EMOTE14","name":"HOLOGRAM: MULTI-TOOL","kind":"Product","category":"Emote","categoryKey":"Emote","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Gesture","description":"An exclusive gesture. This can be selected from the Quick Menu to generate a handheld hologram of a Multi-Tool pistol.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EMOTE14.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.emote14.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_WEAPON_U","descriptionKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_WEAPON_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EMOTE14","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EMOTE13","name":"HOLOGRAM: STARSHIP","kind":"Product","category":"Emote","categoryKey":"Emote","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Gesture","description":"An exclusive gesture. This can be selected from the Quick Menu to generate a handheld hologram of a classic fighter starship.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EMOTE13.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.emote13.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_SHIP_U","descriptionKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_SHIP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EMOTE13","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EMOTE15","name":"HOLOGRAM: SYSTEM","kind":"Product","category":"Emote","categoryKey":"Emote","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Gesture","description":"An exclusive gesture. This can be selected from the Quick Menu to generate a handheld hologram of a miniature solar system.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EMOTE15.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.emote15.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_SYSTEM_U","descriptionKey":"EMOTE_HOLO_SYSTEM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EMOTE15","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FRIG_BOOST_EXP","name":"HOLOGRAPHIC ANALYSER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Consumable Frigate Upgrade","description":"A temporary frigate upgrade that lasts for one expedition. This powerful analytic computer overclocks the existing fleet systems, allowing for faster-than-light calculations. Heat is a problem, and the chips do not last long.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FRIGBOOST.EXPLORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.frigboost.explore.webp","colour":"#0063b7","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FRIG_BOOST_EXP_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FRIG_BOOST_EXP_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":75000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FRIG_BOOST_EXP","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_PLANET_HOLO","name":"HOLOGRAPHIC CHART PROJECTOR","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"System Simulation Device","description":"A decorative model of a star system, complete with holographic representations of various stellar objects. A small, self-contained, perpetual motion device generates the small amount of power required to continue the projection.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.PLANETHOLOGRAM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.planethologram.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_PLANET_HOLO_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_PLANET_HOLO_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BLD_PLANET_HOLO","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_COMPONENT4","name":"HOLOGRAPHIC CRANKSHAFT","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Industrial)","description":"Packed and separated data containers for holographic crankshafts. Real crankshafts are frequently too large, noisy or hard-to-maintain for use in delicate machines. When faced with such a situation, high-tech manufacturers turn to these holographic substitutes.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component4.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMP_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMP_4_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":30000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_COMPONENT4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_HOLOGEK","name":"HOLOGRAPHIC FRIEND","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Simulated Trader Lifeform","description":"An exclusive buildable base ornament. This holographic Gek attendant provides eternal friendship to even the loneliest of habitable bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.HOLOGEK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.hologek.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_HOLOGEK_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_HOLOGEK_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BLD_HOLOGEK","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_TOYSPHERE","name":"HOLOGRAPHIC GLOBE GADGET","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Decoration","description":"An exclusive decorative curiosity for bases. This gadget emits a spherical hologram, representative of one of the quintillions of celestial bodies populating the galaxies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TOYSPHERE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.toysphere.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_TOYSPHERE_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_TOYSPHERE_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_TOYSPHERE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S8_BEACON","name":"HOMEWORLD REPEATER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"A Last Link Home","description":"A makeshift device, cobbled from salvaged electronic components kept in deep storage for many years. This jumble of wires will attempt to make contact with the last-known remnants of the freighter's homeworld. Select the device and select Broadcast () to begin the location process.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ROGUEFINDER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.roguefinder.webp","colour":"#311a49","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_S8_FRE_BEACON_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_S8_FRE_BEACON_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S8_BEACON","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_HONEYBUT","name":"HONEY BUTTER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BUTTER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.butter.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_HONEYBUT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":32000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_HONEYBUT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_DNUT_HON","name":"HONEY DOUGHNUT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be hig