,"description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Thick, Sweet Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKEBLOB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cakeblob.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CB_CACTUS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CB","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":71500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CB_CACTUS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SWITCH_SHIP01","name":"HORIZON VECTOR NX","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This compact fighter craft boasts superior manoeuvrability, giving it an edge in space combat. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.SWITCH.SHIP01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.switch.ship01.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SWIT_SHIP_01_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SWIT_SHIP_01_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SWITCH_SHIP01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_HORROR","name":"HORRIFIC DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add a touch of macabre decoration to bases. This decal depicts the 'exotic' fauna discovered breeding in the remains of an unlucky intergalactic freighter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECALHORROR.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decalhorror.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_HORROR_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_HORROR_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_HORROR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_SPOOKYHEAD","name":"HORRIFIC FLESH-HELMET","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Anomalous Face Transformation","description":"Naturally transform your appearance via the application of a flesh-hungry parasite. This living being partially fuses with the brainstem of its host, sealing their symbiosis. Cautiously transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SPOOKYHEAD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.spookyhead.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_SPOOKYHEAD_NAME","descriptionKey":"SPEC_SPOOKYHEAD_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_SPOOKYHEAD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_EYEBALLS","name":"HORRIFYING MUSH","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FIENDCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.fiendcore.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_EYEBALLS_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":90000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_EYEBALLS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CK_MCUST","name":"HORRIFYING, GOOEY DELIGHT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Cake Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CUPCAKEEVIL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.cupcakeevil.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CK_MCUST_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CK","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":200000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CK_MCUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP02","name":"HOSHIS HP7","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, pre-fitted with an upgraded Infra-Knife for efficient destruction of hostile ships. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.SHIP02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.ship02.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_02_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI