sity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This specialised tool comes with several scanning upgrades pre-installed, to increase the efficiency and profitability of scanning planetary discoveries. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.GUN04.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.gun04.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_04_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_04_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPBRAIN","name":"HYALINE BRAIN","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Sentience Vessel","description":"The central processing unit of a Sentinel interceptor ship. The circuitry writhes microscopically, constantly rearranging itself as it scans for anomalies. A vital component for any entity wishing to construct their own Pilot Interface for a Sentinel Interceptor. Status: VOLATILE","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SENTINELSHIPBRAIN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.sentinelshipbrain.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIP_BRAIN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIP_BRAIN_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":35000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SHIPBRAIN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CP_CACTUS","name":"HYBRID CAKE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Thick, Sweet Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKEBLOB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cakeblob.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CP_CACTUS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CB","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":71500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CP_CACTUS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HYDRALIC","name":"HYDRAULIC WIRING","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Crafted Technology Component","description":"Specialist wiring and control threads, this flexible material allows the transmission of power and signals, as well as offering direct manipulation of remote components. Used in the creation of a wide range of advanced technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.HYDRALIC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.hydralic.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HYDRALIC_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HYDRALIC_DESC","secondary":"Catalyst","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":3600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":2,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/HYDRALIC","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPEASY_DMG3","name":"HYDRAULICS DAMAGE","kind":"Technology","category":"Ship","categoryKey":"Ship","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Starship Component","description":"Starship subsystem severely damaged. Slot cannot be used for storage or technology until damage is repaired. Use to begin repair process. Core starship functionality is not affected. Re