Key":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Anomalous Face Transformation","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. This part silicone, part biological helmet can detect and replicate the facial muscle movements of the wearer, creating the appearance of a natural head. It is fully compatible with exosuit technology and provides all protection of a traditional helmet. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXOTICHEAD5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.exotichead5.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_EXOTICHEAD_05_NAME","descriptionKey":"SPEC_EXOTIC_HEAD5_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EXOTIC5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_EXOTIC8","name":"ITERATION: TETHYS VISAGE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Anomalous Face Transformation","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. This part silicone, part biological helmet can detect and replicate the facial muscle movements of the wearer, creating the appearance of a natural head. It is fully compatible with exosuit technology and provides all protection of a traditional helmet. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXOTICHEAD8.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.exotichead8.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_EXOTICHEAD_08_NAME","descriptionKey":"SPEC_EXOTIC_HEAD8_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_EXOTIC8","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP34","name":"IYOSH'S COLOURLESS FLIGHT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class fighter benefits from damage and manoeuvrability bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP34.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship34.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_34_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_FIGHTER_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP34","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET02","name":"J. CROCONAKEUM EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The graceful creature within beats its soft wings against the egg, impatient to be hatched. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential to be a diligent companion, scouting for resources from great heights.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.PET02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.pet02.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_02_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_02_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET08","name":"J. XENOARYII EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The synthetic lifeform within lies perfectly still, conserving its energy. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for autonomous traits.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.PET08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.pet08.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_08_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_08_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET08","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_P_TOXWILD","name":"JADE PEAS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An edible plant, harvested from planetary flora. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.PLANT.TOXWILD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.plant.toxwild.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PLANT_TOX_WILD_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_P_TOXWILD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CG_JAM","name":"JAM CURIOSITY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Proto-Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.C