nd":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A piece of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SQUID.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.squid.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_JELLY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_MED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":33100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_JELLY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JET1","name":"JETPACK","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Aerial Propulsion Booster","description":"Provides the Exosuit with advanced movement capabilities, including temporary flight. Control thrust with . The flightpack uses energy from the Exosuit Life Support system to pressurise and vent bursts of gas, propelling the user into the air. Jetpack can be temporarily overloaded by gathering Deuterium-rich plants, causing a dramatic increase in available thrust.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.JETPACK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.jetpack.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"JET1_NAME","descriptionKey":"JET1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/JET1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JETS_BUBBLE","name":"JETPACK BUBBLE TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Jetpack Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Specially conditioned oil is added to the jetpack's exhaust jets, creating a stream of pearlescent bubbles as it operates. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.JETS.BUBBLE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.jets.bubble.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_BUBBLE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_BUBBLE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/JETS_BUBBLE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP07","name":"JIRISHI'S PROSPECT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, pre-fitted with an upgraded Hyperdrive for efficient galactic exploration. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.SHIP07.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.ship07.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_07_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_07_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP07","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_GRUB","name":"JUICY GRUB","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Vile Larva","description":"This pupa, pulsating and warm, has begun its transformation from throbbing sac of mucus into an unspeakably vile insectoid. Theoretically processable in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products. WARNING: grub-sac will release powerful pheromones if violated.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.BUGGRUB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.buggrub.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_GRUB_POD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_GRUB_POD_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":11000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_GRUB","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_BUG","name":"JUICY THORAX","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.OFFAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.offal.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BUG_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_BUG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_LUSH_RARE_M2","name":"JUNGLE REDFIN","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_LUSH_RARE_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BIG.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.big.1.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_RARE_M2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_RARE_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_LUSH_RARE_M2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN25","name":"KALIMSKYV'S RAYCAST ANALYSER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This A-class weapon comes equipped with a range of pre-installed technologies and upgrades. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.GUN25.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.gun25.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_25_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_GENERIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN25","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_P_WATER","name":"KELP RICE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An edible plant, harvested from planetary flora. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.PLANT.WATERWILD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.plant.waterwild.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PLANT_WATER_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_P_WATER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PLANT_WATER","name":"KELP SAC","kind":"Resource","category":"Flora","categoryKey":"Flora","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Harvested Agricultural Substance","description":"A rubbery, luminescent sac harvested from underwater Candle Kelp plants. Agricultural science has not yet tamed the Candle Kelp. As such, these sacs cannot be farmed.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.PLANT.WATER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.plant.water.webp","colour":"#005c83","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PLANTSUB_WATER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PLANTSUB_WATER_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":41,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/PLANT_WATER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TRASH_1","name":"KELP STRAND","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Collected Flotsam","description":"A piece of flotsam, wrenched from its years of drifting in the water when it became entangled in a fishing lure. Of little use to anyone.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.WEED.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.weed.1.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_WEED1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Trade good"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TRASH_1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_FUEL5","name":"KINETIC DYNAMO","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Chargeable Power Unit","description":"The kinetic dynamo takes a small initial charge and uses it to run power-harvesting systems that tap into the orbit of the planet. This frees autonomous machinery from frequent fuel inspections, allowing them to endure extremely long maintenance cycles.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MAINTTECH.FUEL5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mainttech.fuel5.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_FUEL5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_FUEL5_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_FUEL5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN18","name":"KISS OF CLARITY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This pistol comes with a range of utility technologies pre-installed. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.GUN18.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.gun18.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_18_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_18_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN18","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXP_STANDING_DN","name":"KORVAX","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/MISSIONS/MISSIONFACTION.KORVAX.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/missions/missionfaction.korvax.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STANDING_EXP","descriptionKey