 Personal Flair. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BANNER.KORVAX.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.banner.korvax.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXP_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BANNER_EXP","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_BUBPIPE_L","name":"L-SHAPED BUBBLE DUCT","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decorative Aqueduct","description":"This clear glass aqueduct encloses a perpetually churning supply of 'liquid'. This L-shaped configuration allows for curves in duct connections. Weld together with different duct shapes to create mesmerising displays in your base.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BUBBLEPIPE_L.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.bubblepipe_l.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_BUBBLE_PIPE_L_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_BUBBLE_PIPE_L_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_BUBPIPE_L","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HOT_RARE_S1","name":"LAMPTIP RAY","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.RAY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.ray.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_HOT_RARE_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_STARTSHIP","name":"LANDED SHIP DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a landed starship, awaiting the return of its pilot.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL16.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal16.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_STARTSHIP_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_STARTSHIP_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_STARTSHIP","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_WPLANT8","name":"LANTERN KELP","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"Fleshy \"lanterns\" grow along these delicate kelp laces, producing a scent and glow irresistable to many species of aquatic pollinator. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.WATERPLANT08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.waterplant08.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_WATERPLANT_8_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_WATERPLANT_8_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_WPLANT8","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_ROCKETS","name":"LARGE ROCKET TUBES","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Rockets Upgrade","description":"Expands the loading chamber of the starship Rocket Launcher, improving exhaust performance and allowing for significantly faster heat recovery.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.ROCKETMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.rocketmod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_ROCKETS_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_ROCKETS_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_ROCKETS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"GRUB_HAT","name":"LARVA TANK","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Helmet","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. A unique cranium/aquarium interchange enclosing a wriggling larva. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.FISHBOWLGRUB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.fishbowlgrub.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_GRUB_HAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SPEC_GRUB_HAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/GRUB_HAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FIENDCORE","name":"LARVAL CORE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Monstrosity","description":"A pulsating jellied orb, this gooey sphere is warm to the touch. Its stench triggers a primal fear in mortal beings, a deep-seated gnawing that begs you to drop it and flee.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FIENDCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.fiendcore.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FIENDCORE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FIENDCORE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":65000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FIENDCORE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"CV_SLASR3","name":"laser defence array","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Combat","categoryKey":"Combat","rarity":"Epic","subtitle":"A-Class %NAME% Upgrade","description":"An extremely powerful upgrade for the Starship Phase Beam. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: damage output, and overheat tolerance.","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPLAS","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPLAS3_DESC","secondary":"T_SHIPLAS","tags":["2 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/upgrade-module/CV_SLASR3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_DRILL","name":"LATTICED SINEW","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.SAUSAGE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.sausage.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_DRILL_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","C