n a variety of water conditions. This rig was once owned by the legendary Lost Angler. Access the fishing rig by pressing and cast your line into a body of water with . With a fish hooked, press and hold to haul in your catch.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.S15FISHLASER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.s15fishlaser.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_S15_FISHLASER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_S15_FISHLASER_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_S15_LASER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S15_FISHLASER","name":"LOST ANGLER'S RIG","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Unique Angling Device","description":"A versatile piece of angling equipment, enabling the user to fish in a variety of water conditions. This rig was once owned by the legendary Lost Angler. Access the fishing rig by pressing and cast your line into a body of water with . With a fish hooked, press and hold to haul in your catch.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.S15FISHLASER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.s15fishlaser.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_S15_FISHLASER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_S15_FISHLASER_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/S15_FISHLASER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_DIVEHELMET","name":"LOST BATHYSPHERE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Helmet","description":"A haunted Exosuit Appearance Override. Even once removed, the wearer will forever hear the whispering call of the deep ocean... Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BLOB_B.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.blob_b.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WATERHELMET_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WATERHELMET_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_DIVEHELMET","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_UWTREAS","name":"LOST BATHYSPHERE DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a legendary haunted diving mask.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL18.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal18.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_UWTREASURE_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_UWTREASURE_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_UWTREAS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FARMPROD2","name":"LUBRICANT","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Advanced Agricultural Product","description":"A synthetic lubricant that reduces wear and prolongs the lifespan of technologies with moving parts. Crafted from Faecium and Gamma Root.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/FARMPROD.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/farmprod.2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FARMPROD_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FARMPROD_2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":110000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FARMPROD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPJUMP_ROBO","name":"LUMINANCE ENGINE","kind":"Technology","category":"Robot Ship","categoryKey":"RobotShip","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Repurposed Sub-Light Drive","description":"Aligns the ship's electromagnetic emissions with A T L A S waves, providing basic propulsion and Pulse Jump capability. The sub-light drive hungers for tritium or radiant shards. Hold to engage Pulse Jump. Hold to initiate in-flight speed boost.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/ROBOTSHIP.PULSE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/robotship.pulse.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPJUMP_ROBO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPJUMP_ROBO_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SHIPJUMP_ROBO","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DEEP_RARE_M2","name":"LUMINESCENT CORAL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.CORAL.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.coral.3.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_M2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DEEP_RARE_M2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_DONUT","name":"LUMPEN DOUGHNUT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DOUGHNUT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.doughnut.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_DONUT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":48000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_DONUT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_BALL","name":"LUMPY BRAINSTEM","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.OFFAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.offal.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BALL_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_BALL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_HOTPLANT05","name":"MAGMA SHARD","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A solid chunk of igneous rock, shaped by thousands of heating and cooling cycles. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.HOTPLANT05.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.hotplant05.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_5_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_HOTPLANT05","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HOT_EPIC_L1","name":"MAGMA SHARK","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Rare Fish","description":"UI_FISH_HOT_EPIC_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT3.FISH.SHARK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product3.fish.shark.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_EPIC_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_EPIC_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":30000,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_HOT_EPIC_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_HOTPLANT04","name":"MAGMATIC ERUPTION","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This sculptural piece is a result of the anomalous geology on some superheated worlds. Molten lava burst forth from beneath the ground and then congealed rapidly, preserving what would otherwise be a moment of ephemeral beauty. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.HOTPLANT04.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.hotplant04.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_4_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_HOTPLANT04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH2","name":"MAGNETIC LOCK","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"An advanced locking device. A polarity incident has caused it to seal shut permanently.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MAINTTECH.TECH2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mainttech.tech2.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH2_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAGNET","name":"MAGNETIC RESONATOR","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Crafted Technology Component","description":"An electromagnetic frequency oscillator, able to function in a wide-range of conditions thanks to both ferrous and non-ferrous magnetic properties. Used in the creation of a wide range of advanced technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MAGNET.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.magnet.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAGNET_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAGNET_DESC","secondary":"Catalyst","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":6150,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":2,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MAGNET","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"LAND3","name":"MAGNETISED FERRITE","kind":"Resource","category":"Metal","categoryKey":"Metal","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Charged Metallic Element","description":"Highly processed metal, requiring several stages of processing in a Refiner. Used in the creation of advanced structures and technologies. Avoid ingestion.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.LAND.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.land.3.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_LAND3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_LAND3_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Easy to refine"],"baseValue":82,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/LAND3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER21A","name":"MAGNETISM POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This symbolic artwork represents the polarity of the Traveller's nature, the push and pull of the universe, the flux of exploration.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S21.POSTERA.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s21.postera.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER21A_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER21A_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER21A","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP53","name":"MAGNIFICENT OMEN T09","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class explorer benefits from hyperdrive and launcher bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP53.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship53.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_53_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SCIENTIFIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP53","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ALLOY5","name":"MAGNO-GOLD","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Alloy Metal","description":"Highly prized and lustrous alloy. Popular with traders of all known primary galactic races. Crafted from Ionised Cobalt and Phosphorus. Easily recognisable by its bright red glow and strong magnetic field.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.METALLIC.5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.metallic.5.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ALLOY_SIMPLE_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ALLOY_SIMPLE_5_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":25000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ALLOY5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FISHBAIT_STORM","name":"MAGPULSE LURE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Fishing Bait","description":"A specialist lure, designed to attract fish that are only active during storms. Locate your Fishing Rig and begin bait application with .","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISHBAIT.STORM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.fishbait.storm.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"N