 that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.RAW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.raw.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_GENERIC_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_MEAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_FLYER","name":"MEATY WINGS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.RAW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.raw.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_FLYER_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_FLYER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_EGG_19","name":"MECHA-MOUSE EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Robotic Spawn Capsule","description":"A metal 'egg' capsule, ready to hatch! A muffled squeaking can be heard from the synthetic creature inside the capsule. Scans indicate the being within is programmed to be intelligent and loving, through prone to gnawing on electronics.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S19.ROBOTRODENT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s19.robotrodent.webp","colour":"#4d2987","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_19_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_19_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_EGG_19","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRUCK_WHEELS08","name":"MECHANICAL LEGS","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exocraft Customisation Option","description":"A custom running gear module for a terrestrial vehicle, compatible with the Colossus large Exocraft. Recalibrate Exocraft visuals from the Colossus Geobay.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.TRUCKWHEELS08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.truckwheels08.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRUCK_WHEELS08_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRUCK_WHEELS_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRUCK_WHEELS08","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_PETCUST11","name":"MECHANICAL PAW","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Companion Accessory","description":"An exclusive Companion Appearance Enhancement. This biomechanical remnant is a constant reminder of the many and diverse forms that existence can take. Earn the trust of wild animals to adopt companions. Interact with companions to customise their appearance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.PETCUSTOM11.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.petcustom11.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_PET_CUSTOM_11_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_PET_CUSTOM_11_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_PETCUST11","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER13A","name":"MEDITATION POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. A poster to contemplate as your mind soars through the empty endless void of space...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER13A.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster13a.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER13A_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER13A_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER13A","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DUST_LEG_XL","name":"MEGALODON","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Legendary Fish","description":"\"The apex of marine predation, a perfect killing machine. Beware.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.SHARK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.shark.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_LEG_XL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_LEG_XL_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":200000,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DUST_LEG_XL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXO_PROT_COLD","name":"MEGAWATT HEATER","kind":"Technology","category":"Exocraft","categoryKey":"Exocraft","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Exocraft Hazard Protection Unit","description":"Installs a powerful heater into the Exocraft, keeping the cabin a habitable temperature even in the most freezing of conditions. Entirely prevents all damage or energy drain while inside an Exocraft in freezing environments.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PROTECTCOLD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.protectcold.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXOHAZ_COLD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXOHAZ_COLD_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/EXO_PROT_COLD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_LUSH_RARE_S2","name":"MELLIFLUOUS JELLYFISH","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_LUSH_RARE_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.JELLY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.jelly.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_RARE_S2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_RARE_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_LUSH_RARE_S2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPSLOT_DMG12","name":"MELTED FUEL CELL","kind":"Technology","category":"Ship","categoryKey":"Ship","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Starship Component","description":"Starship subsystem severely damaged. Slot cannot be used for storage or technology until damage is repaired. Use to begin repair process. Core starship functionality is not affected. Repairing this damage will free slot up for general inventory use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/COMPOUND.6.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/compound.6.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPSLOT_DMG12_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPSLOT_DMG_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SHIPSLOT_DMG12","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WEAPSLOT_DMG9","name":"MELTED SERVOS","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Multi-Tool Component","description":"Multi-Tool subsystem critically damaged. Slot cannot be used until damage is repaired. Use to begin repair process. Repairing will free slot up for general use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component2.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WEAPSLOT_DMG9_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WEAPSLOT_DMG_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/WEAPSLOT_DMG9","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_FUEL2","name":"MEMBRANE BATTERY","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Chargeable Power Unit","description":"The membrane battery is an almost maintenance-free piece of rechargeable power technology. Nestled among in the machine's circuits, it supplies power safely and directly.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MAINTTECH.FUEL2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mainttech.fuel2.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_FUEL2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_FUEL2_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_FUEL2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PURPM_PACKET","name":"MEMORIES OF ATLANTID","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Forgotten Void Data","description":"The howling of an advanced intelligence banished to oblivion, a reverberation in sentience and crystal. Each memory in this data packet is an entire reality in itself, bearing the fingerprint of countless lives. The Atlas will recognise this seed.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2024.PURPLEPACKET.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2024.purplepacket.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PURPM_PACKET_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PURPM_PACKET_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1919,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/PURPM_PACKET","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN06","name":"MEMORIES OF THE ABYSS Z80-10L-N","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This weapon comes equipped with the versatile Neutron Cannon, which delivers powerful volleys of atmospheric particles - the longer it is charged, the more deadly the blast. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.GUN06.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.gun06.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_06_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_06_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN06","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN31","name":"MEMORIES OF THE ANCIENTS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This A-class weapon comes equipped with a range of pre-installed technologies and upgrades. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.GUN31.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.gun31.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_31_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_GENERIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN31","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_CRAFTBOX","name":"MEMORY FRAGMENT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Rogue Technology Echo","description":"The shattered remnants of a previous existence. It whispers, an unknowable name deep within its fibres. The memory will manifest as an important technology upgrade to aid you in this iteration. Absorb this memory with . DEATH IS NOT THE END THE LOOP CONTINUES","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/ROGUETECH.GENERAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/roguetech.general.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_TECHBOX_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_TECHBOX_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https: