tence. It whispers, an unknowable name deep within its fibres. The memory will manifest as an Exosuit technology upgrade to aid you in this iteration. Absorb this memory with . DEATH IS NOT THE END THE LOOP CONTINUES","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/ROGUETECH.SUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/roguetech.suit.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_HAZBOX_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_HAZBOX_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_STARTBOX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"INVBOX","name":"MEMORY FRAGMENT (INVENTORY)","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Rogue Technology Echo","description":"The shattered remnants of an expired traveller. It whispers, an unknowable name deep within its fibres. The memory will manifest as an inventory expansion to aid you on your travels. Absorb this memory with .","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/ROGUETECH.INVENTORY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/roguetech.inventory.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_INVBOX_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_INVBOX_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":3,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/INVBOX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_INVBOX","name":"MEMORY FRAGMENT (INVENTORY)","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Rogue Technology Echo","description":"The shattered remnants of a previous existence. It whispers, an unknowable name deep within its fibres. The memory will manifest as an inventory expansion to aid you in this iteration. Absorb this memory with . DEATH IS NOT THE END THE LOOP CONTINUES","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/ROGUETECH.INVENTORY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/roguetech.inventory.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_INVBOX_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_INVBOX_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_INVBOX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_GUNBOX","name":"MEMORY FRAGMENT (PERSONAL WEAPON)","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Rogue Technology Echo","description":"The shattered remnants of a previous existence. It whispers, an unknowable name deep within its fibres. The memory will manifest as a Multi-Tool weapon to aid you in this iteration. Absorb this memory with . DEATH IS NOT THE END THE LOOP CONTINUES","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/ROGUETECH.WEAPON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/roguetech.weapon.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_GUNBOX_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_GUNBOX_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_GUNBOX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_SGUNBOX","name":"MEMORY FRAGMENT (STARSHIP WEAPON)","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Rogue Technology Echo","description":"The shattered remnants of a previous existence. It whispers, an unknowable name deep within its fibres. The memory will manifest as a starship weapon to aid you in this iteration. Absorb this memory with . DEATH IS NOT THE END THE LOOP CONTINUES","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/ROGUETECH.SHIP.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/roguetech.ship.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_SGUNBOX_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_SGUNBOX_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_SGUNBOX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_G_STONE1","name":"MEMORY IMPRINT I","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Loop Artifact","description":"A memory is burned into this strange material, an echo of another lifetime... \"The leviathan was like nothing I've ever seen. So vast as to blot out the sun. I wanted it. I deserve to have it! It will be mine. But it resisted, would not come quietly. It wailed and it wailed as the infra-knife carved into its meat. It almost took me down with it. Perhaps it has. Perhaps...\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ROGUEGRAVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.roguegrave.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_NAME1","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_DESC1","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_G_STONE1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_G_STONE2","name":"MEMORY IMPRINT II","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Loop Artifact","description":"A memory is burned into this strange material, an echo of another lifetime... \"The same nightmare chases me: a wail fills my cockpit, the dashboard controls gummed with blood. I have given up sleep. I pulse past blurred stars. And then there it was: majestic, drifting in the ocean of space. Something inside me burns for it. I must have it. Its great fin flexed toward my ship, and my hull was gone...\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ROGUEGRAVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.roguegrave.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_NAME2","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_DESC2","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_G_STONE2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_G_STONE3","name":"MEMORY IMPRINT III","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Loop Artifact","description":"A memory is burned into this strange material, an echo of another lifetime... \"Today should have been the day. Their hour was at hand. It must be mine. They are like nothing I've ever seen. Everything was prepared. But it moved faster than I thought possible. As though it knew where I would fly, before I knew it myself. A great tentacle hugged my ship, my cockpit - pressing my suit down to the bone. This suit will be my grave.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ROGUEGRAVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.roguegrave.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_NAME3","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_DESC3","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_G_STONE3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_G_STONE4","name":"MEMORY IMPRINT IV","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Loop Artifact","description":"A memory is burned into this strange material, an echo of another lifetime... \"The chase is over, and I have lost. The giants will endure, and I will end. As I plummeted from the sky, I saw another ship falling alongside mine. Then another, and another. I may have imagined it. The misfiring of a dying mind... Those creatures were so beautiful. But it is all ended now. They will haunt my thoughts no longer.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ROGUEGRAVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.roguegrave.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_NAME4","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_DESC4","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_G_STONE4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_G_STONE5","name":"MEMORY IMPRINT V","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Loop Artifact","description":"A memory is burned into this strange material, an echo of another lifetime... \"I came face-to-face with a creature more beautiful and bizarre than anything I have ever seen. Despite no discernible eyes, I do not believe it is blind. It was huge, glorious, serene. But then - with a flick of its tentacles, it was gone. I have thought of nothing else since. I can only think of the whale. whale. whale. wail.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ROGUEGRAVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.roguegrave.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_NAME5","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_STONE_DESC5","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ROGUE_G_STONE5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S12_POI_SEED3","name":"MEMORY OF BONES","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Fragment of the Atlas","description":"This memory is a fragment of the cosmos, one filament in an infinite galaxy of possible pasts and possible futures. Reach the stars and then use to awaken this memory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.6.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.6.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S12_POI_SEED_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"S12_POI_SEED_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S12_POI_SEED3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S12_POI_SEED2","name":"MEMORY OF CONQUEST","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Fragment of the Atlas","description":"This memory is a fragment of the cosmos, one filament in an infinite galaxy of possible pasts and possible futures. Reach the stars and then use to awaken this memory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.7.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.7.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S12_POI_SEED_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"S12_POI_SEED_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S12_POI_SEED2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S12_POI_SEED1","name":"MEMORY OF OCEAN","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Fragment of the Atlas","description":"This memory is a fragment of the cosmos, one filament in an infinite galaxy of possible pasts and possible futures. Reach the stars and then use to awaken this memory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.10.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.10.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S12_POI_SEED_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"S12_POI_SEED_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S12_POI_SEED1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S12_POI_SEED4","name":"MEMORY OF THE VOID","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Fragment of the Atlas","description":"This memory is a fragment of the cosmos, one filament in an infinite galaxy of possible pasts and possible futures. Reach the stars and then use to awaken this memory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.5.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S12_POI_SEED_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"S12_POI_SEED_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S12_POI_SEED4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ROGUE_FINDER","name":"MEMORY RESONATOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Loop Manifestation Technology","description":"A highly familar, entirely novel, piece of technology, designed by Specialist Polo as part of their loop research efforts. It synchronises its vibrations with the underlying song of the universe, allowing it to reveal memory hotspots within the loop. Begin the resonance alignment process with .","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ROGUEFINDER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.roguefinder.webp","colour":"#311a49","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_FINDER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ROGUE_GRAVE_FINDER_DESC","secondary":"Special","