n","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DOUGHNUT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.doughnut.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_DNUT_BJAM_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":70000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_DNUT_BJAM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_BUGJAM","name":"MUCULENT TART","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.VEGPIE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.vegpie.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PIE_BUGJAM_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":62000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_BUGJAM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ALL_COM_S2","name":"MUD CRAB","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.CRAB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.crab.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_S2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":1000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ALL_COM_S2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_SWAMP3","name":"MUD HUT","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This simple mud hut was modelled after a mysterious structure discovered in the mists of planet Saxm A13. Similar structures have been found throughout the universe, with no proven hypothesis regarding their origin. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SWAMPPLANT03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.swampplant03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_SWAMPPLANT_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_SWAMPPLANT_3_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_SWAMP3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UP_SENGUN","name":"Multi-Tool","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Combat","categoryKey":"Combat","rarity":"Sentinel","subtitle":"Forbidden Multi-Tool Module","description":"An anomalous upgrade for the Multi-Tool's Weapon Systems. Use to begin upgrade installation process. This eerie, glassy shard has been extracted from Sentinel debris. Its exact effect upon the Multi-Tool will not be known until after installation is complete.","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SENTGUN","descriptionKey":"UP_SENTGUN_DESC","secondary":"T_SENTGUN","tags":["3 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/upgrade-module/UP_SENGUN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WEAP_INV_TOKEN","name":"MULTI-TOOL EXPANSION SLOT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Upgrade Unit","description":"A flexible upgrade circuit, compatible with all person Multi-Tools. This module can be wired into a Multi-Tool at a Space Station Multi-Tool Upgrade Rack, granting the user more space in the Multi-Tool's internal layout to add further upgrades or technology specialisations.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.WEAPONTOKEN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.weapontoken.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WEAPON_INV_TOKEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WEAPON_INV_TOKEN_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":85000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":3,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/WEAP_INV_TOKEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUNUP01A","name":"MULTI-TOOL UPGRADE PACK","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Multifunction Survival Device Upgrade","description":"A bundle of upgrades compatible with all person Multi-Tools. Includes a Multi-Tool Expansion Slot, which may be wired into a Multi-Tool at a Space Station Multi-Tool Upgrade Rack, as well as a unique Upgrade Module, which can be immediately installed by hand to enhance an existing Multi-Tool technology.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.GUNUP01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.gunup01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_UP_01_NAME","descri