"name":"NECTAR ISLANDS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Extra-Fluffy Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CUPCAKEFLUFFY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.cupcakefluffy.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_MC_PCAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_MC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":94800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_MC_PCAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CG_PCAT","name":"NECTAR SPONGE CAKE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Proto-Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKEGEK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cakegek.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CG_PCAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CG","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":79700,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CG_PCAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ALL_RARE_S1","name":"NEEDLEFISH","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ALL_RARE_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BIG.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.big.2.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_RARE_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_RARE_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ALL_RARE_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN26","name":"NEGATIVE ION PUNCHER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This A-class weapon comes equipped with a range of pre-installed technologies and upgrades. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.GUN26.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.gun26.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_26_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_GENERIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN26","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP03","name":"NEMESIS OF THE KUDAMA","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, pre-fitted with an upgraded Positron Ejector for efficient destruction of hostile ships. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.SHIP03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.ship03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_03_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_03_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH21","name":"NETWORK INTERFACE","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"A universal network interface, allowing the device to connect to a remote control centre. Damage to this interface is causing it to interpret background radiation as network signals, corrupting data in other circuits.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MEGAPROD.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/megaprod.3.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH21_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH21_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH21","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"LAUNCHER_ALIEN","name":"NEURAL ASSEMBLY","kind":"Technology","category":"Alien Ship","categoryKey":"AlienShip","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Fused Organic Technology","description":"An array of distributed neurons, fused to a board of metallic strands. Complex patterns of electrical impulses weave their way across the surface, knotting each ship system together. Hold to inquire if the ship would like to take off.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/BIOTECH.BRAIN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/biotech.brain.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"LAUNCHER_ALIEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"LAUNCHER_ALIEN_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"s