Rare","subtitle":"Powerful Neutron Cannon Upgrade","description":"An extremely powerful upgrade for the Neutron Cannon. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential upgrades include: projectile speed, charge time, weapon damage and number of projectiles.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.A.CANNON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.a.cannon.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_CANNON3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_CANNON3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_CANNON3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_CANNON4","name":"NEUTRON CANNON MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Supreme Neutron Cannon Upgrade","description":"A supremely powerful upgrade for the Neutron Cannon. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential upgrades include: projectile speed, charge time, weapon damage and number of projectiles.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.S.CANNON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.s.cannon.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_CANNON4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_CANNON4_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_CANNON4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_EXOTICS2","name":"NEUTRON MICROSCOPE","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Scientific)","description":"A parcel of neutron microscopes. Scientific economies produce and consume large numbers of microscopes. However, some have slight defects that render them unsuitable for precision work. These are still a trading opportunity, in that they can be sold to those unable to tell the difference.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.EXOTICS2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.exotics2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_EXOTICS_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_EXOTICS_2_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":6000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_EXOTICS2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXO_PROT_RAD","name":"NEUTRON SHIELDING","kind":"Technology","category":"Exocraft","categoryKey":"Exocraft","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Exocraft Hazard Protection Unit","description":"Highly-efficient control materials are inserted into the frame of the Exocraft, neutralising dangerous incoming energy waves. Entirely prevents all damage or energy drain while inside an Exocraft in radioactive environments.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PROTECTRADS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.protectrads.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXOHAZ_RAD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXOHAZ_RAD_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/EXO_PROT_RAD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_RADPLANT04","name":"NEUTRONIC BOULDER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A large chunk of radioactive rock, lifted from the soil of an irradiated world at great expense to the quarry workers. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.RADPLANT04.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.radplant04.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_RADPLANT_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_RADPLANT_4_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_RADPLANT04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP11","name":"NEYAM'S LUCENT CONQUEROR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, pre-fitted with an illegally modified Positron Ejector for efficient destruction of hostile ships. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP11.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship11.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_11_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_11_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP11","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP41","name":"NIDAITAI'S PRIDE HM3","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class shuttle is a pragmatic, balanced ship, pre-installed with a broad range of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP41.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship41.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_41_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SHUTTLE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP41","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER09B","name":"NIGHT SQUAD POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster depicts an inter-species friendship between three explorers of the universe.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER09B.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster09b.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER9B_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER9B_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER09B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_W_MEAT","name":"NIGHTMARE SAUSAGE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.OFFAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.offal.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_W_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":16000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_W_MEAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_FLOWER1","name":"NIGHTTONGUE FLOWERS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A hardy floral patch, genetically modified to thrive in all biomes, soil types, and weather conditions. Barbed petals protect the flowers from would-be predators, piercing flesh with a deadly toxin. Haz-Mat Gauntlets recommended while handling.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FLOWER01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.flower01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_FLOWER_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_FLOWER_1_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_FLOWER1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"NIPNIPBUDS","name":"NIPNIP BUDS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Medicinal Substance","description":"A pungent bud harvested from the NipNip plant, often used to produce Gek Nip.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE1/PRODUCT.NIPBUD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update1/product.nipbud.webp","colour":"#383838","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"PROD_NIP_NAME","descriptionKey":"PROD_NIP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":17776,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/NIPNIPBUDS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"GAS3","name":"NITROGEN","kind":"Resource","category":"Earth","categoryKey":"Earth","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Compressed Atmospheric Gas","description":"A reactive atmospheric gas found wherever there is organic life. Nitrogen is readily harvested from the atmospheres of Lush and Toxic planets.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/GAS.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/gas.1.webp","colour":"#de921f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_GAS_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_GAS_3_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/GAS3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"REACTION3","name":"NITROGEN SALT","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Enhanced Gas Product","description":"A refined product, this is a powerful organic fertiliser in an easily distributed form. Crafted from Nitrogen and Condensed Carbon.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/REACTION.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/reaction.3.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_REACTION_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_REACTION_3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/REACTION3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BANNER_NMSCORD","name":"NMSCORD BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in support of a safe, fun community for all Travellers. Dreaming, creating, sharing. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BANNER.NMSCORD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.banner.nmscord.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_NMSCORD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_NMSCORD_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BANNER_NMSCORD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_NMSCORD","name":"NMSCORD DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This emblem represents a safe and fun community for all Travellers. Dreaming, creating, sharing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.DECAL21.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.decal21.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_NMSCORD_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_NMSCORD_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_NMSCORD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BANNER_NMS_FR","name":"NO MAN'S SKY FRANCE BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair to represent the Communauté Francophone of Travellers. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BANNER.NMSFRANCE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.banner.nmsfrance.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_NMS_FR_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_NMS_FR_DESC"