. The fronds resemble the plumage of a bird, and crown in a drooping formation. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.PEACOCK02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.peacock02.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_PEACOCK_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_PEACOCK_2_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_PEACOCK02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ODD_RARE_L1","name":"NON-EUCLIDEAN FLATFISH","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.MEDIUM.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.medium.3.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":10000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ODD_RARE_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_COMPONENT2","name":"NON-STICK PISTON","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Industrial)","description":"Wrapped and greased pistons, ready for shipping. High-tech components frequently require rapidly moving parts, or high-endurance motors. Without specially coated pistons, the failure rate of such parts would be significantly higher.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMP_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMP_2_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":6000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_COMPONENT2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_P_TOXFARM","name":"NON-TOXIC MUSHROOM","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An edible plant, harvested from planetary flora. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.PLANT.TOXFARM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.plant.toxfarm.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PLANT_TOX_FARM_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_P_TOXFARM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_SHIPGUN","name":"NONLINEAR OPTICS","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Photon Cannon Upgrade","description":"Replaces the conventional Photon Cannon optics with an experimental glass array, boosting combat performance. Significantly improves heat sink capacity.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.SHIPPROJECTILE1MOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.shipprojectile1mod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_SHIPGUN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_SHIPGUN_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_SHIPGUN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ATLAS_SEED_3","name":"NOOSPHERIC ORB","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Unique valuable curiosity","description":"An Atlas Seed capable of resonating on humanoid telepathic frequencies; may attempt to subsume any subordinate intellect in close proximity.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.3.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ATLAS_SEED_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"ATLAS_SEED_3_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ATLAS_SEED_3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CB_BUGJAM","name":"NOURISHING OOZER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Thick, Sweet Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKEBLOB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cakeblob.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CB_BUGJAM_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CB","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":81900,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CB_BUGJAM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_V_BUG","name":"NOURISHING SLIME","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An animal byproduct, this nutritious morsel can be easily farmed without harm to the animal that produces it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ANIMALGREASE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.animalgrease.webp","colour":"#e57002","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BUG_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_VEG_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_V_BUG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ATLAS_SEED_8","name":"NOVAE RECLAIMENT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Unique valuable curiosity","description":"Atlas Seed contains neutronium elements from a catastrophic supernova event that obliterated a sentient civilization in an earlier era.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.8.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.8.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ATLAS_SEED_8_NAME","descriptionKey":"ATLAS_SEED_8_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ATLAS_SEED_8","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_RAD_RARE_S2","name":"NUCLEIC SKIPPER","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_RAD_RARE_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.MEDIUM.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.medium.3.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_RAD_RARE_S2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_RAD_RARE_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_RAD_RARE_S2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_DECAL08","name":"NULL DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts the Traveller Null.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal08.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_NULL_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_NULL_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_DECAL08","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_FARM5","name":"NUTRIENT DISTRIBUTOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Autonomous Agriculture Unit","description":"A hybrid fabricator/distributor that tests the soil for missing nutrients, so that it can create and spray the perfect fertiliser.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MAINTTECH.FARM5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mainttech.farm5.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_FARM5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_FARM5_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology","Chargeable"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_FARM5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_UNIT","name":"NUTRIENT INGESTOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Automatic Feeding Unit","description":"The nutrient ingestor improves exosuit performance via the automatic portioning and processing of various cooked items. Select Begin Ingestion to commence automatic consumption of supplied ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/FEEDING.TUBE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/feeding.tube.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FOOD_UNIT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FOOD_UNIT_DESC_PLAIN","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/FOOD_UNIT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET14","name":"O. CRABUBIREUS EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The creature inside wobbles its blob-like body back and forth, yearning to be hatched. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for an autonomous personality.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.PET14.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.pet14.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_14_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_14_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET14","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET06","name":"O. TIGERAEUMIS EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! A set of curved horns scrape the inside of the egg, the tiny creature inside fighting for an exit. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for a fierce nature, aggressively engaging any threat to its master.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.PET06.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.pet06.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_06_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_06_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET06","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN29","name":"OBEDIENCE OF SOLEMNITY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This A-class weapon comes equipped with a range of pre-installed technologies and upgrades. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.GUN29.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.gun29.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_29_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_GENERIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN29","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN13","name":"OBEDIENCE OF THE DANCE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This A-class weapon comes equipped with a range of pre-installed technologies and upgrades. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.GUN13.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.gun13.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_13_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_GENERIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN13","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"OBSOLETE","name":"OBSOLETE TECHNOLOGY","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Old, unusable technology","description":"A piece of technology, corrupted by interference from the Atlas. Can be recycled for usable components.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.TECHMODULE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.techmodule.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_OBSOLETE_TECH_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_OBSOLETE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":[],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/OBSOLETE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DEEP_EPIC_L1","name":"OCEAN'S STAR","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Rare Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DEEP_EPIC_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.STARFISH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.starfish.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_EPIC_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_EPIC_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":30000,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DEEP_EPIC_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FISH_BOB5","name":"OCTOPUS FLOAT","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Customised Fishing Equipment","description":"An exclusive Fishing Rig Customisation, altering the appearance of the float. Transform the appearance of your fishing equipment from the fishing rig's bait management page.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.S17.FISHINGFLOATOCTO.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.s17.fishingfloatocto.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FLOAT_OCTO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FLOAT_CUSTOM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FISH_BOB5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRUCK_WHEELS02","name":"OFF-ROAD WHEELS","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Exocraft Customisation Option","description":"A custom running gear module for a terrestrial vehicle, compatible with the Colossus large Exocraft. Recalibrate Exocraft visuals from the Colossus Geobay.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.TRUCKWHEELS02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.truckwheels02.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRUCK_WHEELS02_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRUCK_WHEELS_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRUCK_WHEELS02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_BLOB","name":"OFFAL SAC","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.OFFAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.offal.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BLOB_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_BLOB","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S_SAIL1","name":"OFFSET SAILS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"These offset sails replicate the design of the ancient maritime trade vessels of the Gek, and make for a striking nautical-themed home decoration.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.S_SAIL_1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.s_sail_1.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_S_SAIL1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_S_SAIL1_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S_SAIL1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_ENERGY3","name":"OHMIC GEL","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Energy Source)","description":"Several packets of ohmic gel. Power-hungry mining operations are fraught with danger. Ohmic gel helps keep rapidly moving parts both insulated and lubricated.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ENERGY3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.energy3.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ENERGY_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ENERGY_3_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":15000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_ENERGY3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP59","name":"OIGAYA'S REDEMPTION PV4","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class hauler benefits from shield and inventory capacity bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP59.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship59.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_59_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_DROPSHIP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP59","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HOT_COM_S1","name":"OILFIN","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_HOT_COM_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BIG.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.big.3.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_COM_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_COM_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":1000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_HOT_COM_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP32","name":"OKOROZA PEACEMAKER X","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class hauler benefits from shield and inventory capacity bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP32.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship32.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_32_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_DROPSHIP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP32","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TRASH_7","name":"OLD BOOT","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Collected Flotsam","description":"A piece of flotsam, wrenched from its years of drifting in the water when it became entangled in a fishing lure. Of little use to anyone.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BOOT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.boot.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_BOOT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Trade good"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TRASH_7","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BANNER12","name":"OMEGA BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in commemoration of the Omega expedition, and the memories gleaned from within the Atlas. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.BANNER12.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.banner12.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_12_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_12_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BANNER12","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_DECAL12","name":"OMEGA DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal commemorates completion of the Omega expedition, and the memories gleaned from within the Atlas.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.DECAL12.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.decal12.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_12_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_12_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_DECAL12","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_EGGPIE","name":"OMELETTE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.OMLETTE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.omlette.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_EGGPIE_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":18000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_EGGPIE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECH1","name":"ONCE-USEFUL SPRINGS","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of broken down starship, created by a Starship Outfitting Terminal at a Space Station. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.TECH1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.tech1.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECH1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECHMT1","name":"ONCE-USEFUL SPRINGS","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Multi-Tool Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of recycled Multi-Tool technology, created by a Multi-Tool Decommissioning Terminal aboard the Space Anomaly. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_MT_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":12000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECHMT1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BANNER_OOGC","name":"OOGC BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair to represent the OOGC Interstellar Alliance. We observe the world; we create the world. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BANNER.OOGC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.banner.oogc.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_OOGC_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_OOGC_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BANNER_OOGC","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_OOGC","name":"OOGC DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This emblem represents the OOGC Interstellar Alliance. We observe the world; we create the world.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL.OOGC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal.oogc.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_OOGC_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_OOGC_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_OOGC","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP54","name":"OOMORIBE'S HALCYON WAR-SPEAR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class solar ship benefits from damage and shield bonuses, as well as a beautiful high-tech Vesper Sail. pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP54.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship54.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_54_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SAIL_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP54","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER11C","name":"OPEN HORIZONS POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster celebrates those in search of the next discovery, the next wonder, and the next unknown sky...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER11C.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster11c.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER11C_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER11C_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER11C","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_SUBZPLANT2","name":"OPEN SEED CONE","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A large organic structure, housing the seeds of coniferous megaflora. This specimen has dried out, its scales flexed back to release the seeds inside. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.SUBZPLANT2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.subzplant2.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_SUBZPLANT_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_SUBZPLANT_2_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_SUBZPLANT2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_MINER","name":"OPTICAL DRILL","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Material Gain Amplifier","description":"Wafer-thin lens arrays are arranged in a highly calibrated matrix, focusing the Mining Beam on an atomic level. This extra precision allows for highly efficient mining. Elements are extracted more efficiently, increasing the yield from items harvested with the Multi-Tool.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE1/TECH.STRONGLASER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update1/tech.stronglaser.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_MINER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_MINER_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_MINER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_ALLOY3","name":"OPTICAL SOLVENT","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Construction)","description":"Several bottles of optical solvent. The liquid in these bottles is used to wash away surplus light that may otherwise cause decay in scientific components.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ALLOY3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.alloy3.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ALLOY_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ALLOY_3_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":15000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_ALLOY3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREIGHT_ORANGE","name":"ORANGE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Freighter Customisation Option","description":"Unlocks this colour for freighter customisation. A self-replicating cloud of highly pigmatised nano-robots swarm the capital ship, changing its external appearance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FREIGHTPAINT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.freightpaint.webp","colour":"#f26d15","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PAINT_ORANGE_U","descriptionKey":"UI_PAINT_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREIGHT_ORANGE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPOOKY_PLANT","name":"ORANGE PUSTULE","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"The flesh of this sinister squash is always warm, and slightly luminous. Despite these strange qualities, it is quite edible, and releases a comforting aroma wherever it grows. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SPOOKYPLANT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.spookyplant.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_SPOOKY_PLANT_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_SPOOKY_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPOOKY_PLANT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_FLAG_06D","name":"ORBITAL FLAG","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Flag","description":"An abstract representation of planetary orbits under a watchful eye, sewn from striking crimson and grey fabrics. An exclusive buildable base ornament.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.FLAG06D.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.flag06d.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_FLAG_06D_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_FLAG_06D_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_FLAG_06D","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S_POSTER21","name":"ORBITAL POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster depicts a Space Station looming above a pensive explorer.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.S_POSTER21.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.s_poster21.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_S_POSTER21_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_S_POSTER21_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S_POSTER21","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S19_TP","name":"ORBITAL UPLINK","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Teleport Network Tunnel","description":"This device bypasses the mainstream teleport network, providing a direct link to the local Space Station. Select the device and use Activate Teleport () to instantly transfer to the nearest Space Station.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2025.S19_TP.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2025.s19_tp.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_S19_TP_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_S19_TP_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S19_TP","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"COMPOUND1","name":"ORGANIC CATALYST","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Manufactured Gas Product","description":"A catalytic material used in the creation of many organic fertilisers. Crafted from Thermic Condensate and Enriched Carbon.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/COMPOUND.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/compound.1.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_COMPOUND_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_COMPOUND_1_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":320000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/COMPOUND1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BIOFRIG","name":"ORGANIC FRIGATE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Cosmic Leviathan","description":"This peaceful space giant is a mutation of organism and starcraft, and can be tamed to swim through the stars alongside a fleet of frigates. Recruiting this creature will add it to your frigate fleet. Manage your fleet from a Fleet Command Room aboard your freighter, and consult your Navigator to deploy frigates on lucrative expeditions.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.BIOFRIG.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.biofrig.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_BIOFRIG_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_BIOFRIG_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BIOFRIG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_MINI_BIOFRI","name":"ORGANIC FRIGATE CALF","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Ornamental Base Companion","description":"A juvenile cosmic leviathan, suitable for rehoming in a habitable base. This mysterious creature is enclosed in a chrono-preservation field to ensure it remains eternally young, playful, and a manageable size.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.MINIBIOFRIG.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.minibiofrig.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_MINI_BIOFRIG_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_MINI_BIOFRIG_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BLD_MINI_BIOFRI","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_EXOTICS4","name":"ORGANIC PIPING","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Scientific)","description":"A vat of preserved organic piping. Still warm. To avoid difficult ethical problems, many labs grow their test subjects on a component level. The leftovers can be profitable in trading economies with relaxed medical regulations.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.EXOTICS4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.exotics4.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_EXOTICS_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_EXOTICS_4_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":30000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_EXOTICS4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_DUST05","name":"ORNAMENTAL TREE","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"An elegant tree, evoking a feeling of peace and balance. Anyone sitting beneath its branches can also enjoy a soft, relaxing fragrance. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.DUST05.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.dust05.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DUST05_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DUST05_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_DUST05","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP43","name":"OROZA'S ABYSSAL COUP","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class explorer benefits from hyperdrive and launcher bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP43.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship43.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_43_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SCIENTIFIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP43","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SUB_RECHARGE","name":"OSMOTIC GENERATOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Submarine","categoryKey":"Submarine","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Humboldt Drive Upgrade","description":"Installed into the drive system aboard the Nautilon Submarine. Captures energy by exploiting the saline gradient in deep water environments, allowing a slow recharge of the Humboldt Drive in the event of fuel emergencies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.SUBMARINEENGINEMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.submarineenginemod.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SUB_RECHARGE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SUB_RECHARGE_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SUB_RECHARGE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TRASH_6","name":"OSSIFIED CORAL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Collected Flotsam","description":"A piece of flotsam, wrenched from its years of drifting in the water when it became entangled in a fishing lure. Of little use to anyone.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.CORAL.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.coral.3.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_CORAL3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Trade good"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TRASH_6","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DUST_LEG_L1","name":"OSSIFIED DEINOSUCHUS","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Legendary Fish","description":"\"A relic of another age, a fusion of life and stone that refuses to die.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.XL.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.xl.2.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_LEG_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_LEG_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":150000,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DUST_LEG_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP46","name":"OTENBA'S AIRBORNE GAMBIT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class hauler benefits from shield and inventory capacity bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP46.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship46.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_46_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_DROPSHIP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP46","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BANNER23","name":"OUR JOURNEY CONTINUES BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in commemoration of the expedition Our Journey Continues, and the pilgrimage through past iterations of No Man's Sky. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S23.BANNER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s23.banner.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_23_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_23_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BANNER23","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_DECAL23","name":"OUR JOURNEY CONTINUES DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal commemorates completion of the expedition Our Journey Continues, and the pilgrimage through past iterations of No Man's Sky.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S23.DECAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s23.decal.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_23_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_23_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_DECAL23","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_CAPE06","name":"OUTLAW CAPE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Cape","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. A battle-worn cape, stolen from notorious pirate faction The Blight. Woven from chemically-dipped nano-fibres, the fabric is completely impervious to the heat produced by jetpack exhaust. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.CAPE06.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.cape06.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PIRATECAPE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PIRATECAPE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_CAPE06","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER06B","name":"OUTLAW POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. A rebellious tribute to pirates, fugitives, and resistance to Sentinel law.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER06B.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster06b.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER6B_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER6B_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER06B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_PIRATESYS","name":"OUTLAW SYSTEM DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal is symbolic of territory overthrown by rebel outlaws.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.DECALPIRATESYSTEM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.decalpiratesystem.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_PIRATESYSTEM_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_PIRATESYSTEM_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_PIRATESYS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PIR_STAND_DN","name":"OUTLAWS","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/RANK/FACTIONS.PIRATE.ON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/rank/factions.pirate.on.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"PIRATE_GUILD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/PIR_STAND_DN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PIR_STAND_UP","name":"OUTLAWS","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/RANK/FACTIONS.PIRATE.ON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/rank/factions.pirate.on.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"PIRATE_GUILD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/PIR_STAND_UP","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH9","name":"OUTPUT SCREEN","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"A display terminal designed to communicate the device's status to the user. As the terminal is broken, the user cannot be made aware that the terminal is broken.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/BUILDABLE/BUILDABLE.WALLSCREEN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/buildable/buildable.wallscreen.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH9_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH9_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH9","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"OXYGEN","name":"OXYGEN","kind":"Resource","category":"Fuel","categoryKey":"Fuel","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Concentrated Liquid Fuel","description":"Integral to the atmospheric filtering technology at the heart of the exosuit life support system. Exosuit material processing allows oxygen to be harvested directly from appropriate planetary flora. Other plantlife may be scanned with the Analysis Visor to reveal alternative oxygen supplies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.AIR.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.air.1.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_AIR1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_AIR1_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":34,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/OXYGEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PRODFUEL1","name":"OXYGEN CAPSULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Portable Life Support Power","description":"Stablised and secure life support filtration gas. Easily assembled from Oxygen and Ferrite Dust. Offers an efficient method for long-term life support power.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.OXYGENGEL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.oxygengel.webp","colour":"#c01746","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FUELGEL_NAME","descriptionKey":"FUELGEL_DESC","secondary":"Fuel","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":350,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":20,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/PRODFUEL1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"OXY_CRAFT","name":"OXYGEN FILTER","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Crafted Technology Component","description":"A specialist technology component. This small device can rapidly change the gaseous environment within a device, handling conditions from total vacuum to pure oxygen atmospheres.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.OXYCRAFT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.oxycraft.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_OXY_CRAFT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_OXY_CRAFT_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":615,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/OXY_CRAFT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_ENERGY","name":"OXYGEN RECYCLER","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Life Support Upgrade","description":"Increases the base capacity of the Life Support system, allowing the user to go longer between charges.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.CELLMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.cellmod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_ENERGY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_ENERGY_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_ENERGY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_WATERENERGY","name":"OXYGEN REROUTER","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Emergency Life Support System","description":"Upgrades the Aeration Membrane of the Exosuit to harvest oxygen from the Life Support system in the event of a breathing emergency, allowing the user to resurface and seek conventional fuel supplies. Note: Long-term conversion of life support energy to breathable gas is not recommended, and may result in life no longer being supported.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.CELLMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.cellmod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_WATERENERGY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_WATERENERGY_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_WATERENERGY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN08","name":"OZONE AUDITOR MARK XI","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This weapon comes with a powerful Cloaking Device pre-installed, for stealthy escape from hostile confrontations. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.GUN08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.gun08.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_08_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_08_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN08","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_CANNON","name":"P-FIELD COMPRESSOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Neutron Cannon Upgrade","description":"A powerful upgrade to the Neutron Cannon. Additional resonance compressors allow significantly more energy to be routed through the cannon's central core, dramatically increasing operating power. Installation will allow a fully-charged Neutron Cannon to launch additional projectiles at higher speeds.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.CANNONMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.cannonmod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_CANNON_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_CANNON_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_CANNON","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET01","name":"P. SHEPTEFALAE EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The armoured beast within - part crystal, part flesh - rattles gently against the egg. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential to be deeply devoted to protecting its master.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.PET01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.pet01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_01_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_01_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_COLD_RARE_M2","name":"PALE SNOWTAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_COLD_RARE_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT2.SMALL.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product2.small.2.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_COLD_RARE_M2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_COLD_RARE_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_COLD_RARE_M2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"LUSH1","name":"PARAFFINIUM","kind":"Resource","category":"Earth","categoryKey":"Earth","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Localised Earth Element","description":"Local mineral extract, typically found in large deposits or extracted from common minerals after inspection with an Analysis Visor. Typically found on planets with a tropical environment.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.BIOME.LUSH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.biome.lush.webp","colour":"#4e404f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_LUSH1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_LUSH1_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":62,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/LUSH1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STUN_GREN","name":"PARALYSIS MORTAR","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Stun Grenades","description":"Non-violent projectile weapon. Launched projectiles will incapacitate nearby targets with a burst of electrical energy. Effective against both biological and electronic entities. Charged with Unstable Plasma. Press to activate.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.STUNGRENADE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.stungrenade.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"STUN_GRENADE_NAME","descriptionKey":"STUN_GRENADE_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Chargeable","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/STUN_GREN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_EGGPIE_GM","name":"PARASITIC OMELETTE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.OMLETTE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.omlette.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_EGGPIE_GM_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":102000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_EGGPIE_GM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_S_CHEESE","name":"PARTIALLY-LIQUID CHEESE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A consumable liquid, created in the Nutrient Processor. Prized across the galaxy for its pleasing mouth-feel and authentically natural flavours. Can be ingested as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SAUCE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.sauce.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_S_CHEESE_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_DRINK_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":24000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_S_CHEESE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_PASTRY","name":"PASTRY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DOUGH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.dough.webp","colour":"#79502e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_PASTRY_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":24000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_PASTRY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SLIME_STAR","name":"PATHOGEN SAC","kind":"Product","category":"Space Salvage","categoryKey":"SpaceSalvage","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Pulsating Biomass","description":"A glutinous fleshy lump, harvested from a deep-space biohazard. Ingestion is not recommended. This has been processed at a deep-space outpost, and can be sold on the open market.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SUBSTANCES/SLIME.TRICELL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/substances/slime.tricell.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SLIME_SAMPLE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SLIME_SAMPLE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":201000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SLIME_STAR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_CREPAWS","name":"PAWPRINTS DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal represents the pawprints of an unidentified creature.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.CREATUREPAWS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.creaturepaws.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_CREPAWS_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_CREPAWS_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_CREPAWS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_SEALOCK1","name":"PEARL OFFERING","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Offering to the Sea","description":"The chest requires a Living Pearl, harvested from the giant mother-molluscs that grow on the ocean floor.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CLAMPEARL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.clampearl.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WATERCHEST_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WATERCHEST_1_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_SEALOCK1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_CRAB","name":"PEELED CLAWS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A piece of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SCALLOP.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.scallop.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_CRAB_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_MED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking in