CTOR","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Advanced Crafted Product","description":"A miniature self-controlled nuclear reactor. Generates sub-stellar levels of energy in a hassle-free, widely compatible fuel module. Crafted from Liquid Explosives and Fusion Accelerant.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MEGAPROD.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/megaprod.1.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MEGAPROD_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MEGAPROD_1_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":4200000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MEGAPROD1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER16B","name":"PORTAL BREACH POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. Beware what lurks beyond the boundary wall...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S16.POSTERB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s16.posterb.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER16B_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER16B_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER16B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DRONE_PART_E3","name":"PORTAL PHYLACTERY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Drone Component","description":"A vial of the portal's blue amber, given to you by Iteration: Mercury. The ether of the Atlas itself, this is primeval liquid from which it weaves the multiverse. A valuable and exotic component, this would be of great use to Iteration: Tethys in repairing the shattered Drone.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DRONEPARTE3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.droneparte3.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_DRONE_PART_E3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_DRONE_PART_E3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DRONE_PART_E3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_S13","name":"PORTAL REPOSITORY","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Mind Ark Notch","description":"A groove cut into the smooth grey stone of the Portal. A light within pulses gently, expectant.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MINDARC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mindarc.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PORTAL_S13_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PORTAL_S13_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_S13","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPSHOTGUN","name":"POSITRON EJECTOR","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Close Range Starship Weapon","description":"A powerful starship weapon, capable of delivering extreme destruction at close range. Note: these particles show decreased effectiveness against shielded targets. Use to change weapon mode. Press to fire.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PHOTONBLAST.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.photonblast.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"SHIPSHOTGUN_NAME","descriptionKey":"SHI