n the grafting process. Each node is genetically unique, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: manoeuvrability and speed.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECHALIEN.S.VEHICLEBOOST.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctechalien.s.vehicleboost.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BIO_PROD_PULSE_NAME","descriptionKey":"BIO_PROD_PULSE4_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/AP_PULSE4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"LAND2","name":"PURE FERRITE","kind":"Resource","category":"Metal","categoryKey":"Metal","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Processed Metallic Minerals","description":"Processed metal, free of dust and pebbles. Used to construct a wide variety of structures and technologies. Typically purified from Ferrite dust using a Refiner, but can occasionally be found in large deposits. Collection may require an Advanced Mining Laser.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.LAND.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.land.2.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_LAND2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_LAND2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Easy to refine"],"baseValue":28,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/LAND2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_HORROR","name":"PURGED RIBS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"The char of the Nutrient Processor's highest power setting has burned the stench from this one rancid slab. They writh no more... Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEAT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meat.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_HORROR_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_R_HORROR_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":9200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_HORROR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREIGHT_PURPLE","name":"PURPLE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Freighter Customisation Option","description":"Unlocks this colour for freighter customisation. A self-replicating cloud of highly pigmatised nano-robots swarm the capital ship, changing its external appearance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FREIGHTPAINT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.freightpaint.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PAINT_PURPLE_U","descriptionKey":"UI_PAINT_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREIGHT_PURPLE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_GALCORE","name":"PURPLE GALACTIC CORE DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a pair of starships journeying towards a galactic core.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL17.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal17.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_GALCORE_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_GALCORE_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_GALCORE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FIREWORK10","name":"PURPLE RIBBON FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"This exotic firework, sparkling with Atlantideum and antimony elements, bursts into a cluster of wildly spiralling ribbons. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FIREWORK10.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.firework10.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_SWIRL_P_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_SWIRL_P_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":60,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FIREWORK10","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HOT_RARE_S2","name":"PYREFIN","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.SMALL.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.small.2.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_S2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_RARE_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_HOT_RARE_S2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DUSTY1","name":"PYRITE","kind":"Resource","category":"Earth","categoryKey":"Earth","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Localised Earth Element","description":"Local mineral extract, typically found in large deposits or extracted from common minerals after inspection with an Analysis Visor. Typically found on planets with a desert environment.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.BIOME.DUSTY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.biome.dusty.webp","colour":"#e57002","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_DUSTY1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_DUSTY1_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":62,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/DUSTY1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JETS_FIREWORK","name":"PYROTECHNIC JETPACK TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Jetpack Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Pellets of chromatic metal ignite during flight, splitting into glittering stars of RGB. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.JETS.FIREWORK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.jets.firework.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_FIREWORK_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_FIREWORK_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/JETS_FIREWORK","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_SHIPMINI","name":"Q-RESONATOR","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"Normal","subtitle":"Starship Infra-Knife Upgrade","description":"Upgrades the Infra-Knife Accelerator, compressing internal waveforms to allow an extra shot to be weaved in to the conventional fire patterns.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PHOTONACCELMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.photonaccelmod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_SHIPMINI_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_SHIPMINI_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_SHIPMINI","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BANNER_QIT","name":"QITANIAN EMPIRE BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in the spirit of charity, kindness, peace and reason. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BANNER.QITANIAN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.banner.qitanian.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_QITANIAN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_QITANIAN_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BANNER_QIT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_QIT","name":"QITANIAN EMPIRE DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal represents the Qitanian Empire, and the spirit of charity, kindness, peace and reason.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL13.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal13.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_QITANIAN_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_QITANIAN_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_QIT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_EGG_05","name":"QUAD EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Sentinel Spawn Capsule","description":"A metal 'egg' capsule, ready to hatch! The shell crackles with an electronic energy. Scans indicate the being within is programmed to be tireless and watchful.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.QUADPET.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.quadpet.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_05_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_EGG_05_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_EGG_05","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"QUAD_PROD","name":"QUAD SERVO","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Anomalous Material","description":"A highly sprung motor arm salvaged from inside of a Sentinel patrol unit. It occasionally twitches, as if experiencing the echo of combat.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.QUADSERVO.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.quadservo.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_QUAD_PROD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_QUAD_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":20000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/QUAD_PROD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_TECH5","name":"QUANTUM ACCELERATOR","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Technology)","description":"Several large quantum accelerator units. Capable of propelling matter at unmeasurable speeds, these units are particularly important in power generation economies, where they're used to compress the energy stored in high-grade batteries.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.TECH5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.tech5.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_TECH_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_TECH_5_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_TECH5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"COMPUTER","name":"QUANTUM COMPUTER","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Crafted Technology Component","description":"An extremely fast advanced processing unit. Allows real-time solving of otherwise impossible calculations. However, protection against decoherence is not guaranteed. Used in the creation of a wide range of advanced technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.COMPUTER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.computer.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_COMPUTER_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_COMPUTER_DESC","secondary":"Catalyst","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":4200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":2,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/COMPUTER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_GUN01","name":"QUANTUM HARMONISER MARK IV","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive Multi-Tool. This rifle comes with the lethal Blaze Javelin and recoil-stabilising Combat Scope pre-installed. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.TWITCH.GUN01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.twitch.gun01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_01_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_GUN_01_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_GUN01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MEGAPROD2","name":"QUANTUM PROCESSOR","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Advanced Crafted Product","description":"A highly advanced computational device, essential for the complex calculations involved in warp travel. Crafted from Circuit Boards and Superconductors.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MEGAPROD.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/megaprod.2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MEGAPROD_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MEGAPROD_2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":4400000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/MEGAPROD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PURPLE2","name":"QUARTZITE","kind":"Resource","category":"Stellar","categoryKey":"Stellar","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Refined Stellar Metal: Purple","description":"A chromatic mineral, generated by fusion in the heart of a star. Such stellar material ends up forming deposits in the crust of local planets. Quartzite is found on planets orbiting purple stars, and can be placed in a Refiner to create purified Chromatic Metal for use in the manufacture of advanced technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.PURPLE.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.purple.2.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PURPLE2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PURPLE2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":132,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/PURPLE2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_GAS_EPIC_M1","name":"QUARTZSHELL CRAB","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Rare Fish","description":"UI_FISH_GAS_EPIC_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.CRAB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.crab.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_GAS_EPIC_M1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_GAS_EPIC_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":20000,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_GAS_EPIC_M1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_MEAT","name":"QUESTIONABLE BISCUIT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":35000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_MEAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CK_BLOBBUT","name":"QUESTIONABLY SWEET CAKE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Cake Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cake.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CK_BLOBBUT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CK","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":73600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CK_BLOBBUT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"QUICKSILVER","name":"QUICKSILVER","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SUBSTANCES/CURRENCY.QUICKSILVER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/substances/currency.quicksilver.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_QUICKSILVER_REWARD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/QUICKSILVER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_PET22","name":"R. SOMNADADUM EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Companion Egg","description":"A living, fertile egg, ready to hatch! The creature inside wriggles its chubby limbs, patiently waiting to be hatched. Scans indicate the being within has the genetic potential for a loyal personality.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.PET22.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.pet22.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_22_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_PET_22_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_PET22","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"VEHICLE_SCAN1","name":"RADAR AMPLIFIER","kind":"Technology","category":"Exocraft","categoryKey":"Exocraft","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Exocraft Signal Detection Upgrade","description":"Allows for additional building types to be acquired by the Exocraft Radar, including planetary Drop Pods, Abandoned Structures, and Waste Heaps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.SCANU1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.scanu1.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"VEHICLESCAN_U1_NAME","descriptionKey":"VEHICLESCAN_U1_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/VEHICLE_SCAN1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"VEHICLE_SCAN2","name":"RADAR POWER RESONATOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Exocraft","categoryKey":"Exocraft","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Exocraft Signal Detection Upgrade","description":"Allows for additional building types to be acquired by the Exocraft Radar, including Trade Outposts, Ruins, and Alien Structures.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.SCANU1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.scanu1.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"VEHICLESCAN_U2_NAME","descriptionKey":"VEHICLESCAN_U2_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/VEHICLE_SCAN2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_POLE5","name":"RADIANT BORE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Backbone","description":"This long pole forms the backbone of a traditional Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFPOLE.5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffpole.5.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":333,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_POLE5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WALKER_PROD_4","name":"RADIANT BRAIN","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Anomalous Material","description":"Shifting nanite clusters sewn together with a pugneum filament, this circuit is painfully hot to the touch. The purple light that leaks from within its wiring has softened, as if it has become less hostile. Previously embedded within a Sentinel Walker, this semi-organic computer has been altered by both Iteration: Tethys and a Messenger of the Atlas.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.WALKERBRAIN4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.walkerbrain4.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WALKER_PROD_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WALKER_PROD_4_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":35000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/WALKER_PROD_4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_CORE5","name":"RADIANT CHAMBER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Core","description":"This tightly-package electronic unit forms the core of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFCORE.5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffcore.5.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":646,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_CORE5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_HEAD5","name":"RADIANT HEART","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Head","description":"This ornate centerpiece forms the head of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFHEAD.5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffhead.5.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_HEAD5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DRONE_SHARD","name":"RADIANT SHARD","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Glassy Reality Intrusion","description":"A fragment of glassy lifeforce, chipped from a larger formation. Dynamic intermolecular binding gives the shard a strangely flexible, sinewy quality. It writhes gently, almost as if it were seeking something... Highly sought after for salvage operations, as it can be used to bypass the security systems of key Sentinel ship technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DRONESHARD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.droneshard.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_DRONE_SHARD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_DRONE_SHARD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":1900,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DRONE_SHARD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_RAD_RARE_L1","name":"RADIANT SUNFISH","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_RAD_RARE_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BIG.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.big.2.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_RAD_RARE_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_RAD_RARE_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":10000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_RAD_RARE_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_RAD","name":"RADIATION DEFLECTOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Hazard Protection Unit","description":"User is shielded from radiation damage. Greatly reduces user peril during the exploration of irradiated worlds. Micro-vibrations increase electromagnetic wave reflection, thereby reducing absorption. Device is charged by mineral extracts found in radioactive environments. Operates automatically once constructed within user's exosuit inventory.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PROTECTRADS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.protectrads.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_RAD_NAME","descriptionKey":"RAD1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_RAD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPSLOT_DMG4","name":"RADIATION LEAK","kind":"Technology","category":"Ship","categoryKey":"Ship","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Starship Component","description":"Starship subsystem severely damaged. Slot cannot be used for storage or technology until damage is repaired. Use to begin repair process. Core starship functionality is not affected. Repairing this damage will free slot up for general inventory use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/FARMPROD.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/farmprod.1.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPSLOT_DMG4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPSLOT_DMG_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SHIPSLOT_DMG4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UP_RAD1","name":"Radiation Protection","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Protection","categoryKey":"Protection","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"B-Class %NAME% Upgrade","description":"A significant upgrade for the Exosuit Radiation Protection System. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Significantly improves survival times in radioactive environments.","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_RAD","descriptionKey":"UP_RAD1_DESC","secondary":"T_RAD","tags":["2 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/upgrade-module/UP_RAD1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UP_RAD2","name":"Radiation Protection","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Protection","categoryKey":"Protection","rarity":"Epic","subtitle":"A-Class %NAME% Upgrade","description":"An extremely powerful upgrade for the Exosuit Radiation Protection System. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Drastically improves survival times in radioactive environments.","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_RAD","descriptionKey":"UP_RAD2_DESC","secondary":"T_RAD","tags":["2 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/upgrade-module/UP_RAD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UP_RAD3","name":"Radiation Protection","kind":"Upgrade module","category":"Protection","categoryKey":"Protection","rarity":"Legendary","subtitle":"S-Class %NAME% Upgrade","description":"A supremely powerful upgrade for the Exosuit Radiation Protection System. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Drastically improves survival times in radioactive environments.","icon":"","preview":"","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPROCEDURALTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_RAD","descriptionKey":"UP_RAD3_DESC","secondary":"T_RAD","tags":["2 possible stats"],"baseValue":null,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/upgrade-module/UP_RAD3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_RAD1","name":"RADIATION PROTECTION MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Significant Radiation Protection Upgrade","description":"A significant upgrade for the Exosuit Radiation Protection System. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Significantly improves survival times in radioactive environments.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.B.RADIOACTIVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.b.radioactive.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_RAD1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_RAD1_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":140,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_RAD1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_RAD2","name":"RADIATION PROTECTION MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Powerful Radiation Protection Upgrade","description":"An extremely powerful upgrade for the Exosuit Radiation Protection System. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Drastically improves survival times in radioactive environments.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.A.RADIOACTIVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.a.radioactive.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_RAD2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_RAD2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_RAD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_RAD3","name":"RADIATION PROTECTION MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Supreme Radiation Protection Upgrade","description":"A supremely powerful upgrade for the Exosuit Radiation Protection System. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Drastically improves survival times in radioactive environments.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.S.RADIOACTIVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.s.radioactive.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_RAD3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_RAD3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_RAD3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SCRAP_RAD","name":"Radioactive Hazard","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SUBSTANCES/SCRAP.RAD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/substances/scrap.rad.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_RADIOACTIVE_LABEL","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/SCRAP_RAD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"GAS2","name":"RADON","kind":"Resource","category":"Earth","categoryKey":"Earth","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Compressed Atmospheric Gas","description":"A colourless, odourless gas with a relatively short half-life. Found in both Radioactive and Frozen atmospheres, this gas is produced by the decay of other high-energy elements.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/GAS.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/gas.2.webp","colour":"#4c3780","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_GAS_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_GAS_2_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/GAS2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_BUI_TENT","name":"RAGGED TENT","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive buildable base ornament. A makeshift planetary shelter, assembled out of rudimentary and salvaged materials.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.BUILDERTENT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.buildertent.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_BUI_TENT_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_BUI_TENT_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BLD_BUI_TENT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JETS_RAINBOW","name":"RAINBOW JETPACK TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Jetpack Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Precisely calibrated multi-chromatic injectors alter the Jetpack's output, turning the exhaust trail into a vibrant display of colour. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.JETS.RAINBOW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.jets.rainbow.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_RAINBOW_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_RAINBOW_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":2100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/JETS_RAINBOW","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_HORROR","name":"RANCID FLESH","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A writhing slab of meat, harvested from the corpse of the biological horror that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.SAUSAGE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.sausage.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_HORROR_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_HORROR_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":6200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_HORROR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"LANDPROD3","name":"RARE METAL ELEMENT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Concentrated Metal Deposit","description":"A highly-prized metal product, this rare element is used in the manufacture of several advanced technologies. Metal is highly reactive and quickly bonds to exposed skin. User is advised to handle with extreme caution. Synthesised from Magnetised Ferrite.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.RAREMETALELEMENT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.raremetalelement.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_LANDPROD3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_LANDPROD3_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":4200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/LANDPROD3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP62","name":"RATSU'S PROSPECT","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class explorer benefits from hyperdrive and launcher bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP62.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship62.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_62_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SCIENTIFIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP62","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_COW","name":"RAW STEAK","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.RAW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.raw.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_COW_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_COW","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP31","name":"RAZAWAG OF THE ABYSS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class explorer benefits from hyperdrive and launcher bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP31.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship31.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_31_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SCIENTIFIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP31","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_MINERALS5","name":"RE-LATTICED ARC CRYSTAL","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Minerals)","description":"A neatly wrapped parcel of re-latticed arc crystals. Extremely rare mineral formations, arc crystals are in high demand in manufacturing economies, where their hardness and conductivity is vital to several industrial processes. They also make alluring (if dangerous) jewellery.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.MINERALS5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.minerals5.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_MINERALS_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_MINERALS_5_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_MINERALS5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HULK_CORE","name":"REACTOR CORE","kind":"Product","category":"Space Salvage","categoryKey":"SpaceSalvage","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Rare Salvage Material","description":"Full of heavy metals and precious synthetics, this is a valuable piece of industrial salvage. Harvested from the decaying remains of a collapsing space hulk. This has been processed at a deep-space outpost, and can be sold on the open market.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.HULK.CORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.hulk.core.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HULK_CORE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HULK_UNCOMMON_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":220000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/HULK_CORE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PURPM_GAS_KEY","name":"REALITY ANCHOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Spacetime Tether","description":"A ancient newborn star exists only at the strange intersection points of time and space, where the dissonance is strongest. To bind such a place to the rest of reality, a proper anchor is required...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2024.PURPLEKEY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2024.purplekey.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PURPM_KEY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PURPM_KEY_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1919,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/PURPM_GAS_KEY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PURPM_LUSH_KEY","name":"REALITY ANCHOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Spacetime Tether","description":"A ancient newborn star exists only at the strange intersection points of time and space, where the dissonance is strongest. To bind such a place to the rest of reality, a proper anchor is required...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2024.PURPLEKEY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2024.purplekey.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PURPM_KEY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PURPM_KEY_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1919,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/PURPM_LUSH_KEY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PURPM_WATER_KEY","name":"REALITY ANCHOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Spacetime Tether","description":"A ancient newborn star exists only at the strange intersection points of time and space, where the dissonance is strongest. To bind such a place to the rest of reality, a proper anchor is required...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2024.PURPLEKEY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2024.purplekey.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PURPM_KEY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PURPM_KEY_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1919,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/PURPM_WATER_KEY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HDRIVEBOOST3","name":"REALITY DE-THREADER","kind":"Technology","category":"Freighter","categoryKey":"Freighter","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Hyperdrive Companion Unit","description":"An augmentation for the colossal hyperdrive engine of an interstellar freighter. Uncapped, yet stabilised, fusion systems are threaded into user's hyperdrive. Allows starship to jump ever longer distances in deep space.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/TECHNOLOGY.FREIGHTERTHETA.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/technology.freightertheta.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FREIGHTER_DRIVE3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FREIGHTER_DRIVE3_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/F_HDRIVEBOOST3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JETS_SENT","name":"REALITY GLITCH TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Jetpack Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. The jetpack exhaust is fitted with a high-concentrate pugneum dispenser. When the jets are activated, the resulting reaction carves miniature distortions in reality, and creates an interesting visual effect. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.JETS.SENTINEL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.jets.sentinel.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SENTTRAIL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SENTTRAIL_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/JETS_SENT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_ROBOSUIT","name":"REBUILT EXOSUIT MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Salvaged Upgrade Components","description":"A salvaged upgrade for the Exosuit. Use to begin upgrade installation process. Constructed by the Autophage, this technology package is the result of a high degree of engineering improvisation. As a one-of-a-kind piece of repurposed technology, its exact effect upon suit performance is hard to determine prior to installation within the Exosuit's systems.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.ROBOT.SUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.robot.suit.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_ROBOSUIT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_ROBOSUIT_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":313,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_ROBOSUIT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP57","name":"RECKLESS PROPHECY HF3","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class fighter benefits from damage and manoeuvrability bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP57.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship57.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_57_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_FIGHTER_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP57","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_HEAD4A","name":"RECLAIMED CLAW","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Head","description":"This ornate centerpiece forms the head of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFHEAD.4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffhead.4.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD4A_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_HEAD4A","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_CORE4","name":"RECLAIMED GRIP","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Core","description":"This tightly-package electronic unit forms the core of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFCORE.4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffcore.4.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":646,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_CORE4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_HEAD4B","name":"RECLAIMED HEAD","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Head","description":"This ornate centerpiece forms the head of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFHEAD.4B.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffhead.4b.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD4B_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_HEAD4B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECH7","name":"RECYCLED CIRCUITRY","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Starship Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of broken down starship, created by a Starship Outfitting Terminal at a Space Station. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ALLOY5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.alloy5.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_7_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":520000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECH7","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BUI_HEAD_6","name":"RECYCLED FACIAL UNIT","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Appearance Modification","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override, granted by the Autophage to those who seek to build their own shell. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.HEAD.6.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.head.6.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TIP_HEAD_BUI_6_U","descriptionKey":"UI_BUILDER_CUSTOM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BUI_HEAD_6","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_POLE4","name":"RECYCLED POLE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Backbone","description":"This long pole forms the backbone of a traditional Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFPOLE.4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffpole.4.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":333,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_POLE4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FREIGHT_RED","name":"RED","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Freighter Customisation Option","description":"Unlocks this colour for freighter customisation. A self-replicating cloud of highly pigmatised nano-robots swarm the capital ship, changing its external appearance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FREIGHTPAINT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.freightpaint.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PAINT_RED_U","descriptionKey":"UI_PAINT_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FREIGHT_RED","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FIREWORK02","name":"RED FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"A luxury firework, rich in magnesium and cadmium. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.FIREWORK02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.firework02.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FIREWORK_PROD_RED_NAME","descriptionKey":"FIREWORK_PROD_RED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":50,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FIREWORK02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"JETS_RED","name":"RED JETPACK TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Jetpack Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Cadmium injection nozzles add a bold red flair to the Jetpack's output. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.JETS.RED.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.jets.red.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_RED_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_JETTRAIL_RED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/JETS_RED","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_CPLANET1","name":"RED STRIDER DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a colossal alien beast striding across a rust-coloured landscape.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DECAL15.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.decal15.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_CREPLANET1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_CREPLANET1_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_CPLANET1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FIREWORK07","name":"RED TITAN FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"This exotic firework, tinted with cadmium salts, is inspired by the undulating form of the titanic sandworm. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.FIREWORK07.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.firework07.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_TITAN_R_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_TITAN_R_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":60,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FIREWORK07","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_FIREWORK03","name":"RED-GOLD ATLAS FIREWORK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Consumable Pyrotechnics Device","description":"A stunning pyrotechnic rendition of an Atlas Interface, rendered in a burst of cadmium and gold. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.FIREWORK03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.firework03.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_EXPD_03_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PROD_EXPD_03_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":50,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_FIREWORK03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ALL_COM_M1","name":"REEF EEL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_M_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.EEL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.eel.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_M1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_M_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":2000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ALL_COM_M1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_LUSH_LEG_L1","name":"REEF GUARDIAN","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Legendary Fish","description":"\"A powerful, muscular body and teeth like razors, these gentle giants protect smaller creatures from predators.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.BIG.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.big.1.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_LEG_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_LEG_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":150000,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_LUSH_LEG_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_FLOUR","name":"REFINED FLOUR","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.FLOUR.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.flour.webp","colour":"#534c45","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_FLOUR_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_FLOUR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_REFINER","name":"REFINERY OUTPUT","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Storage Hopper","description":"A hopper for storing the materials generated by the refinery","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/COMPONENTS/EMPTYSLOTCIRCLE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/components/emptyslotcircle.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_REFINER_TECH_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINT_REFINE_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_REFINER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_J_DUST","name":"REFRESHING DRINK","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A consumable liquid, created in the Nutrient Processor. Prized across the galaxy for its pleasing mouth-feel and authentically natural flavours. Can be ingested as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SAUCE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.sauce.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_J_DUST_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_DRINK_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_J_DUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_V_REX","name":"REGIS GREASE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An animal byproduct, this nutritious morsel can be easily farmed without harm to the animal that produces it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ANIMALGREASE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.animalgrease.webp","colour":"#e57002","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_REX_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_VEG_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_V_REX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECH3","name":"REINFORCED PIPING","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of broken down starship, created by a Starship Outfitting Terminal at a Space Station. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.TECH3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.tech3.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":50000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECH3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECHMT3","name":"REINFORCED PIPING","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Multi-Tool Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of recycled Multi-Tool technology, created by a Multi-Tool Decommissioning Terminal aboard the Space Anomaly. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.TECH1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.tech1.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_MT_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":610000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECHMT3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BANNER18","name":"RELICS BANNER","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Bespoke Personal Identification","description":"Equip this exclusive Personal Flair in commemoration of the Relics expedition. Apply this banner to your profile at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S18.BANNER.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s18.banner.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_18_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BANNER_EXPD_18_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":220,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BANNER18","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_DECAL18","name":"RELICS DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal marks the Relics expedition's voyage of discovery and the recreation of the lost beasts of the past.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S18.DECAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s18.decal.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_18_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_EXPD_18_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wik