k","description":"A three-variety pack of luxury fireworks, bursting into clusters of wildly spiralling ribbons. Rich in zinc, Atlantideum, and indium. Ignite to create glittering displays in the sky. Place launch tube via the Build Menu (). Warning: Aim away from living creatures. Not recommended for indoor use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.FIREWORKPACK08.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.fireworkpack08.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PACK_TWIT_08_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FIREWORK_PACK_TWIT_08_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":250,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_FIREW10E","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_GRASS5","name":"RIBBON GRASS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A tough ornamental grass, suitable for growing in all biomes, soil types, and weather conditions. Closely related to certain varieties of seaweed, ribbon grass can be identified by its long rippling blades and fine hexagonal surface texture.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.GRASS05.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.grass05.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_GRASS_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_GRASS_5_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_GRASS5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_COLD_EPIC_S1","name":"RIMESCALE SNAPPER","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Rare Fish","description":"UI_FISH_COLD_EPIC_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT2.FISH.XL.2.DDS","preview":"/as