PD_POSTER22B","name":"SAGES POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. This poster depicts the Sage fragment of the Traveller soul. Brilliant, deep, and wise. You know the universe profoundly...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S22.POSTERB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/expedition.s22.posterb.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER22B_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER22B_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER22B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_HOTPLANT01","name":"SAIL PALM","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A large-leafed, heat resistant tree. Its broad fronds are laced with minerals, forming a protective barrier against the harsh sunlight of its native conditions.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.HOTPLANT01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.hotplant01.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_HOTPLANT_1_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_HOTPLANT01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FISH_HAT1","name":"SAILFIN TANK","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Helmet","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Transport evidence of your fishing achievements around in your own personalised cranium/aquarium interchange. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.S17.FISHBOWLEGG01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.s17.fishbowlegg01.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_FISH_HAT1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPED_FISH_HAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FISH_HAT1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WATERLAND_ALIEN","name":"SALINE CARAPACE","kind":"Technology","category":"Alien Ship","categoryKey":"AlienShip","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Sentient Vessel Node","description":"A salty membrane encases the ship, dramatically increasing its natural buoyancy. The carapace will allow the vessel to float, making water landings possible.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/PRODUCT.BIOEXOTIC.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/product.bioexotic.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WATERLAND_ALIEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WATERLAND_ALIEN_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/WATERLAND_ALIEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WATER1","name":"SALT","kind":"Resource","category":"Earth","categoryKey":"Earth","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Aquatic Mineral Extract","description":"A naturally occuring salt, found in abundance in underwater minerals. Can be processed in a Refiner to create Chlorine. This refined form is used in the manufacture of advanced products and technologies.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.WATER.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.water.1.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WATER1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WATER1_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":101,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/WATER1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WATER_CRAFT","name":"SALT REFRACTOR","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Crafted Technology Component","description":"A specialist technology component, vital to the complex internals of modern laser systems. This light-scattering device takes advantage of the unique optical properties of stabilised and polished salt, to both slow and refract passing photons.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALTREFRACTOR.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.saltrefractor.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WATER_CRAFT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WATER_CRAFT_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":30500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/WATER_CRAFT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CB_FCUST","name":"SALT-LACED HONEY CAKE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Thick, Sweet Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKEBLOB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cakeblob.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CB_FCUST_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CB","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":92300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CB_FCUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DUST_RARE_XL","name":"SALTSCALE BLOATER","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DUST_RARE_XL_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.BIG.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.big.2.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_RARE_XL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DUST_RARE_XL_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":20000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DUST_RARE_XL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_FISH","name":"SALTY CHUNKS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.RAW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.raw.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_FISH_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_FISH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_SALT","name":"SALTY CRUNCHER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_SALT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":33000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_SALT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_FCUSTARD","name":"SALTY CUSTARD","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SAUCE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.sauce.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_FCUSTARD_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":28000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_FCUSTARD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_DNUT_FCUST","name":"SALTY DOUGHNUT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DOUGHNUT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.doughnut.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_DNUT_FCUST_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":100000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_DNUT_FCUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_J_SALT","name":"SALTY JUICE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A consumable liquid, created in the Nutrient Processor. Prized across the galaxy for its pleasing mouth-feel and authentically natural flavours. Can be ingested as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SAUCE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.sauce.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_J_SALT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_DRINK_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_J_SALT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_MIX","name":"SALTY PLATTER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SCALLOP.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.scallop.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCP