c Data","description":"A map to a location in deep space. A large wreck has been marked, rich with salvagable materials. Select the map and use Plot Route () to pin the location in your navigation systems. New maps can be gained by exchanging deep-space resources with an Outpost Quartermaster.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.STARMAP.HULK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.starmap.hulk.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_CHART_HULK_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CHART_HULK_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":45000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/CHART_HULK","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_HEAD1","name":"SALVAGED AERATOR","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Head","description":"This ornate centerpiece forms the head of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFHEAD.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffhead.1.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_HEAD1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_CORE1","name":"SALVAGED BATTERY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Core","description":"This tightly-package electronic unit forms the core of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFCORE.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffcore.1.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":646,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_CORE1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BP_SALVAGE","name":"SALVAGED DATA","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Salvaged Technology","description":"The salvageable heart of some ancient technology. Unreadable in its current form. These databanks can be spent at a Construction Research Unit and used to research new Construction Blueprints.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SALVAGE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.salvage.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BP_SALVAGE_NAME","descriptionKey":"BP_SALVAGE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":52000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":3,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BP_SALVAGE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BUI_HEAD_1","name":"SALVAGED FACIAL UNIT","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Appearance Modification","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override, granted by the Autophage to those who seek to build their own shell. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.HEAD.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.head.1.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TIP_HEA