ent","Trade good"],"baseValue":1000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TOX_COM_S3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DEEPSEA_PROD","name":"SEA GLASS","kind":"Product","category":"Component","categoryKey":"Component","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Precious Material","description":"A etheral shard, this translucent plane is both mineral and alive, both of the water and of another realm. Of high value to collectors across the universe.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SEAGLASS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.seaglass.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_DEEPSEA_PROD_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_DEEPSEA_PROD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":266000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DEEPSEA_PROD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PROC_FEAR","name":"Sea Horror (procedural)","kind":"Procedural item","category":"Sea Horror","categoryKey":"Sea Horror","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Terrifying Sample","description":"An appalling relic, the haunted remains of some abyssal horror. It has lived at least %AGE%0 lifetimes, and will live many more again. Will stalk the bearer across the galaxy and the next, unless it is sold before the curse can take effect.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.HORRIFICARTIFACT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.horrificartifact.webp","colour":"#1eb809","source":"PROCEDURALPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ITEMGEN_FORMAT_WATERWEIRD","descriptionKey":"ITEMGEN_WATERWEIRD_DESC","secondary":"Procedural","tags":["Generated name and value"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/procedural-item/PROC_FEAR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PROC_SEA","name":"Sea Loot (procedural)","kind":"Procedural item","category":"Sea Loot","categoryKey":"Sea Loot","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Aquatic Treasure","description":"A well-preserved marine treasure, found deep under the ocean. It was protected from the elements by a thick sea-chest, and is at least %AGE%00 years old. Highly valuable to collectors of ancient artifacts.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TREASUREPROD.WATERLOOT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/treasureprod.waterloot.webp","colour":"#1eb809","source":"PROCEDURALPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ITEMGEN_FORMAT_WATER","descriptionKey":"ITEMGEN_WATER_DESC","secondary":"Procedural","tags":["Generated name and value"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/procedural-item/PROC_SEA","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_TRASH_3","name":"SEA SPONGE","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Collected Flotsam","description":"A piece of flotsam, wrenched from its years of drifting in the water when it became entangled in a fishing lure. Of little use to anyone.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.WEED.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.weed.3.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_WEED3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_TRASH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Trade good"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_TRASH_3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_STEW2","name":"SEA'S BOUNTY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A huge slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SCALLOP.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.scallop.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_STEW_ALT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_XL_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":71450,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_STEW2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_XL3","name":"SEAFOOD 'FEAST'","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A huge slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SALMON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.salmon.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_XL_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_XL_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":39000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_XL3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_STEW","name":"SEAFOOD STEW","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.VEGSTEW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.vegstew.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_STEW_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_LARGE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":52500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_STEW","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_LARGE3","name":"SEARED FILLET","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SALMON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.salmon.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_LARGE_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_LARGE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":35400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_LARGE3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH11","name":"SECURITY ALARM","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"A small light/klaxon hybrid, designed to warn of unauthorised access to the device. Damage to the alarm has caused it to overload and short other nearby circuits.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/COMPOUND.4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/compound.4.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH11_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH11_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH11","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_ATLAS_SEED1","name":"SEED OF DREAMS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Voice of the Wordless Atlas","description":"A seed of creation, a tiny drop of the infinity of the Atlas. This mere atom contains boundless noise, each tiny vibration the hopes and dreams of entire lifetimes. Use to resonate the seed, converting its waveform into the audible range.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.10.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.10.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_1_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_ATLAS_SEED1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_ATLAS_SEED5","name":"SEED OF HOPE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Voice of the Wordless Atlas","description":"A seed of creation, a perfect droplet of infinity. A gift from the Atlas, this is a tiny fragment of all the universe's dreams, will, power and life; a fragment of the Travellers; a fragment of myself. Use to resonate the seed, converting its waveform into the audible range.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.9.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.9.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_5_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_ATLAS_SEED5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_ATLAS_SEED4","name":"SEED OF LIFE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Voice of the Wordless Atlas","description":"A seed of creation, a tiny drop of the infinity of the Atlas. Though a mere speck, this seed contains the potential for an entire universe; a boundless, glorious expansion. Use to resonate the seed, converting its waveform into the audible range.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.5.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_4_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_ATLAS_SEED4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_ATLAS_SEED2","name":"SEED OF POWER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Voice of the Wordless Atlas","description":"A seed of creation, a tiny drop of the infinity of the Atlas. A particle of indescribable energy, it is unclear how to continues to exist within this reality. Use to resonate the seed, converting its waveform into the audible range.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.7.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.7.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_2_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_ATLAS_SEED2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S10_ATLAS_SEED3","name":"SEED OF WILL","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Voice of the Wordless Atlas","description":"A seed of creation, a tiny drop of the infinity of the Atlas. A flash of pure light and fury, this seed contains the unsuppressable need to exist. Use to resonate the seed, converting its waveform into the audible range.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.6.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.6.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"S10_ATLAS_SEED_3_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1600,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/S10_ATLAS_SEED3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BIOSHIP_COMP4","name":"SEEDS OF GLASS","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Frozen Archive","description":"A biomechanical construct, created to the design of an anonymous host. Capsules of genetic material, encased in a film of living glass. Shared memories swim in the their reflective surfaces, waiting for their chance to shape the life within.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/PRODUCT.BIOCOMP4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/product.biocomp4.webp","colour":"#311a49","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_COMP4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_COMP4_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":1616,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BIOSHIP_COMP4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_BMEAT","name":"SEEPING PIE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATPIE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatpie.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PIE_BMEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":62000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_BMEAT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MECH_FUEL","name":"SELF-GREASING SERVOS","kind":"Technology","category":"Mech","categoryKey":"Mech","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Motor Efficiency Upgrade","description":"An automatically-regulated lubricant dispenser fitted to the leg joints of the Minotaur reduce friction and encourage fuel-efficient motion. Significantly reduces fuel burn in the Minotaur's Daedalus Engine.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/VEHICLE/RENDER.ENGINE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/vehicle/render.engine.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MECH_FUEL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MECH_FUEL_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MECH_FUEL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_ALLOY2","name":"SELF-REPAIRING HERIDIUM","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Construction)","description":"A hopper of self-repairing Heridium. It looks fresh. Used in the creation of scientific components. Self-repairing heridium is particularly useful for deployment in remote facilities, where maintenance opportunities may be limited or deadly.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ALLOY2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.alloy2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ALLOY_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ALLOY_2_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":6000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_ALLOY2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"COMPOUND2","name":"SEMICONDUCTOR","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Manufactured Gas Product","description":"An advanced material useful in many electronic devices, with its own in-built temperature regulator. Crafted from Thermic Condensate and Nitrogen Salt.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/COMPOUND.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/compound.2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_COMPOUND_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_COMPOUND_2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable","Trade good"],"baseValue":320000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/COMPOUND2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"WEAPSENT_DMG1","name":"SENTIENCE RESISTOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Incomplete Sentinel Salvage","description":"This Multi-Tool is a piece of hybrid technology, a fusion of crude scrap and a deep, powerful energy - part salvage, part Sentinel, part something undefinable... This process of recycled fusion was incomplete when this tool was acquired. Use to continue repair operations and free this slot for general use.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/ROBOTSHIP.WEAPON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/robotship.weapon.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_WEAPSENT_DMG1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_WEAPSENT_DMG_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/WEAPSENT_DMG1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DEEP_LEG_S1","name":"SENTIENT CRAB","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Legendary Fish","description":"\"Deep feeling swims in those watery eyestalks, the thoughtful intelligence of a true ancient.\"","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.CRAB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.crab.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_LEG_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_LEG_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":4,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DEEP_LEG_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SET_SENT_NEG","name":"Sentinel Alert Level","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SETTLEMENT/NEGATIVEALERT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/settlement/negativealert.webp","colour":"#7b0000","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SETTLEMENT_STAT_SENTINELS","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/SET_SENT_NEG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SET_SENT_POS","name":"Sentinel Alert Level","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Reward Item","description":"Currency or faction standing, given as a reward.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SETTLEMENT/POSITIVEALERT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/settlement/positivealert.webp","colour":"#8a7f72","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SETTLEMENT_STAT_SENTINELS","descriptionKey":"UI_REWARDPOP_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/SET_SENT_POS","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"CHART_HIVE","name":"SENTINEL BOUNDARY MAP","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Anomalous Planetary Location Data","description":"A strange, shifting map. Though hard to focus upon, this chart appears to show the location of a nearby Sentinel Pillar. Such Sentinel strongholds house many secrets... Select the map and use Plot Route () to pin the location in your Exosuit display.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.STARCHART.HIVE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.starchart.hive.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STARCHART_HIVE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STARCHART_HIVE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/CHART_HIVE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIPGUN_ROBO","name":"SENTINEL CANNON","kind":"Technology","category":"Robot Ship","categoryKey":"RobotShip","rarity":"Always","subtitle":"Sentinel Ship Gun","description":"Sentinel-grade weapons system, engineered for the singular purpose of annihilating rogue ships in violation of system regulations. Press to administer lethal force.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/ROBOTSHIP.WEAPON.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/robotship.weapon.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPGUN_ROBO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPGUN_ROBO_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Primary","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/SHIPGUN_ROBO","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SENTSUIT","name":"SENTINEL EXOSUIT FRAGMENT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Forbidden Exosuit Module","description":"An anomalous upgrade for Exosuit. Use to begin upgrade installation process. This strange fragment of debris has been extracted from Sentinel technology. Its exact effect upon suit performance is impossible to predict before the nantite foam has fully spread within the Exosuit's systems.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.SENTINEL.SUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.sentinel.suit.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SENTSUIT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SENTSUIT_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SENTSUIT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DRONE_FRIEND_X","name":"SENTINEL FLARE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Sentinel Communicator","description":"A specialist device, created by Iteration Tethys. Its primary function is to hail your reconstructed Sentinel drone. Select the device and use Deactivate Broadcast () to stop signalling [ The Sentry ]. While this flare is active in your Exosuit inventory, the drone will stay by your side while planetside.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DRONEFRIENDX.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.dronefriendx.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_DRONE_FRIEND_X_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_DRONE_FRIEND_X_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DRONE_FRIEND_X","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DRONE_FRIEND","name":"SENTINEL FLARE (OFF)","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Sentinel Communicator","description":"A specialist device, created by Iteration Tethys. Its primary function is to hail your reconstructed Sentinel drone. Select the device and use Activate Flare () to signal [The Drone]. While this flare is active in your Exosuit inventory, the drone will stay by your side while planetside.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DRONEFRIEND.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.dronefriend.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_DRONE_FRIEND_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_DRONE_FRIEND_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":16,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DRONE_FRIEND","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SENTGUN","name":"SENTINEL WEAPONS SHARD","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Forbidden Multi-Tool Module","description":"An anomalous upgrade for the Multi-Tool's Weapon Systems. Use to begin upgrade installation process. This eerie, glassy shard has been extracted from Sentinel debris. Its exact effect upon the Multi-Tool will not be known until after installation is complete.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.SENTINEL.GUN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.sentinel.gun.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SENTGUN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SENTGUN_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SENTGUN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_FRIG4","name":"SERVO ARM","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"A small mechanical joint, used to correct small mechanical errors across the device. A malfunction is causing it to take functional components and push them into the wrong place, creating even more damage.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component4.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH15_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH15_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_FRIG4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH15","name":"SERVO ARM","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"A small mechanical joint, used to correct small mechanical errors across the device. A malfunction is causing it to take functional components and push them into the wrong place, creating even more damage.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMPONENT4.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.component4.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH15_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH15_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH15","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP18","name":"SESAKIS'S GAMBLE HX8","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship, specialised in transporting cargo. Pre-fitted with upgraded Deflector Shields and a Cargo Scan Deflector, this hauler craft is ideal for ensuring precious goods - legal or otherwise - stay intact in transit. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP18.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship18.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_18_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_18_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP18","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"CHART_SETTLE","name":"SETTLEMENT CHART","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Specialist Planetary Chart","description":"A map showing the location of a nearby planetary settlement, acquired from the Space Station Cartographer. Select the map and use Plot Route () to pin the location in your Exosuit display.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.STARCHART.SETTLEMENT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.starchart.settlement.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STARCHART_SETTLE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STARCHART_SETTLE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":4,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/CHART_SETTLE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"S9_MAP1","name":"SETTLEMENT COORDINATES BETA","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Utopia Foundation Settlement Chart","description":"A map from the Utopia Foundation, showing personalised coordinates for your ta