ct","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Starship Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of broken down starship, created by a Starship Outfitting Terminal at a Space Station. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMMIDITY2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.commidity2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_6_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":12000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECH6","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_FLORAL03","name":"SPOONLEAF","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This elegant flowering plant consists of a single spathe coiled around a perfumed core. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.FLORAL03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.floral03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_FLORAL_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_FLORAL_3_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_FLORAL03","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_MUSHROOM","name":"SPORE DUNKERS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_MUSHROOM_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":35000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_MUSHROOM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_TOXPLANT04","name":"SPOREHIP TREE","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"This plant is characterised by its spherical floral organs. These cavernous spheres release masses of toxic spores in reflexive response to nearby movement, clinging to the fur of nearby fauna for distribution and propagation. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.TOXPLANT04.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.toxplant04.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_TOXPLANT_4_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_TOXPLANT_4_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_TOXPLANT04","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_RAD_COM_S2","name":"SPOTTED PROTOFIN","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_RAD_COM_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.SMALL.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.small.1.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_RAD_COM_S2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_RAD_COM_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":1000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_RAD_COM_S2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_DEEP_RARE_S1","name":"SPRATFIN","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_S_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.DEFAULT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.default.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_S1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_DEEP_RARE_S_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_DEEP_RARE_S1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_SPRIGBUSH","name":"SPRIG BUSH","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A compact, many-leafed herb. Lends a pleasant subtle fragrance to gardens. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.SPRIGBUSH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.sprigbush.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_SPRIGBUSH_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_SPRIGBUSH_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_SPRIGBUSH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH12","name":"SPRING CASING","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"The casing for a high-compression spring. The casing has ruptured, causing the spring to shoot out and damage the rest of the device.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/COMPOUND.6.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/compound.6.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH12_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH12_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH12","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIP_PIRATE","name":"SPUTTERING STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. A ramshackle ship exhaust nozzle, hand-assembled in an emergency by an outlaw. Has an occasional propensity to explode, but with no adverse effect on flight handling. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.SHIPTRAIL.PIRATE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.shiptrail.pirate.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_PIRATE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_PIRATE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":2100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SHIP_PIRATE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"T_SHIP_PIRATE","name":"SPUTTERING STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships","categoryKey":"AllShips","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. A ramshackle ship exhaust nozzle, hand-assembled in an emergency by an outlaw. Has an occasional propensity to explode, but with no adverse effect on flight handling. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.SHIPTRAIL.PIRATE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.shiptrail.pirate.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_PIRATE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_PIRATE_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":[],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/T_SHIP_PIRATE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SPEC_FISH_HAT5","name":"SQUID TANK","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Helmet","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. Transport evidence of your fishing achievements around in your own personalised cranium/aquarium interchange. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.S17.FISHBOWLJAR02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.s17.fishbowljar02.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SPEC_FISH_HAT5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPED_FISH_HAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SPEC_FISH_HAT5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_MM_BUGJAM","name":"SQUIRMING FANCY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Writhing, Roiling Batter. Some caution is advised.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CUPCAKEEVIL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.cupcakeevil.webp","colour":"#6ad01e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_MM_BUGJAM_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_MM","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":153300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_MM_BUGJAM","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_SPEC02","name":"SSV NORMANDY SR1","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Frigate","description":"The SSV Normandy SR1 is a one-of-a-kind 'deep scout' frigate. This legendary ship represents peace and cooperation between races, and commemorates completion of the 'Beachhead' Expedition. Recruiting this frigate will add it to your fleet. Manage your frigate fleet from a Fleet Command Room aboard your freighter, and consult your Navigator to deploy frigates on lucrative expeditions.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.SPEC02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.spec02.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_SPEC_02_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_SPEC_02_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_SPEC02","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_CORE3","name":"STAFF CORE 3","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Core","description":"This tightly-package electronic unit forms the core of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFCORE.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffcore.3.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_CORE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":646,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_CORE3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_HEAD3","name":"STAFF HEAD 3","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Head","description":"This ornate centerpiece forms the head of a Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFHEAD.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffhead.3.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_HEAD_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_HEAD3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STAFF_POLE3","name":"STAFF POLE 3","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Staff Backbone","description":"This long pole forms the backbone of a traditional Autophage staff. One of three core components, this can be assembled into a staff at the Autophage Synthesis Terminal found at all Autophage camps.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.STAFFPOLE.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.staffpole.3.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STAFF_POLE_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":333,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STAFF_POLE3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"PLANT_LUSH","name":"STAR BULB","kind":"Resource","category":"Flora","categoryKey":"Flora","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Harvested Agricultural Substance","description":"A beautiful gemstone, this prized product is the engorged, luminescent berry of the Star Bramble. The host plant requires lush conditions to thrive in the wild, but can be farmed in all environments with the aid of a Hydroponics Tray.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4SUBSTANCES/SUBSTANCE.PLANT.LUSH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4substances/substance.plant.lush.webp","colour":"#208dab","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_PLANTSUB_LUSH_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_PLANTSUB_LUSH_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":["Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":32,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/PLANT_LUSH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STARSUIT","name":"STAR SEED","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Priceless Fragment","description":"The smallest of sparks, housed within a containment field of unknown origins. The seed glows with life, desperate to escape and fulfill its potential.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.HEXCORE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.hexcore.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"STARBIRTH_ITEM_NAME","descriptionKey":"STARBIRTH_ITEM_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/STARSUIT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_COMMODITY2","name":"STAR SILK","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods","description":"Several spools of star silk. Star silk is woven on enormous solar looms in orbit around trading planets. Cosmic ray impact triggers the pattern of the weave, which can then be used in advanced material processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMMODITY2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.commodity2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMMOD_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_COMMOD_2_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":6000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_COMMODITY2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CB_SCUST","name":"STARBIRTH DELIGHT","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Thick, Sweet Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.CAKEBLOB.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.cakeblob.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CB_SCUST_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CB","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":92300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CB_SCUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TGA_SHIP01","name":"STARBORN PHOENIX","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive reforged starship, commemorating a time when Travellers old and new joined together to voyage across the stars. This unusual ship is optimised for effortless gliding during flight, while a localised vector field allows the craft to hover above solid planes. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.THGASHIP.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.thgaship.webp","colour":"#262626","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIP_TGA_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIP_TGA_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TGA_SHIP01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_POSTER12C","name":"STARBORN POSTER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive piece of self-adhesive, crease-proof wall art. The Traveller approaches, delicately piloting their tiny ship through the stars. The Atlas, infinite, waits.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.POSTER12C.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.poster12c.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER12C_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_EXPD_POSTER12C_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_POSTER12C","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_SHIP12","name":"STARBORN RUNNER","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"A unique and exclusive starship, commemorating completion of the Omega expedition. This unusual starship is optimised for effortless gliding during flight, while a localised vector field allows the craft to hover above solid planes. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.SHIP12.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.ship12.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_SHIP_12_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_SHIP_12_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_SHIP12","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BUI_HEAD_10","name":"STARBOUND CASING","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Appearance Modification","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override, granted by the Autophage to those who seek to build their own shell. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.HEAD.10.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.head.10.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TIP_HEAD_BUI_10_U","descriptionKey":"UI_BUILDER_CUSTOM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BUI_HEAD_10","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_GUN23","name":"STARBOUND v0.27","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Multifunction Survival Device","description":"An exclusive vintage Multi-Tool. Recovered from a forgotten archive, this Multi-Tool evokes memories of a bygone era. Take this Multi-Tool to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current Multi-Tool. Swap between active Multi-Tools from the Utilities section of the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/EXPEDITION.S23.RETROGUN.DDS","preview":"/ass