ion process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Improves ship strength for increased combat endurance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.C.SHIELD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.c.shield.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD1_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":60,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SHIPSHIELD1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SHIPSHIELD2","name":"STARSHIP SHIELD MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Significant Starship Shield Upgrade","description":"A significant upgrade for the Starship Defensive Shielding. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Significantly improves ship strength for increased combat endurance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.B.SHIELD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.b.shield.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":140,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SHIPSHIELD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SHIPSHIELD3","name":"STARSHIP SHIELD MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Powerful Starship Shield Upgrade","description":"An extremely powerful upgrade for the Starship Defensive Shielding. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Dramatically improves ship strength for increased combat endurance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.A.SHIELD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.a.shield.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD3_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SHIPSHIELD3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SHIPSHIELD4","name":"STARSHIP SHIELD MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Supreme Starship Shield Upgrade","description":"A supremely powerful upgrade for the Starship Defensive Shielding. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Dramatically improves ship strength for increased combat endurance.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.S.SHIELD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.s.shield.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD4_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_SHIPSHIELD4_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":480,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_SHIPSHIELD4","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_CG_JHOT","name":"STARTLING FANCY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. These cake-like nutrients are processed from a base of Proto-Batter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.CUPCAKE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.cupcake.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_CG_JHOT_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAKE_DESC_CG","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":78000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_CG_JHOT","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ULTRAPROD2","name":"STASIS DEVICE","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Highly Refined Technology","description":"A device specifically crafted to keep lifeforms alive for thousands of years longer than their natural lifespan. Such a device requires great skill to manufacture, as not only is it technically complex, but the consequences for a user in the event of malfunction would be disastrous. Crafted from Quantum Processors, Cryogenic Chambers, and Iridesite.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ULTRAPROD.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/ultraprod.2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ULTRAPROD_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ULTRAPROD_2_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":15600000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ULTRAPROD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HULK_LOCKBOX","name":"STASIS LOCKER","kind":"Product","category":"Space Salvage","categoryKey":"SpaceSalvage","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Specialist Salvage Material","description":"Still sealed, this is an extremely valuable piece of industrial salvage. Harvested from the decaying remains of a collapsing space hulk. This has been processed at a deep-space outpost, and can be sold on the open market.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.HULK.LOCKBOX.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.hulk.lockbox.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HULK_LOCKBOX_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HULK_RARE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":93000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/HULK_LOCKBOX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ATLAS_SEED_7","name":"STATE PHASURE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Unique valuable curiosity","description":"For unknown reasons, this unique Atlas Seed has been phased out of alignment with this quantum reality. Contents cannot be determined.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/ATLASSEED.7.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/atlasseed.7.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"ATLAS_SEED_7_NAME","descriptionKey":"ATLAS_SEED_7_DESC","secondary":"Stellar","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":1000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ATLAS_SEED_7","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STATION_KEY","name":"STATION OVERRIDE","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"AI Master Key","description":"A portable data drive containing the AI override codes for a Space Station Core. The importance of the station AI core ensures that such keys are both highly regulated and extremely profitable on the black market.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/AUTOTRANSLATOR.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/autotranslator.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STATION_KEY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STATION_KEY_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":256000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STATION_KEY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_SHIPMAT13","name":"STEALTH PAINT","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Customisation Option","description":"An exclusive starship customisation option, creating a unique low-radar-signature look for Fighter and Hauler class starships. Acquire starship components by breaking down existing ships at the Starship Outfitting unit aboard any space station. Visit the Starship Fabricator to design and assemble a new vessel.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.STEALTHSHIPMAT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.stealthshipmat.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_SHIPMAT_CAMO_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_SHIPMAT_CAMO_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_SHIPMAT13","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIP_DARK","name":"STEALTH STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. Baryon suppressors alter the Pulse Engine's output, giving a distinct black tint to its signature trail. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SHIPTRAIL.DARK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.shiptrail.dark.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_DARK_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_DARK_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":2100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SHIP_DARK","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"T_SHIP_DARK","name":"STEALTH STARSHIP TRAIL","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships","categoryKey":"AllShips","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Starship Exhaust Override","description":"An exclusive Starship Exhaust Modifier. Baryon suppressors alter the Pulse Engine's output, giving a distinct black tint to its signature trail. Install this technology in your starship inventory to change the appearance of the engine exhaust trails.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.SHIPTRAIL.DARK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.shiptrail.dark.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_DARK_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIPTRAIL_DARK_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":[],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/T_SHIP_DARK","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_F_SQUID","name":"STEAMED RUBBER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A slab of seafood, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.FISH.SQUID.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.fish.squid.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_SQUID_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_FOOD_LARGE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":33100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_F_SQUID","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_VEG","name":"STEAMED VEGETABLES","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An edible plant, harvested from planetary flora. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.VEG.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.veg.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_PLANT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1800,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_VEG","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_SCUSTARD","name":"STELLAR CUSTARD","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subjected to further processing.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SAUCE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.sauce.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_R_SCUSTARD_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":28000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_R_SCUSTARD","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_PIE_SCUST","name":"STELLAR CUSTARD TART","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.TART.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.tart.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_PIE_SCUST_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":78000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_PIE_SCUST","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_ICE_STAR","name":"STELLAR ICE CREAM","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.ICECREAM.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.icecream.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_ICE_STAR_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":36000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_ICE_STAR","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP33","name":"STELLAR NOJUKU XV","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class hauler benefits from shield and inventory capacity bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP33.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship33.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_33_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_DROPSHIP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP33","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_ORGAN_STEW","name":"STEWED ORGANS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A highly refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Food such as this can be highly valuable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.MEATSTEW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.meatstew.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_ORGAN_STEW_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_REFINED_DESC_FINAL","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":6400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_ORGAN_STEW","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_V_BLOB","name":"STICKY 'HONEY'","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An animal byproduct, this nutritious morsel can be easily farmed without harm to the animal that produces it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.HONEY.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.honey.webp","colour":"#e57002","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_BLOB_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_VEG_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_V_BLOB","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_CARAMEL","name":"STICKY FINGER","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A well-baked biscuit, created in the Nutrient Processor. What was once a thin sheet of vaguely-sweetend nutrient paste has been elevated with the addition of carefully-chosen ingredients.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.REFINED.BISCUIT.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.refined.biscuit.webp","colour":"#d35300","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_CARAMEL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_REF","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":41000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_CARAMEL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BIOSHIP_EGG2","name":"STIRRING VOID EGG","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Agitated Curiosity","description":"An anomalous egg. Since the encounter with the bizarre deep-space 'creature', its strange music has grown more active, more agitated. When touched, conjures a powerful vision of a dust-covered world of extreme storms.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/BIO/PRODUCT.EGG2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/bio/product.egg2.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_EGG2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BIOSHIP_EGG2_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":1616,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":0,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BIOSHIP_EGG2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"ILLEGAL_PROD2","name":"STOLEN DNA SAMPLES","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Smuggled Goods","description":"Sealed vials of unregistered DNA samples, free of the standard biosecurity mechanisms that prevent unlawful genetic tampering. Purchase is illegal at nearly all galactic trade terminals. Regular supply is only available within outlaw systems. Selling banned goods into commercially-regulated space may be highly profitable.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SMUGGLING2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.smuggling2.webp","colour":"#383838","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_ILLEGAL_PROD2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_ILLEGAL_PROD2_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":9000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/ILLEGAL_PROD2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ALL_COM_XL","name":"STONESCALE SHARK","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_XL_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.SHARK.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.shark.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_XL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ALL_COM_XL_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":5000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ALL_COM_XL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SHIP_INV_TOKEN","name":"STORAGE AUGMENTATION","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Starship Expansion Module","description":"A technology module harvested from the remains of a salvaged starship. May also be collected from freighter crash sites or salvaged during frigate expeditions. Can be used to expand starship storage capacity at the Space Station's Starship Outfitter.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.STORAGETOKEN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.storagetoken.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SHIP_INV_TOKEN_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SHIP_INV_TOKEN_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":125000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":3,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SHIP_INV_TOKEN","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"STORM_CRYSTAL","name":"STORM CRYSTAL","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Unique valuable curiosity","description":"A rare and highly valuable cluster of storm crystals. These crystalline structures thrive in stormy conditions, and naturally attract lightning strikes, becoming spectacularly luminescent when ionised. Exclusively found on extreme weather planets.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.STORMCRYSTAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.stormcrystal.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_STORMCRYSTAL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_STORMCRYSTAL_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Trade good"],"baseValue":206000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/STORM_CRYSTAL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_BACKPACK01","name":"STREAMLINED JETPACK UNIT","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exosuit Visual Enhancement","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. A streamlined and lightweight backpack unit, featuring an elegant single-thruster design. This exclusive exosuit augmentation commemorates completion of the inaugural Expedition, 'Pioneers'. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.EXPEDITION.BACKPACK01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.expedition.backpack01.webp","colour":"#007951","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_BACKPACK_01_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_BACKPACK_01_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_BACKPACK01","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_M_STRIDER","name":"STRIDER SAUSAGE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"A nutritious meat product, harvested from the corpse of the creature that once contained it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.MEAT.RAW.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.meat.raw.webp","colour":"#bb3830","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_STRIDER_MEAT_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_MEAT_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":1400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_M_STRIDER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_WPLANT5","name":"STRIP CORAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A giant calcium formation, naturally configured into a strip of non-orientable space. Adds a mysterious deep-sea quality to any habitable base.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.WATERPLANT05.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.waterplant05.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_WATERPLANT_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_WATERPLANT_5_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_WPLANT5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_PULSESPEED","name":"SUB-LIGHT AMPLIFIER","kind":"Technology","category":"All Ships Except Alien","categoryKey":"AllShipsExceptAlien","rarity":"VeryRare","subtitle":"Pulse Engine Augmentation","description":"A highly-advanced upgrade for the Pulse Engine, vastly increasing interplanetary speed. Naturally occuring frameshift effects within the Pulse Engine are amplified by tritium-based resonators, increasing its maximum sub-light speed.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.PULSEDRIVEMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.pulsedrivemod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_PULSESPEED_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_PULSESPEED_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_PULSESPEED","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SALVAGE_TECH8","name":"SUBATOMIC REGULATORS","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"Starship Subcomponent","description":"A valuable piece of broken down starship, created by a Starship Outfitting Terminal at a Space Station. Component is useful only as scrap to be sold at a Trade Terminal.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.COMMODITY1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.commodity1.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_8_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SALVAGE_TECH_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":940000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SALVAGE_TECH8","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_WPLANT7","name":"SUCCULENT ALGAE TOWER","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"The broad surfaces of these algae leaves rapidly absorb and process huge volumes of salt water, storing the processed liquid as a powerful acid. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BIOMEPROP.WATERPLANT07.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.biomeprop.waterplant07.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_WATERPLANT_7_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_WATERPLANT_7_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_WPLANT7","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_DUSTPLANT3","name":"SUCCULENT TREE","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"The bark on this tree is misleading. Neither rough nor hard, its flesh is instead soft and moist to the touch. Wrinkles in the surface store extra water for times of hardship. Provides decorative landscaping opportunities for bases.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.DUSTPLANT03.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.dustplant03.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DUSTPLANT_3_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DUSTPLANT_3_DESCRIPTION","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_DUSTPLANT3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_B_DOUGH","name":"SUGAR DOUGH","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A basic food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. This nutrient paste is the basis for a wide range of biscuit recipes and can be baked as-is, or combined with other nutrient sources for extra flavour.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.DOUGH.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.dough.webp","colour":"#79502e","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_B_DOUGH_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_BISCUIT_DESC_DOUGH","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":5000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_B_DOUGH","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_HOT_COM_L1","name":"SULPHURFISH","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Common Fish","description":"UI_FISH_HOT_COM_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT5.FISH.MEDIUM.1.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product5.fish.medium.1.webp","colour":"#1e8a42","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_COM_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_HOT_COM_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":3000,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_HOT_COM_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"GAS1","name":"SULPHURINE","kind":"Resource","category":"Earth","categoryKey":"Earth","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Compressed Atmospheric Gas","description":"A pungent atmospheric gas. High concentrations are extremely hazardous to organic life. With the aid of specialised machinery, can be extracted from the atmospheres of Scorched and Desert planets.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/GAS.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/gas.3.webp","colour":"#265e3a","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_GAS_1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_GAS_1_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":20,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/GAS1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BUI_HEAD_3","name":"SUMMONER'S HEADGEAR","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Appearance Modification","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override, granted by the Autophage to those who seek to build their own shell. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.HEAD.3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.head.3.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TIP_HEAD_BUI_3_U","descriptionKey":"UI_BUILDER_CUSTOM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BUI_HEAD_3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_LUSH_EPIC_L1","name":"SUNSPINE BASKER","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Rare Fish","description":"UI_FISH_LUSH_EPIC_L_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT.FISH.XL.2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product.fish.xl.2.webp","colour":"#4d2957","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_EPIC_L1_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_LUSH_EPIC_L_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":30000,"level":3,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_LUSH_EPIC_L1","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"F_ODD_RARE_XL","name":"SUNSPOT EEL","kind":"Product","category":"Fish","categoryKey":"Fish","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Uncommon Fish","description":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_XL_DESC","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/FISH/PRODUCT3.FISH.EEL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/fish/product3.fish.eel.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_XL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_FISH_ODD_RARE_XL_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient","Trade good"],"baseValue":20000,"level":2,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/F_ODD_RARE_XL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_ALLOY5","name":"SUPERCONDUCTING FIBRE","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Construction)","description":"A densely layered package of superconducting fibres. Powerful, flexible, and water-resistant; the controlled magnetic weave of these fibres is vital in the creation of many scientific components.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.ALLOY5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.alloy5.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ALLOY_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_ALLOY_5_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":50000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_ALLOY5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"MAINT_TECH3","name":"SUPERCONDUCTIVE LOCK","kind":"Technology","category":"Maintenance","categoryKey":"Maintenance","rarity":"Impossible","subtitle":"Damaged Component","description":"A highly advanced locking device. Damage to the circuits supplying the magnet has caused it to lock permanently.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/MAINTTECH.TECH3.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/mainttech.tech3.webp","colour":"#095c77","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_MAINTAIN_TECH3_DESC","secondary":"Core","tags":["Core technology"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/MAINT_TECH3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"COMPOUND5","name":"SUPERCONDUCTOR","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Manufactured Gas Product","description":"An advanced conductive material, the superconductor further enriches the field-warping power of the Semiconductor. Crafted from Enriched Carbon and Semiconductors.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/COMPOUND.5.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/compound.5.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_COMPOUND_5_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_COMPOUND_5_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":1500000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/COMPOUND5","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRUCK_WHEELS07","name":"SUPERELASTIC WHEELS","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Exocraft Customisation Option","description":"A custom running gear module for a terrestrial vehicle, compatible with the Colossus large Exocraft. Recalibrate Exocraft visuals from the Colossus Geobay.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.TRUCKWHEELS07.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.truckwheels07.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRUCK_WHEELS07_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRUCK_WHEELS_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":[],"baseValue":12300,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRUCK_WHEELS07","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_TRANSLATE2","name":"SUPERIOR TRANSLATOR","kind":"Technology","category":"Suit","categoryKey":"Suit","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Automatic Language Parser","description":"An automatic translation device. It records and parses nearby conversations before running the data through a contextual learning system to determine intended meaning. Parallel language processors enable a greater proportion of recorded speech to be translated.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/AUTOTRANSLATOR.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/autotranslator.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_TRANSLATE2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_TRANSLATE2_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_TRANSLATE2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"OXYPROD3","name":"SUPEROXIDE CRYSTAL","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Concentrated Oxygen Deposit","description":"A para-magnetic form of Oxygen, this rare substance has much to offer in the production of advanced technologies. Requires conversion prior to input into Life Support systems. Direct inhalation is NOT recommended. Synthesised from Oxygen.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.SUPEROXIDE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.superoxide.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_OXYPROD3_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_OXYPROD3_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":5100,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/OXYPROD3","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"SIGNALCHARGE","name":"SURGE BATTERY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Uncommon","subtitle":"High Voltage Energy Pack","description":"A high-powered battery pack, designed to release a significant charge in a short space of time. Used to power the high energy needs of Signal Boosters as they survey planets for distant buildings.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.POWERCELL2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.powercell2.webp","colour":"#f3a923","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_SIGNAL_BATTERY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_SIGNAL_BATTERY_DESC","secondary":"Catalyst","tags":["Craftable","Consumable"],"baseValue":750,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/SIGNALCHARGE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"UT_SURVEY","name":"SURVEY DEVICE","kind":"Technology","category":"Weapon","categoryKey":"Weapon","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Analysis Visor Upgrade","description":"A self-contained circuitry upgrade for the Analysis Visor, adding real-time terrain analysis to the scanning array. Toggle between Visor modes with /. Use Surveying Mode to detect hidden terrain resources.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/TECHNOLOGY/RENDER.BINOCSMOD.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/technology/render.binocsmod.webp","colour":"#2177c8","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCTECHNOLOGYTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UT_SURVEY_NAME","descriptionKey":"UT_SURVEY_DESC","secondary":"Installable","tags":["Upgrade","Catalogue entry"],"baseValue":1,"level":1,"stackMultiplier":null,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/technology/UT_SURVEY","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"EXPD_CAPE17","name":"SURVEYOR'S CAPE","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Unlockable Cape","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override. A robust and well-made covering: waterproof, windproof and designed to keep the wearer protected against anything they may encounter while exploring unmapped worlds. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.S17.RUINCAPE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.s17.ruincape.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_CAPE_S17_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_CAPE_S17_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_CAPE17","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_RAILX","name":"SUSPICIOUS BLAZE JAVELIN MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Banned Blaze Javelin Upgrade","description":"A black-market modification for the Blaze Javelin. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential upgrades include: laser damage and recharge time.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.X.RAILGUN.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.x.railgun.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_RAIL_X_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_RAIL_X_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":320,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_RAILX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_BOLTX","name":"SUSPICIOUS BOLTCASTER MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Banned Boltcaster Upgrade","description":"A black-market modification for the Boltcaster. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential upgrades include: damage output, reload times, clip size and firing rate.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PROCTECH/PROCTECH.X.PROJECTIILE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/proctech/proctech.x.projectiile.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UP_BOLT_X_NAME","descriptionKey":"UP_BOLT_X_DESC","secondary":"Special","tags":["Consumable"],"baseValue":320,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/U_BOLTX","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"HULK_SMUGGLE","name":"SUSPICIOUS CARGO","kind":"Product","category":"Space Salvage","categoryKey":"SpaceSalvage","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Specialist Salvage Material","description":"Still sealed, this is an extremely valuable piece of industrial salvage. Harvested from the decaying remains of a collapsing space hulk. This has been processed at a deep-space outpost, and can be sold on the open market.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.2026.HULK.SMUGGLE.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/products/product.2026.hulk.smuggle.webp","colour":"#1a2733","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_HULK_SMUGGLE_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_HULK_RARE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Craftable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":32000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/HULK_SMUGGLE","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"U_SHIPBLOBX","name":"SUSPICIOUS CYCLOTRON MODULE","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Banned Starship Weapon Upgrade","description":"A black-market modification for the Cyclotron Ballista. Use to begin upgrade installation process. The module is flexible, and exact upgrade statistics are unknown until installation is complete. Potential improvements include: damage out