ynthesis Companion. The physical properties of the orb are forever shifting in strangely rhythmic patterns: temperature, radioactivity and density all fluctuating to an unheard song.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.NEXUSPROP02.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.nexusprop02.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_NEXUSPROP_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_NEXUSPROP_2_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_NEXUS2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BUI_HEAD_13","name":"SYNTHETIC GEK UNIT","kind":"Product","category":"Customisation Part","categoryKey":"CustomisationPart","rarity":"Rare","subtitle":"Autophage Appearance Modification","description":"An exclusive Exosuit Appearance Override, granted by the Autophage to those who seek to build their own shell. Transform the appearance of your Exosuit at an Appearance Modifier.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/ROBOTPARTS/ROBOTPARTS.HEAD.13.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/robotparts/robotparts.head.13.webp","colour":"#8c4b9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TIP_HEAD_BUI_13_U","descriptionKey":"UI_BUILDER_CUSTOM_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":999,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BUI_HEAD_13","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_R_HONEY","name":"SYNTHETIC HONEY","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Edible Product","description":"A refined food product, created in the Nutrient Processor. Food such as this can be highly valuable. It has both the identifying shapes and aromas of an actual food item, in stark contrast with conventional nutrition paste or pellets. Can be consumed as it stands or subj