E DUCT","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decorative Aqueduct","description":"This clear glass aqueduct encloses a perpetually churning supply of 'liquid'. This T-shaped configuration allows for creating branches in duct connections. Weld together with different duct shapes to create mesmerising displays in your base.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL.BUBBLEPIPE_T.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special.bubblepipe_t.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_BUBBLE_PIPE_T_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_BUBBLE_PIPE_T_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":500,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/BASE_BUBPIPE_T","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP48","name":"TAGANON OF GRAVITY","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class explorer benefits from hyperdrive and launcher bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP48.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship48.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_48_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SCIENTIFIC_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP48","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP30","name":"TAHAMA'S LIMITLESS REGRET","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class fighter benefits from damage and manoeuvrability bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.TWITCH.SHIP30.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.twitch.ship30.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_30_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_FIGHTER_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP30","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP56","name":"TAHIKOK ROAMER V","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class hauler benefits from shield and inventory capacity bonuses, and is pre-installed with a selection of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP56.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship56.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_56_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_DROPSHIP_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP56","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"AF_METAL","name":"TAINTED METAL","kind":"Resource","category":"Special","categoryKey":"Special","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Salvaged Scrap","description":"Shredded fragments of a soft, grey metal. Its surface is porous, and when touched it oozes ever-so-slightly. Found in the creaking wreck of a derelict freighter. The space station Scrap Dealer may find this interesting...","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/U4PRODUCTS/PRODUCT.TAINTEDMETAL.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/u4products/product.taintedmetal.webp","colour":"#dedcd1","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCSUBSTANCETABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_AF_METAL_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_AF_METAL_DESC","secondary":"Substance","tags":[],"baseValue":380,"level":null,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/resource/AF_METAL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"FOOD_V_STRIDER","name":"TALL EGGS","kind":"Product","category":"Consumable","categoryKey":"Consumable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Raw Ingredient","description":"An animal byproduct, this nutritious morsel can be easily farmed without harm to the animal that produces it. Process in a Nutrient Processor to generate edible products.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/COOKINGPRODUCTS/PRODUCT.EGG.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/cookingproducts/product.egg.webp","colour":"#e57002","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"FOOD_STRIDER_VEG_NAME","descriptionKey":"FOOD_VEG_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Consumable","Cooking ingredient"],"baseValue":3200,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":10,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/FOOD_V_STRIDER","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BASE_GRASS1","name":"TALL SPIKEGRASS","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Organic Decoration","description":"A tough ornamental grass, suitable for growing in all biomes, soil types, and weather conditions. This variety is characterised by very long, thin blades, covered in very fine hairs.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.GRASS01.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki