","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Flag","description":"A collaboratively designed standard, resulting from the cooperation between several intergalactic guilds. An exclusive buildable base ornament.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.FLAG06B.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.flag06b.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_EXPD_FLAG_06B_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_EXPD_FLAG_06B_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/EXPD_FLAG_06B","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"DECAL_SPOOKATL","name":"UNIVERSAL HEARTBEAT DECAL","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive placeable decal, to add flair and decoration to bases. This decal depicts a hint of the Atlas against a vibrant red sky.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.DECALSPOOKYATLAS.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.decalspookyatlas.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_SPOOKY_ATLAS_NAME","descriptionKey":"BLD_DECAL_P_SPOOKY_ATLAS_DESC","secondary":"BuildingPart","tags":["Craftable"],"baseValue":400,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/DECAL_SPOOKATL","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TWITCH_SHIP63","name":"UNJIWUA'S VOYAGE LO5","kind":"Product","category":"Curiosity","categoryKey":"Curiosity","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Exclusive Spacecraft","description":"An exclusive Starship. This A-class shuttle is a pragmatic, balanced ship, pre-installed with a broad range of technologies and upgrades. Claim this ship to add it to your collection, or Exchange it with your current ship. While on a planet, summon ships from the Quick Menu ().","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/TWITCH.SHIP63.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/twitch.ship63.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_63_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TWIT_SHIP_SHUTTLE_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":[],"baseValue":3000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":1,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TWITCH_SHIP63","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"TRA_MINERALS2","name":"UNREFINED PYRITE GREASE","kind":"Product","category":"Tradeable","categoryKey":"Tradeable","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Trade Goods (Minerals)","description":"Large jars full of pyrite grease. A fat solution with a high mineral content. This grease is highly valued by manufacturing economies, where it's used to keep large machinery oiled and glistening.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/UPDATE3/TRADEPROD.MINERALS2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/update3/tradeprod.minerals2.webp","colour":"#cccccc","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUCTTABLE.MBIN","nameKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_MINERALS_2_NAME","descriptionKey":"UI_TRADE_ITEM_MINERALS_2_DESC","secondary":"Exotic","tags":["Trade good"],"baseValue":6000,"level":0,"stackMultiplier":5,"@id":"https://no-mans-sky.squinchmods.com/asset-wiki/id/item/product/TRA_MINERALS2","@type":"GameAsset"},{"id":"BLD_SHIPBREAK2","name":"UNSALVAGEABLE WRECK","kind":"Product","category":"Building Part","categoryKey":"BuildingPart","rarity":"Common","subtitle":"Decoration","description":"An exclusive buildable base ornament. The shattered remains of a crashed starship, this shell of a ship has rotted beyond the point of any useful salvage.","icon":"TEXTURES/UI/FRONTEND/ICONS/SPECIALSHOP/SPECIAL1.EXPEDITION.SHIPBREAK2.DDS","preview":"/asset-wiki/assets/textures/ui/frontend/icons/specialshop/special1.expedition.shipbreak2.webp","colour":"#2c7c9f","source":"NMS_REALITY_GCPRODUC